\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 In Kopfzeile Namenseintrag 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Turndl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Prolog) [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N nomine domini Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anno nativitatis eiusdem domini Millesimo Quadringentesimo (!, vielm. trecentesimo) septuagesimo sexto die Mercurii xxx mensis Januarii}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 12) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ego Wilhelmus Horboch Alemanus, decretorum doctor minimus et inter dominos meos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Auditores predictos minor, conclusiones seu determinationes aut decisiones infrascriptas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cepi colligere et scribere continuando usque ad annum domini M\u176 \'b0 ccc\u176 \'b0 lxxxi ad Mensem Maii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Text) Decisio Nr. 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima est quod attemptata appellatione pendente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a contrario sensu cum ibi notatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch. \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Decisio Nr. 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prima est, quod attemptata appellacione pendente a diffinitiua post ipsius desertionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non veniunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. quod)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de illa esset pronuntiandum et cognoscendum, De or\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dine] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cogni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tionum], [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Intelleximus et c. Tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 2.10.1, 3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum ibi notatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Es folgen nach der Z\u228 \'e4hlung des verglichenen Drucks Decisiones Nr. 2-40, 45-303, 304bis, 305-360, 362-365, 367-369; (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 370: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De feriis. Item si committatur causa tempore feriarum ob necessitatem hominum introductarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et debuit in valuis maioris ecclesie succedentis loco audientie surrogatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch (s. Druck, Bl [n1]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 53). \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Additionen als Marginalglossen, teils stark beschnitten, zu den Decisiones Nr. 3-220, u.a. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg zu Nr. 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vide quando quis cogitur docere titulum sue possessionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et per Inno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [centem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in c. Ex insinatione superius allegato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.38.3), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quid singulariter nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. Druck, Bl. [d3]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 13-44); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) im Bund- und Fu\u223 \'dfsteg zu Nr. 21: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ymo uidetur, quod requiratur certificacio aduersarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et l. Falsus C. De furtis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 6.2.19) \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Subaudi cum causa, alias non ut in c. Quamuis, De procuratoribus li vi\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 1.19.2) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de quo plene per Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in dicta l. Furioso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 42.1.9) (s. Druck, Bl. [e3]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abschnitte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) im Seitensteg zu Nr. 139: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota secundum aliquos et maxime secundum stilum Cancellarie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia si sciuisset curam non dispensasset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. Druck, Bl. [g9]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 20-43); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg zu Nr. 199: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dubium est, an potestas executoris dati ad prouidendum de beneficio vacante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ita notat dominus Petrus de Ancha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rano] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in c. Si propter, De rescriptis li. vi\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 1.3.10), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vide consilium scriptum in margine speculi in ultimo folio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. Druck, Bl. [i2]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17-letzte Zeile); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) im Seitensteg zu Nr. 220: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quid si est mandatum prouideri de beneficio spectante ad collacionem capituli et singulorum parum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iuncta l. Tutoris ff. De admi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nistratione et periculo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [torum] (D. 26.7.30), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia consilium est voluntatis, non necessitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (abweichend von Additio, s. Druck, Bl. [i7]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Z\u228 \'e4hlungen am Rand, teils beschnitten: (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xvii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 18; (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 26; (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 28; (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxviiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 33; (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxxiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 37; (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 113; (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cxii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 120; (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Cx]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 134; (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Cx]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxvii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 = Nr. 146, [Cx]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxviii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 147; (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cxlix\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 158; (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Clv]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 166, [Clv]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 167; (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [CC]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Clviii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = Nr. 369. \endash  228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
