\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dionysius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]uia nonnulli propter ignorantiam ac intuitu pietatis seu pacis in dei ecclesia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ponende recusant aut saltem differunt obedientiam prestare summo pontifici, domino nostro Felici pape quinto, ad neutralitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et domino Felici pape quinto a dei ecclesia pro uero papa dato et publicato omni scrupulo sublato adherere et obedire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit quidam breuis tractatulus super obediencia prestanda sanctissimo domino nostro Felici pape quinto et super solutione pociorum racionum per aduersarios allegatarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
