\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Consilium vniuersitatis studii Erfordiensis ad dominum archiepiscopum Maguntinum pro sacrosancto Basiliensi Concilio transmissum contra olim Eugenium et contra Neutralitatem principum electorum ad Concilium prouinciale in Asschauenburg nuper in Crastino assumpcionis virginis gloriose inchoatum presenti Anno M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\endash  [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N nomine spiritus sancti Paracliti. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Reuerendissimo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85 }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 domino Theod}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [o]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rico}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 sancte Maguntine sedis archiepiscopo sacrique Romani imperii per Germaniam Archicancellarius}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (!). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nedum per organum venerabilis magistri}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  [Henrici] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lebuing}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , legum doctoris et in decretis licentiati \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 et pacem magnam in ecclesia dei videbunt ad magnificam in hac vita iocunditatem et perpetuam in vita futura felicitatem, quam ipsis et nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (9. August 1440).
