\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Gr\u252 \'fcnwalder}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus contra neutralitatem}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus editus per vicarium Frisingensem Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xl\u176 \'b0 de mense Januarii contra electores et adherentibus eisdem contra sacrum Basiliensem concilium modo assumptus in cardinalem tituli sancti Martini in montibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]uis dabit me in solitudinem (Ier 9,2). Hec uerba locutus est dominus deus per os Jeremie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prophete ix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec breuissima sufficient ad laudem domini nostri Ihesu Christi et sponse eius ecclesie collecta. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Januar 1440).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung aus dem Freisinger Bestand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6606}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -332\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Inhaltswiedergabe s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 niger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gr\u252 \'fcnwalder, S. 43-48; vgl. auch RTA. \u196 \'c4ltere Reihe 15, S. 481f. Anm. 1. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ro\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u223 \'df\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 mann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Marquard Sprenger, S. 362f. Anm. 29; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Herzog Wilhelm III., S. 178f.}

