\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Responsio facta ad cedulam domini legati premissam ex parte Sacri Concilii per Reuerendissimum dominum Archiepiscopum Panormitanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 M]Aximum onus ac humeris meis importabile, Reuerendissimi reuerendique patres, hodierna die}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  michi delatum esse censeo, verendum est, ne cum ipso et sub ipso onere ruam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod omnibus nobis sic laborantibus altissimus donare et concedere dignetur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic est finis responsionis facte cuidam proposicioni in scriptis porrecte in sancta Sinodo Basiliensi per Reuerendissimum dominum legatum per organum Archiepiscopi Panormitani enunciate et successiue in hiis scriptis per eundem Archiepiscopum redacte ad honorem dei et iustificacionem et defensionem ecclesie sue sancte et huius sacri Basiliensis Concilii illam representantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1438). \endash  180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch u.d.T.: Oratio \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Maximum onus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mansi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  30, Sp. 1123-1184; Historia gestorum generalis synodi Basiliensis 1, ed. Ernst von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Birk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Wien 1873 (Monumenta conciliorum generalium seculi decimi quinti. Concilium Basileense. Scriptores 2), S. 1144-1193 (Textl\u252 \'fccke 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 20-179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  entspricht \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Birk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 1191 Z. 26-40). \endash  Lit.: Knut Wolfgang \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Kirche und Konzil bei Nicolaus de Tudeschis (Panormitanus). K\u246 \'f6ln/Graz 1964 (Forschungen zur kirchlichen Rechtsgeschichte und zum Kirchenrecht 4), S. 6f.; Morimichi \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Watanabe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Authority and Consent in Church Government: Panormitanus, Aeneas Sylvius, Cusanus, in: Journal of the History of Ideas 33 (1972), S. 217-236, hier S. 224-228 und Anm. 33.}

