033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pars 12; (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 20) pars 13; (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pars 14; (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pars 15; expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 post electionem secuti domini cardinales videantur in eum taliter consensisse, quod possit dici: Verus papa etc. Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1393).
