\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 127\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo in dedicacione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b: Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo 231 (PD 2, 128; CPPM 1A, 1015). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 128\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In octaua dedicacione. Leccio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Caesarius Arelatensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo 227; CC SL 104 (PD 2, 127). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 129\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 conuersione sancti Pauli sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (25.1.): \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermones suppositii III. Sermones de sanctis, sermo 189; PL 39, 2098-2100 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 CPPM 1A, 974\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In festo kathedre sancti \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (22.2.): \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 130\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 18-253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 16) Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermones suppositii III. Sermones de sanctis, sermo 190; PL 39, 2100-2101 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 CPPM 1A, 975\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); daran (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 16) Sermo 191; PL 39, 2101-2102; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 131\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Maximus Taurinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo 77; CC SL 23, S. 320-322. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 132\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (254\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo Mathie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (24.2.): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Berno Augiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo de sancto Matthias apostolo; BHL Nov. suppl. 5696b; Ludovica \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Radif\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: CALMA 2, S. 375 Nr. 13; Dieter \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Blume\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Bern von Reichenau (1008-1048): Abt, Gelehrter, Biograph. Ein Lebensbild mit Werkverzeichnis sowie Edition und \u220 \'dcbersetzung von Berns \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vita S. Uodalrici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Ostfildern 2008 (Vortr\u228 \'e4ge und Forschungen 52), Nr. 44 S. 107f. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 133\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In A\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 nnuncciatione beate virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (25.3.): \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermones suppositii III. Sermones de sanctis, sermo 194: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 escendens angelus de celo missus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; PL 39, 2105-2107 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 CPPM 1A, 979\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; s. auch 270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr. 142). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Nat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannis baptistae (24.6.)]: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 134\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In die sancto. Sermo beati Maximi episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Maximus Taurinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Hom. 65 (PD 2, 41; CPPM 1B, 5798); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 135\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Hom. 66 (PD 2, 42; CPPM 1B, 5799); daran (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) Hom. 67 (PD 2, 43; CPPM 1B, 5800). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 136\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In octaua sancti \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Johannis baptiste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (1.7.):\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vlchre Zacharias octaua die prolis edite loquitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Zacharias Chrysopolitanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , De concordia evangelistarum I, cap. 4; PL 186, 60C-63A (expl. leicht abweichend). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 137\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die apostolorum Petri et Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (29.6.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Leo I. papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo 82 (PD 2, 46). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 138\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In octaua apostolorum lecciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b [Oct. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Petri et Pauli ap. (6.7.)]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Maximus Taurinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo 68 (PD 2, 47; CPPM 1B, 5801). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 139\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De visione Petri apostoli. Sermo Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermones suppositii I. De scripturis, sermo 101; PL 39, 1939-1941. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 140\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ommemoracione sancti Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b (30.6.): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Johannes Chrysostomus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , De laudibus sancti Pauli, Hom. 3 (PD 2, 53). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 141\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (269\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De decollacione Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [hannis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 bap\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [tiste]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sermo B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [eati] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [hannis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [scopi]\u8249 \'8b (29.8.): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petrus Chrysologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermo 127 (PD 2, 71). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 142\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (270\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In natiuitate S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ancte] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Marie. Sermo beati Augustini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (8.9.): Ps.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sermones suppositii III. Sermones de sanctis, sermo 194; PL 39, 2104-2107 (s. auch 256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr. 133); expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia illa peccatorem, illa edidit innocentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch (PL 39, 2105 Z. 11). Rest der Seite sowie 271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
