\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Invocatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Assit in principio sancta Maria meo. Principium finem medium regat S. M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [aria], (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio lib. 1, (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber primus dyalogorum Gregorii pape vrbis Rome. Libri quator de miraculis sanctorum patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85; (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 2; (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 3; (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 4, \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber 4us dialogorum Gregorii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt quatuor libri dialogorum Gregorii pape Vrbis Rome, scripti per Erhardum Ottenhouer artium liberalium baccalaureum necnon rectorem parochialis ecclesie in Neuching, finiti vero in crastino die conversionis sancti Pauli hora prima post meridiem, anno vero domini millesimo CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vicesimooctavo etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (24. Januar 1428). \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Capitula den B\u252 \'fcchern jeweils vorangestellt. \endash  Druck: PL 77, 149B-429A.}

