\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de officio missae}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de officio dignissimo scilicet de sancta missa et de expositione canonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 determinantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 editus per excellentissimum virum magistrum Hainricum de Hassia sacre theologie doctorem egregium etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quamuis (!) breuis fuerit missa in verbis et ceremoniis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 satis patuit in primo tractatu, ideo sufficiant predicta que dicta sunt. Et sic est finis huius tractatus de officio dignissimo determinante scilicet de ipsa missa et specialiter de exposicione canonis eiusdem editi per excellentissimum magistrum Hainricum de Hassia sacre Theologie doctorem egregium etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rescriptus est iste tractatus per Erhardum Ottenhofer baccalarium artium liberalium nec non rectorem parochialis ecclesie in Neuching. Finitus vero sabbato proximo ante dominicam XLme que in ecclesia dei cantatur Invocauit, hora diei post meridiem quasi tercia Anno domini Mo CCCCo XXVIIIo etc.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (21. Februar 1428).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 An den R\u228 \'e4ndern Notae zum Text. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Messe, S. 517-519 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Zum Verfasser: Thomas\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Hohmann / \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Georg\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Kreuzer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in:\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20  2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 3 (1981), Sp. 763-773.}

