\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus Anglicus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De proprietatibus rerum (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini nostri Ihesu Christi. Prologus in proprietates rerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum proprietates rerum sequantur substancias secundum distinctionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 industria experiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tabula zur pars prima (lib. 1-15, mit Erkl\u228 \'e4rung), darunter Federzeichnung (s.o.); (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Textbeginn lib. 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De proprietatibus itaque et naturis rerum tam spiritualium quam corporalium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 2, (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 3 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut patet in apoplexia et in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // Abbruch in c. 15; (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 liber XV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Explicit decimusquintus liber de proprietatibus rerum per manus Hugonis Custodis in Smalkalden Anno domini Mo CCCo LXXXo VIIIo in die Cinerum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (12. Februar 1388). (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini dei nostri Jhesu Christi. Incipit secunda pars rerum proprietatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, lib. 16 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Descriptis proprietatibus terre et parcium eius in generali restat, adiuuante domino, aliqua hic inserere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 17, (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. XLIX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diptannus est herba medicinalis \u8230 \'85 ubi loquitur de hinnulis ceruorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // Text bricht am Lagenende in lib. 17 c. 49 ab.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Reste eines zweigeteilten Exemplars, erhalten sind von Teil 1: lib. 1 cap. 1-lib. 3 cap. 15; von Teil 2: lib. 16 cap. 1-lib. 17 cap. 49. \endash  Druck: GW 3402-3413; BSB-Ink B 95-B 99. \endash  Ed. (bisher erschienen lib. 1-4, lib. 17): Bartholomaeus Anglicus De proprietatibus rerum, Edition Latine, hrsg. von Christel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /Heinz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /Baudouin \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Van de Abeele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /Iolanda \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ventura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Turnhout 2007, Bd. 1 (De diversis artibus 78 / NS 41), S. 51-53, 69-82, 105-133, 149-164 Z. 34; Bd. 6 (De diversis artibus 79 / NS 42), S. 3-83 Z. 21. \endash  Heinz \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Enzyklop\u228 \'e4die des Bartholom\u228 \'e4us Anglicus. Untersuchungen zur \u220 \'dcberlieferungs- und Rezeptionsgeschichte von \u8222 \'84De proprietatibus rerum\ldblquote . M\u252 \'fcnchen 2000 (M\u252 \'fcnstersche Mittelalter-Schriften 77), zur Hs. (Sigle L 90) S. 80.}

