\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Von anderer Hand: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prefatio in collectionem Nicolai de Cusa de Catholica concordancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  (306\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exposcunt agitata sacri huius\u8249 \'8b Basiliensis concilii, que forte nouitate quadam facile aput eos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. qui) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 modernioribus scribentibus indubiam fidem in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eciam in voluntariis prebent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Kapitel\u252 \'fcbersichten: (306\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pars 1, (308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pars 2, (312\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pars 3. \endash  (315\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pars 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvia facile scienti fundamenta patescere possunt elicienda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quantum minimo ingenio ex alto dabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit secunda pars de Conciliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (410\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pars 3, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ad eternam claritatem tibi et subiectis nostro euo reficiatur in laudem Christi regnantis in secula benedicti. Deo gracia et Marie filio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (468\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finit Collectio de concordancia catholica ex variis veterum approbatis scripturis ad laudem dei omnipotentis, quam ego, Nicolaus de Cusa, decanus sancti Florini Confluentie, decretorum doctor minimus sacro huic Basiliensi concilio cum omni humilitate offero nichil in omnibus uerum aut defendendum pro uero iudicans seu asserens, nisi quod ipsa sacra synodus catholicum et uerum iudicauerit, in omnibus ab omnibus orthodoxis corrigi paratus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
