\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In questione prima de presidencia primo considerandum occurrit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , si queritur, quis concilio aut quis in concilio presidere debeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et synodus nullius efficacie fuit, ut Leo papa ad Theodosium scribit, et aliis multis locis. Deo gracias.
