\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nomen: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D]ominus que pars? Est nomen}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Quia significat substanciam cum qualitate propria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pronomen. \endash  (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Verbum. \endash  (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Adverbium. \endash  (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Participium. \endash  (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Coniunctio. \endash  (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praepositio. \endash  (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Interiectio. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Kolophon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finita est regula ista per me Partholomeum Saurman filium Walmann et Wunderlin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tunc temporis scolaris in Herriden. 1475. 1476 iar. Finis adest operis, mercedis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. mercedem) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 posco laboris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Darunter: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannes Wallman tunc temporis studens in Ingolstatt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
