\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Federproben}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Briefkonzepte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , darunter: (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Briefkonzept, dt.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mein muterliche lieb vnd trew vnd alles, da\u223 \'df ich guet\u658 ? vermag, wi\u223 \'df vonn mir, mein herc\u658 ?en liebe dochter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Valere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. fallere), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nere, flere mentiri nilque tacere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  . . . (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia Nr. 8751). \endash  (217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui iacet in veretro, vix valet oua duo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cgm 809}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; vgl. TPMA 1, S. 332, 5); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Crescunt sermones, vbi conveniunt mulieres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (TPMA 3, S. 371, 569); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde Florista: Autor, vnia, Petros casus, dat opinio soles. Castellas, regio: sic singula. plura notato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Scheuer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 315, V. 583\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 f.}

