\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 E\u8249 \'8bgredietur virga \u8230 \'85 (Is 11,1-3). Ex hac auctoritate et aliis sacre scripture et sanctorum constat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  septem esse \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dona esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (expungiert) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spiritus sancti, que eciam designantur per septem mulieres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non solum trahit ad multiplicem et subtilem cognicionem, sed magis ad pias affecciones. Amen. Amen. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94f\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
