\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Incipit Sermo Bonus de omnibus sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 L}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 \u8249 \'8b}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 audate dominum in sanctis eius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1  (Ps 150,1). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Scribitur psalmo C\u183 \'b7L\u183 \'b7 seu vltimo. Venerabilis Hugo in libro de gaudio mundi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , qui incipit: Spiritus domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ad quam vitam eternam nos perducere dignetur dominus noster Jhesus Christus, qui sine fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et sic est finis huius operis deo gratias. Actum et completum sub anno domini 1438\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
