\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 G\u8249 \'8baudiosissimam celeberrime huius festiuitatis leticiam tripudiantibus animis alacris suscipit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ecclesia quam lumen, quod paratam est ad reuelacionem gencium et gloriam plebis israhelitice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Statim veniet ad templum \u8230 \'85 (Mal 3,1). Malathie 3\u176 \'b0 scripta et transsumptiue in leccione epistolari}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  presentis festiuitatis recitata. Celeberrimi patres, doctores egregii, magistri reuerendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quarumcumque preeminenciarum flosculis adornati in filio intemerate virginis cuius hodiernam purificacionem colimus affectuosis recolendi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt nos tandem in eternum templum per eum presentemur, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

