\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bngelus descendebat (vgl. Io 5,4). Verba ista Johannis v capitulo sunt scripta et ex ewangelio misse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  officii quadragesimalis hodierne diei sunt sumpta, pro recommendacione vero beati Thome sunt introducenda. Reuerendi patres, domini doctores magistrique eximii, in Ihesu Christo visceribus pre aliis merito honorandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et si non in hac ualle miseria tamen in futura gloria quam nobis prestare dignetur Ihesus Christus, virginis Marie filius, qui in sanctis suis in secula seculorum est gloriosus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Factus est sermo iste per fratrem Petrum de Gru\u868 ?ssem anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xxxviii\u176 \'b0 in die sancte Thome de Aquino doctoris in conuentu predicatorum Wienne etc. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  Rest der Spalte und 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
