\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 B]eati pauperes spiritu (Mt 5,3). Scribitur originaliter Matheo 5, transsumptiue vero in presentis festiuitatis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ewangelio. Solempniter et orthodoxi p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [atres], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 doc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tores] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [agistri] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et cuncti in vniuersorum domino metuendi, hodie omnium sanctorum sub una solempnitatis leticia celebramus festivitatem, quam nobis presentis vite occasus et suscepta ab eis pro Christi nomine passio consecrauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod messis albens nostrorum multiplicium meritorum apparente ipso iudice vivorum et mortuorum, per ministeria angelorum colligatur, et per sententiam eiusdem iusti iudicis in horreo celesti feliciter collocemur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Schluss nach Hrabanus Maurus, De laudibus sanctae crucis, lib. 2, cap. 6. Druck: CC CM 100, ed. Michel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Perrin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 239 Z. 46-54).}

