\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur questio disputata per Egregium virum dominum et magistrum Henricum Toke, Canonicum Magdeburgensem, Episcopi Magdeburgensis Ambassiatorem in sacro Basiliensi Concilio 1433\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N nomine domini nostri Ihesu Christi. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur, an ecclesia catholica militans sancta et immaculata sit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 raciones in contrarium hincinde sunt omnes solute incorrigibiliter questionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur dyalogus respondens argumentis contra premissa motis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C\u8249 \'8bontra premissa multipliciter dictum est et primo contra notabile primum dicit opponens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Cur negas papam esse ante Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sit benedictus dominus deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per dominum nostrum Ihesum Christum, qui cum eodem patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit questio disputata per magistrum Henricum Toke, ambassiatorem archiepiscopi Magdeburgensis primatis Alemanie in Concilio Basiliensi Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xxxiii\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
