\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur Questio mota in Concilio Basiliensi, vtrum apostolice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [sedi] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sit subtrahenda potestas executiua. Pro illa questione consideranda sunt infrascripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 13) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P\u8249 \'8bRimo igitur in ista materia supponendum est, quod summus pontifex debet tenere statum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magnificum, gloriosum ac potentissimum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod habeant expensas ab ecclesia dei congruentes tamen et necessarias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 13-192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Allegationes de decreto \u8218 \'82Irritans\lquote : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alia materia, an in decretis Concilii ponenda sit decretum \u8218 \'82Irritans\lquote }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  presertim in collacionibus beneficiorum. Reverendissime pater ac reverendi patres, videtur valde deliberandum, si decretum \u8218 \'82Irritans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  possit poni in collacionibus beneficiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ista dicuntur per modum auisamenti et saluo meliori iudicio vniuscuiusque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
