\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de auctoritate concilii compilatus per Reuerendissimum in Cristo patrem et dominum, dominum Johannem, patriarcham Anthiocenum Basilee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S\u8249 \'8bAcrosancte Generali Sinodo Basiliensi \u8230 \'85 vester deuotus humilis Johannes Anthiocenus patriarcha}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  se ipsum ad vestrorum deuotissimorum operum efficacem continuacionem cum omni deuocione, reuerencia et honore obsequialem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quia nonnulli os suum aperientes in celum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed ei iuxta decretum concilii Constantiensis generalis et alia supradicta obedire tenetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis deo laus de potestate generalis concilii tractatus per dominum Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 patriarcham Antheochem compilatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
