\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I\u8249 \'8bllustrissime princeps et prepotentissime domine. Sancta catholica et vniuersalis ecclesia per sanctam Basiliensem synodum representata}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  legitime, que iuxta sentenciam apostoli ii ad Corintheos 4\u176 \'b0 c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [apitulo]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tribulacionem patitur, sed non angustiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (II Cor 4,8) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum impossibile sit, pariter in solidum eam Ferrarie posse representari. Ad laudem Dei omnipotentis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (28. August 1438). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scriptum die vi februarii anno domini M\u176 \'b0 ccccxxxix\u176 \'b0 Basilee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (6. Februar 1439).
