\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jhesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 E\u8249 \'8bpiscopus et quidam rector curatus (!, vielm. ciuitatis) Parmensis per Romanum pontificum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eorum prelaturis nulla racionabili causa existente priuati ad futurum concilium appellauerunt congregato concilio et in disceptacione posito, an prefata appellacio esset admittenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hec sufficiant ad laudem tocius celestis curie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Disputata fuerunt hec dubia per me Nicolaum de Cecilia, abbatem \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Moniacensem, doctorem minimum, Senis actu ordinarie legentem Anno domini m\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xxvi\u176 \'b0 in die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, vielm. ecclesia) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sancti Marci et ad vestramque partem dubiorum respondit notabilis et mire sciencie vir, dominus Robiacus de Caualcantibus de Florencia, Auditor meus beniuolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
