\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de auctoritate generalium conciliorum collectus per eximium siue canonice professorem Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Grunvalder, vicarium ecclesie Frisingensis, nunc vero cardinalem sancti Martini in montibus, de Bauaria wulgariter nuncupatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d laudem et gloriam domini nostri Jhesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q\u8249 \'8bvantum ad primum secundum ordinem deducam partem affirmatiuam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam hic repeto et resummo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 explicaui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
