\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus super dominicam orationem reuerendi magistri Nicolay de Dinckelspuchel etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\u8249 \'8b (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si quid petieritis \u8230 \'85 (Io 16,23). Crisostimus super illo Matheo septimo: Petite et dabitur uobis (Mt 7,7)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicit: Petite et dabitur uobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 maxime in peticione nostre salutis et beatitudinis sempiterne, quam nobis donare dignetur Jesus Christus, dominus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo 12: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et quia superius dictum fuit in principio exposicionis illius oracionis dominice, quod octaua condicio requisita ad exaudibilitatem oracionis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tandem mereamur videre dominum dominorum in Syon, id est in celesti patria, quo nos perducat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis huius tractatus 1473\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer bis auf Federproben wie auf 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
