\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Seitentitel: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Miracula beate uirginis ex libro octauuo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. 81-116: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De miraculis post eius assumptionem gestis per eam. Actor. Lxxxi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post assumtionem vero suam beatissima virgo multis miraculis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per diuersas orbis partes diuersis quoque temporibus clarificata est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et facie discooperta recedentes rosas diligencius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || (Textabbruch cap. 116). \endash  (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. 118-121: ||\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gratiam recipitur et singulariter mirabilis de cetero in eius oculis habetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quorum multa in hoc eodem opere inferius per diuersa loca pro diuersitate temporum, quibus acta sunt breuiter inseruimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auszug aus lib. 7, cap. 81-116, 118-121; Textverlust zwischen cap. 116 und 118 im Umfang eines halben Doppelbl. (s. Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen zur Lagenformel). \endash  Druck: Vincentius Bellovacensis, Bibliotheca mundi seu speculum quadruplex I-IV. Bd. 4: Speculum historiale. Douai 1624. ND Graz 1965, S. 250-266. URL: http://atilf.atilf.fr/bichard/). \endash  Hardo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hilg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 6 (1987), Sp. 19-42, bes. Sp. 26. \endash  Rudolf K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weigand,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 10 (1999), Sp. 365-369.}

