\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moses Bergamensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Glossae veteris et novi testamenti}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Diuina scriptura quot modis distinguitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ? Quattuor, quoniam quadriformi ratione omnis diuinorum eloquiorum series distinguitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einschub: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Yronica est simulacio, in qua aliud verbis significamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , aliud re ipsa sentimus. Fit autem aut cum laudamus eum, quem vituperare volumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Isidor Hispalensis, Etymologiae, lib. 2, cap. 21, \u167 \'a7 42, ed. PL 82, 139B) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de qua re sancto Gregorius ait: Absit, ut verba diuini oraculi confringam sub regulis Donati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gregorius Magnus, Moralia, Praefatio, cap. 5, ed. PL 75, 516B). \endash  (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einschub: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De viciis apud grammaticos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vicia apud grammaticos dicuntur, que in eloquio uel scriptura uitare debemus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut tam fortiter periit apud Ip[p]onem Scipio quam Utice Cato (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Isidorus Hispalensis, Etymologiae, lib. 1, cap. 32, 34-37, ed. PL 82, 106D, 108A-117A; vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bursill-Hall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Census 208.224.4). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Fortsetzung Moses Bergamensis, Glossae: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De nominibus librorum autenticorum in ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bresith id est Genesis, Elemoth id est Exodus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In prologum librorum biblie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prologus grece, latine prelocutio uel prefacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Desiderii proprium nomen est cuiusdam episcopi familiaris beati Ieronimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut a gracia inchoaret et in graciam terminum poneret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 5654 (Hs. genannt).}

