\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit psalterium a beato Jeronimo de hebreo in latinam linguam translatum. Psalmus Dauid primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Verzeichnis der Rubriken und Initien von Ps 1-150. \endash  (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps 151: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pusillus eram inter fratres meos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et abstuli opprobrium a filiis Israhel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 105,3. Druck: Biblia sacra iuxta Latinam Vulgatam versionem. Bd. 10: Liber psalmorum, ed. Francis Aidan \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Gasquet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Rom 1953, Appendix S. 299). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anno millesimo quadringentesimo sexagesimo octauo rescriptus est liber iste in vigilia sancti Andree apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (29. November 1468). \endash  143a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

