\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Uenerabili viro domino Jacobo de Ienaco Moynaldus solo nomine monachus uel Christi seruus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 laborum impendatis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 oracionum suffragia. Explicit prologus. Incipit breuius continencia librorum biblie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AT: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 L]egislator Moyses mitissimus in populo Israel sic incipit Penthatheucum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : In principio creauit celum et terram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Gn 1,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Notandum est primo, quod tota sacra Scriptura diuiditur in duas partes, scilicet in vetus testamentum et nouum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash  (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) NT: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quatuor ewangelia legem nouam et vnum ewangelium Christi describunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et de premiis, que susceptura est in uita eterna. Et habet xxii capitula. Explicit breuis et compendiosa noticia biblie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
