\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber de exemplis sacre scripture compositus a fratre Nicolao de Hanapis ordinis predicatorum patriarcha Ierosolimitano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 C]reacio rerum fuit ita mirabilis, quod eius noticia non nisi per revelacionem uenire potuit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ad hominem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam nobis concedat ipse verus actor salutis eterne, qui est uia, ueritas et uita, qui uite et mortis habet imperium. Qui cum patre \u8230 \'85 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis per me Georium Abesser tunc temporis habitans in Hurtelbach in vigilia sancti Andree apostoli anno domini etc 146viii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (29. November 1468). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber de exemplis sacre scripture compositus a fratre Nicolao de Hanapis ordinis predicatorum patriarcha Ierosolimitano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand (Anfang 16. Jh.?) Auflistung der Rubriken von Kap. 21, 29-33, 46, 54, 69, 73, 81, 94 103, 117 und 121. \endash  240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Fassung A (ohne Prolog); vgl. Viktor \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Scholderer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The virtutum vitiorumque exempla of Nicolaus Hanapus, in: Gutenberg-Jahrbuch 1936, S. 61f. \endash  Druck: GW M26443-M26459; BSB-Ink N-99-N-106.050. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 2 Nr. 305dc. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 5815 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  Jean \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Destrez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Guy \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fink-Errea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Des manuscrits apparemment dat\u233 \'e9s, in: Scriptorium 12 (1958), S. 56-93, hier S. 78-83. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores Nr. 3094 (Hs. genannt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Distelbrink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bonaventura Nr. 64, S. 96f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia, S. 431*. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits Nr. 1006. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Suppl. Nr. 1006. }

