\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit quidam alius breuis tractatulus super obediencia prestanda sanctissimo domino nostro Felici pape quinto et super solucione \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf19 pociorum racionum per aduersarios allegatarum per Magistrum Dyonisium, doctorem sacre pagine Parisiensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf19 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]Via nonnulli propter ignoranciam ac intuitu pietatis seu pacis in dei ecclesia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et publicato omni scrupulo sublato adherere et obedire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit quidam breuis tractatulus super obediencia prestanda sanctissimo domino nostro Felici pape quinto et super solutione pociorum racionum per aduersarios allegatarum per magistrum Dyonisium, doctorem sacre pagine Parisiensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
