\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus bonus super rebellione olim Eugenii pape iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  necnon neutralitate, scissura et diuisione, quas nonnulli faciunt diuidendo se a corpore Christi mistico, quod est ecclesia katholica et universalis, veraciter in sacro Basiliensi concilio representata, collectus per Reuerendum in Christo patrem et dominum, dominum cardinalem sancti Martini in montibus de Bauaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8249 \'8b}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 uis dabit me in solitudinem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Ier 9,2). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec verba locutus est dominus deus per os Jeremie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prophete ix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec breuissima sufficiant ad laudem domini nostri Ihesu Christi et sponse eius ecclesie collecta. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1440). \endash  333\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
