\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift von Hellers Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit alius bonus tractatus de auctoritate generalium conciliorum per quendam religiosum fratrem ordinis Cartusiensis, sacre theologie professorem compilatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 U\u8249 \'8bIctus modestia imperantis iussionis, cui resistere non licebat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod vobis et ceteris ecclesie filiis, ecclesie sponsus dulcissimus Ihesus Christus concedere dignetur in seculorum secula benedictus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus per quendam religiosum fratrem ordinis Cartusiensis sacre theologie professorem compilatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  362\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
