\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 366\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Zitatensammlung zu Schisma und Haeresie}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (366\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus: Excerpta ex variis operibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Augustinus: Quod magnum sit scismatis malum ad gloriam et ecclesiam: Dixit quidem apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [cap.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ep. 43, \u179 \'b3CPL 262); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item ad Emeritum: Ego cum audio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [cap.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ep. 87, \u179 \'b3CPL 262). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item ad Crispinum: Quia humiliatem nostram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ep. 51, \u179 \'b3CPL 262). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod propter nullos malos homines debent scismata fieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dixit quidem apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [cap.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ep. 43, \u179 \'b3CPL 262) \u8230 \'85 \endash  Weitere Quellenbelege, u.a. Ad catholicos de secta Donatistarum, Libri duo retractionum, De fide ad Petrum sive de regula verae fidei, De civitate dei, Liber quaestionum octoginta trium, In archa Noae, Libri tredecim confessionum. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Schlusszitat: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Augustinus ad Petrum diaconum de fide, c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ap.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [3]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Firmissime tene et nullatenus dubites\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que bona sunt, mala respuant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-Augustinus, De fide ad Petrum, cap. 43, Druck: PL 40, 777).
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Thomas Hibernicus: Manipulus florum
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex manipulo florum in c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [apitulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Z. 26-367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 31) Lemma Ecclesia: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecclesia est quedam fama\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. forma) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iusticie, id est commune ius omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nisi forte nec minus torquatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ecclesia a); es folgen die Eintr\u228 \'e4ge b-g, i, n-o, q, s-t, x. \endash  (367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 32-368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 26) Lemma Fides: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fides appellata est ab eo quod sic. Due sillabe sonant cum dicitur fides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Fides a); es folgen die Eintr\u228 \'e4ge e-h, m, o-p, s, x-y, af, ai, an, ar. \endash  (368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 27-31) Lemma Heresis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quicumque aliter scripturam intelligit quam spiritus sancti sensus efflagitat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Heresis g), gefolgt von Eintrag i (elektronische Ressource: The Electronic \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Manipulus florum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Project, http://web.wlu.ca/history/cnighman/index.html).
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (368\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Isidorus Hispalensis: Libri tres sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I,16)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ysidorus in li\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [bro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de summo bono de ecclesia et heresibus xvi: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Gemina est ecclesie pulchritudo: vna quam hic bene uiuendo consequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut parum saluti locum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, vielm. loci) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 relinquant. Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Druck: PL 83, 571A-573B Nr. 1-10).}

