\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Bl. 369-386) Wasserzeichen:\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 1\plain \f1\expndtw15\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Anker \plain \f1\expndtw15\lang1033\fs20 a/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Herz, Abb. s. WZIS DE5580-Clm6606_370, Motiv WZIS BE4905-PO-32442 (nachgewiesen L\u246 \'f6wen, 1441). \endash  Lagen: (1+II)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 373\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  + (VI+1)\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 386\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Schriftraum: 19-20,5 \u215 \'d7 12-13; 34-38 Zeilen, (386\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) 46 Zeilen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hybrida Formata-Libraria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  bzw. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hybrida Libraria-Currens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  von zwei H\u228 \'e4nden: (Hand 1) 369\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -385\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (Hand 2) 386\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  von der Hand Hellers. Cadellen: (369\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8249 \'8b, (372\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8249 \'8b, (374\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8249 \'8b; ansonsten \u252 \'fcbliche Rubrizierung.}

