\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 369\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -385\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus quod concilium Basiliense non sit translatum vel dissolutum}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit Tractatus continens in se duo puncta videlicet, vtrum sacrum Basiliense Concilium sua auctoritate uel auctoritate olim Eugenii translatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [sit], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 editus in dieta Maguntina per Ambasiatores sacri Basiliensis Conci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lii anno] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xli in mense Maii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (am Rand beschnitten). \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bd ostendendum euidenter, quod sacrum generale Concilium Basiliense vniuersalem ecclesiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  representans non sit translatum vel dissolutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in quibus eciam ipse papa tenetur obedire Concilio, ut hec ex supradictis manifeste nota sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Rede der Gesandten des Basler Konzils vor dem Reichstag zu Mainz 1441. \endash  Druck: RTA. \u196 \'c4ltere Reihe 15, S. 773-800 Nr. 353 (S. 773 Hs. mit Sigle L bezeichnet).}

