\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb195\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kanonistisches Kompendium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gliederung des Decretum Gratiani: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P\u8249 \'8bRima pars dicitur distinctio, que diuiditur in centum et vnam distincciones}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Isto modo in prima parte tractat Gracianus de ministeriis ecclesiasticis et primo de Jure naturali et de consuetudine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secuntur distincciones in effectum quemlibet per se eciam easdem vero secuntur, in qualibet earum nonnulla Archidiaconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P\u8249 \'8brima di[stinctio] concludit, quod eiusdem ter datur intelligi, in quo differant inter se lex}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diuina et humana cum omne, quod fas est nomine diuine uel naturalis legis accipiatur. In hac di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [stinctio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ponitur, qualiter regatur humanum genus intelligens Gracianus prouidere statui vniuersalis ecclesie, compilauit hoc opus de quodam magno compositore decretorum, in quo erant omnia concilia et canones apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post dictatas distincciones et notabilia quedam secuntur nonnulla dicta Archidiaconi in qualibus earum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt penitencie et quelibet per se et consequenter post quamlibet sucessiue secuntur nonnulla Archidiaconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secuntur consecraciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quelibet per se et post utramque secuntur successiue nonnulla Archidiaconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ecclesia Romana catholica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Mit den Kapiteln: (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De eleccione pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De deposicione pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De cardinalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De protestacionibus dominorum Cardinalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Concilium Generale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Summaria et bona cognicio jeiunii sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 E\u8249 \'8bsus autem carnium generaliter prohibitus est in omni Jeiunio et racio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia magis delectabilis et ad humorem luxurie magis ceteris cooperatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec obseruanda sunt in ieiuniis ab ecclesia institutis, ad que omnes communiter obligantur, nisi in eis fuerit aliquod speciale impedimentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Thomas de Aquino, Sum. theol. II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -IIae, q. 147, art. 4 co.), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vt patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 multa in dicto c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [apitulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex parte, De obser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [vatione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [iuniorum] (X 3. 46.1).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kirchenrechtliches Kompendium auf der Grundlage des von Guido de Baisio (Archidiaconus) verfassten Kommentars zum Decretum Gratiani. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2 Nr. 55 S. 186-188.}

