\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit gubernaculum et conseruatorium generalium conciliorum compilatus ex iuribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bd perpetuam conciliorum generalium memoriam ac ipsorum reformacionum fiendarum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ac constitucionum ac statutorum in eisdem ordinandorum auisamenta nonnulla corrigenda, addenda, minuenda per vos pater, Reuerendissime domine Juliane de Cesarinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et ego pauper meipsum vestre beatitudini recommendo semper humillime ad laudem et gloriam diei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et domini nostri Ihesu Christi. Amen. Explicit tractatus pauperis, qui vocatur gubernaculum conciliorum factus admodum predicatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 von der Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  6, S. 139-334. \endash  HISLAMPA. Hispanorum index scriptorum Latinorum medii posteriorisque aevi. Autores latinos peninsulares da \u233 \'e9poca dos descobrimentos (1350-1560), ed. Manuel Cecilio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az y D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Lissabon 1993 (Mare liberum), S. 162; CALMA 1, S. 239 Nr. 14. \endash  Lit.: Ant\u243 \'f3nio Domingues de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sousa Costa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Mestre Andr\u233 \'e9 Dias de Escobar, figura ecum\u233 \'e9nica do s\u233 \'e9culo d\u233 \'e9cimo quinto. Porto/Rom 1967 (Estudos e textos da idade m\u233 \'e9dia e renascimento 2), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 S. 14 (hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung, ohne diese Hs.), 60, 67-78, 203-216, 231-233\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Antonio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Garc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 a y Garc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 a,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Estudios sobre la canon\u237 \'edstica portuguesa medieval. Madrid 1976 (Publicaciones de la Fundaci\u243 \'f3n Universitaria Espa\u241 \'f1ola. Monograf\u237 \'edas 29), S. 139-142; Antony \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Black\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Council and commune. The conciliar movement and the 15th-century heritage. London u.a. 1979, S. 85-91; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sieben\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Traktate, S. 40f. Nr. 15.}

