\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur Auisamenta sacrorum conciliorum generalium per me pauperem scripta, que, si placuerint conciliis, ponantur in practica. Et quia bonus miles Christi fidelissimus dominus Julianus cardinalis sancti Angeli presidens in sacro Basiliensi concilio dignissismus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item quod reuocentur omnes expectatiue per dominum nostrum Eugenium concesse, que non habuerunt effectum, cum sint cause multorum homicidiorum et multorum peccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck (nach dieser Hs.): Concilium Basiliense 1, S. 214-233 Nr. 8, zur Denkschrift hier S. 114f. \endash  CALMA 1, S. 238 Nr. 3. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sousa Costa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Mestre Andr\u233 \'e9 Dias de Escobar (s. 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 S. 60, 67-78, 213-215, 231-233\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

