\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Thomas de Virago aduocatus sacri consistorii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C]arissimi fratres et socii, requisitis a me, ut de auctoritate et potestate concilii vniuersalis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quid sentirem, vobis scriberem, ea de re. Ego, Thomas de Virago, sacri consistorii advocatus, volens amicicie vestre satisfacere, huic rei operam dare censui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et leuius perlecta intelligant submittens me emendacioni sanctissimi domini nostri, domini Eugenii pape quarti et ecclesie ac cuiuslibet me melius sencienti. Deo gracias. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
