\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exhortacio et Instruccio cuiusdam venerabilis Theologi contra contendentem de papatu et est d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [etrus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cardinalis Camaracensis appellatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Presupponitur in hoc negocio, quod hic tangitur, super vnione ecclesie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod sicut in fraudorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. nefandorum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ydolorum cultura omnis malicia est initium et finis, ut legitur Sap. xiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Sap. 14,27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sic scisma in ecclesia Romana est causa et fomentum omnium errorum, qui vigent in Romano populo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Igitur extraxi quasdam questiunculas ex multis questionibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aliis, quas descriptis reperi in libello cuiusdam Theologi editi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. edito) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in primordiis creacionis domini nostri pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Johannis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xxiii super tunc instanti Concilio generali celebrando, prout statutum et ordinatum fuit in generali concilio Pisis celebrato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ista ergo de causa concilii generalis est necessaria, scilicet propter tuam cessionem uel alium modum quemcumque, quo detur pax ecclesie dei, Christi fideles roborentur, fidelium consciencie pacificentur et Christi ouile reformetur. Et hec sufficiant aliis infinitis obmissis questionibus, racionibus et argumentis, que in premissorum verificacione et annuente domino subsequendo execucione reali in eodem suo libello sepedictus venerabilis Theologus eleganter adducit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -294\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 In der Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung Ansbach, SB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ms. lat. 108}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ohne die Zuweisung an Petrus de Alliaco.}

