\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jarson cancellarius Parisiensis de potestate ecclesiastica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui papa dicitur, potestas ordinis, non autem est in minoribus hec potestas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ratus vero dupliciter uel de Jure uel de facto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatulus magis ad inquisicionem veritatis quam ad determinacionem editus et pronuncciatus Constancie prouincie Maguntine tempore generalis concilii pro parte Magistri Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Jarstimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cancellarii ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Parisiensis anno a natiuitate domini M\u176 \'b0 iiii xvii\u176 \'b0 die sexta Februarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
