plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

