\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecclesia parochialis est locus domicilii, vide hic decisi[o] Belle[merae] iiic lxii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Conclusio, quod ecclesia parochialis pro eo quod personalem requirit residenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Decisio Nr. 369 (Druck: Bl. h1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Rest der Seite leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non promocio, ut non inducat vacacionem, quale debeat esse impedimentum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , hic vide deci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Belle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [merae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lxxxiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Am Rand Hellers Bemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota bene decisionem istam, quia bona et multum vtilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Conclusio, quod super hoc an articulus de lite mota contra rectorem parochialis ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Decisio Nr. 83 (Druck: Bl. [d8]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -e1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota tres decisiones bonas Egi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dii] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bellemere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Auditor cui mandatur, quod si inuenerit illum, cuius beneficium est impetratum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Decisio Nr. 176 (Druck: Bl. [f5]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Secunda, quod [in] casu conclusionis proxime precedentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , si talis etc non probauit infra terminum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Decisio Nr. 177 (Druck: Bl. [f5]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -[f6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tertia conclusio, quod non promotus vltima die anni}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , de quo in c. Licet canon et c. Commissa, De electione, li. vi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (VI 1.6.14, 35) \u8230 \'85 Decisio Nr. 178 (Druck: Bl. [f6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 31-37). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota aliam conclusionem Bellemere: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item si priuatus per c. Licet canon obtinuit habilitatem et graciam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 Decisio Nr. 180 (Druck: Bl. [f6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
