1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De cle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [rico] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 percus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [sore], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in c. Continencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (mit Abweichungen; vgl Druck: GW 1729 = BSB-Ink I-319, Bl. gg ii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ); daran 3 Verse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Si bene possideas, da fructus tempore litis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Gotha, ForschungsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 CE 8\u176 \'b0 22}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (364\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De potestate Cardinalis maioris penitentiarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [P]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Otest dominus cardinalis in forma debita eos absoluere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prout iustum fuerit puniendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: S. 123-131). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequuntur casus, qui olim de gratia speciali petebantur, nunc autem per Cardinalem expediuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P]Rimo videlicet absolucio illorum, qui presbyterum, clericum uel quamcumque aliam personam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ecclesiasticam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 litteram confessionalem sine licencia superioris etc concedere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\