\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 An papa dispensare possit contra generale statutum ecclesie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , uide Inno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [centius], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De biga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mis], [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Super eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.21.2) \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si crimen est occultum et non sit tale, quid post peractam penitenciam impediat ordinis execucionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (372\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De opinione et de argumentis: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 169{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Opinio multorum non habencium probabilem rationem non est sequenda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 195\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Argumentum a contrario sensu in iure est ualidum, De hiis, que fi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [unt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a prelatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum apostolic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 a (X 3.10.7), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tentia] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [communicationis], [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.39.28).
