\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Circa materiam publicorum fornicatorum. Attendendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nemo cogitur benefacere, sed prohibetur malefacere secundum leges canonicas xxiii q. v c. Ad fidem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C.23 q.5. c.33), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut boni inter malos viuant quiete, probatur e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [odem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ca. et q., c.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Non] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 frustra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C.23. q.5 c.18) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 circa dispensacionem premissorum et materiam infamie occasionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ipsius contracte, vide repeticionem c. Quesitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wohl X 3.2.10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in secundo folio in viii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  columpna in versiculo Ex premissis capto fundamento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 482a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -483\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
