\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Oracio fratris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [Ambrosii] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 habita in concilio Basiliensi m\u176 \'b0cccc\u176 \'b0xxxv\u176 \'b0 feliciter incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non vereor, patres reuerendissimi ac reliogiosissimi ac doctissimi viri, qui sacrum hoc generale consilium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. concilium) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vestra illustratis presencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cui est vna cum sancto spiritu honor, decus et imperium in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio eiusdem Ambrosii ad significandum Basilee imperatorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si quem forte mouet ex hoc celeberrimo summorum virorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cui est cum patre et spiritu sancto honor, decus et imperium in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
