\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Leonardi Aretini ad Flauium Foroliuensem epistola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Uolo, ut extet opus aliquod studiorum meorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod sit testis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vbi hec omnia diuinitus perscribuntur. Vale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postquam hucvsque scriptum decreui tibi mittere copiam prefacionis, quam libris illis adiungere cogito, vt eam quoque videre possis ac me de tuo iudicio certiorem facere. Iterum vale. Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Florenz, 1. M\u228 \'e4rz 1438). \endash  129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
