\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Marcus Tullius Cicero}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paradoxa stoicorum, cum glossis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber paradosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M. T. C. ad M. Brutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bNimaduerti, Brute, sepe Catonem, auunculum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , cum in senatu sentenciam diceret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed omnia inopes ac pauperes extimandi sunt. Explicit liber paradosorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M. T. C. ad M. Brutum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  Glosse von Hellers Hand: (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum iuxta morem discipline nostre videamus, qui, quasi, de quo, ad quid et quomodo M. T. C. post innumerales laudes, post ciuitatem raptam et obrutam a L. Catilina et nephariis consiliis sonorum eius a M. Antonio et Lucio Pysonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 captus, ergastulo est mancipatus, in quo hoc opusculum, quod in presenciarum habemus, non in mediocri laude composuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vt Anto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nium] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 existimabat, sed eciam animo sapientis et principia ipsa prouerbiis grecorum probabiliora riderentur, effecit M. T. C. de sentenciis paratis ad gloriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Weitere Marginal- und Interlinearglossen von Hellers Hand.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: M. Tulli Ciceronis Scripta quae manserunt omnia 4,3: Continens Libros de officiis, Catonem Maiorem de senectute, Laelium de amicitia, Paradoxa, Timaeum, Fragmenta, recognovit Carl F. W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Leipzig 1879 (Bibliotheca scriptorum Graecorum et Romanorum Teubneriana), S. 197-213.}

