\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Siglen: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bertalot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  wie 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 2; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Furietti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  wie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ; Mazzuconi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  wie 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 2;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Sabbadini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  = Remigio\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Sabbadini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Lettere e orazioni edite e inedite di Gasparino Barzizza, in: Archivio storico lombardo 13 (1886), S. 363-378, 563-583, 825-836.}

