\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 PROBE CENTONE CLARISSIME FOEMINE EXCERPTVM E MARONIS CARMINIBVS AD TESTIMONIUM VETERIS NOVIQUE TES\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [TAMENTI] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 OPVSCVLUM\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Prolog: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 I]Am dudum temerasse duces pia foedera pacis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) AT: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Opera sex dierum et de creacione celi et terre. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Principio celum ac terras camposque liquentes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 pretereo atque aliis post me memoranda relinquo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) NT: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De nouo testamento et de saluatoris natiuitate. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Nunc ad te et tua, magne pater, consulta reuertor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hac casti maneant in religione nepotes. Probe Centone clarissime foemine opusculum foeliciter finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24  \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8060 ? \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2 \u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24  \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: PL 19, 803-818A; CSEL 16,1, S. 569-609; Faltonia Betitia Proba, Cento Vergilianus. Praefatus est Carlo M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lucarini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Ed. Alessia \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fassina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Carlo M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lucarini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Berlin u.a. 2015 (Bibliotheca scriptorum Graecorvm et Romanorum Teubneriana 2017). \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 7009;\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia Nr. 9696;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schaller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 nsgen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 7487; \u179 \'b3CPL 1480; CPPM 2 Nr. 1560; Scripta latina usque ad aetatem Karoli Magni Imp.: Index editionum quae ad usum historicorum maxime adsunt. Collegerunt et recensuerunt Maria Paula \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Guidobaldi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Fabrizio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pesando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rom 1993, S. 135. \endash  Zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung s. Carlo M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lucarini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La tradizione manoscritta del Centone di Proba, in: Hermes 142 (2014), S. 349-370, hier S. 352 (Hs. genannt, Sigle B), S. 368 (Stemma codicum). \endash  Zur Textgattung des Cento s. Faltonia Betitia Proba, Die Heilige Schrift kurz erz\u228 \'e4hlt mit den Worten des Vergil. Cento Vergilianus. \u220 \'dcbers. und kommentiert von Wolfgang \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fels.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Mit einem einleitenden Essay von Katharina \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Greschat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Stuttgart 2017 (Bibliothek der mittellateinischen Literatur 13), S. 82-84.}

