\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In speculo gestorum mundi C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [laudio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ivo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tyberio Imperatore. In fine legitur epistolam Pilati Tiberio missam. Poncius Pilatus Claudio salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nuper accidit et quod ipse probaui, Iudeos per inuidiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  se suosque posteros crudeli damnacione peremisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec aut scripsi ne quis aliter existimaret credendum mendaciis Iudeorum. Pilati Pontii epistola Tiberio missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
