\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lentuli de statura Christi epistola. In annalibus Romanorum reperta incipit. Lentulus Senatui Salutem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Apparuit temporibus nostris et adhuc est homo magne virtutis nominatus Ihesus Christus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et brachia visu delectabilia, in colloquiis gratus, rarus et modestus: Speciosus forma pre filiis hominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 44,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lentuli de statura Christi epistola finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
