\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Albericus philosophus de imaginibus deorum. De Saturno. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Saturnus primus deorum supponebatur et pingebatur ut homo senex canus prolixa barba}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , curuus tristis et pallidus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a sinistro vero erat Apollo, id est sol, suis radiis segetes ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\cf1 s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iccans metendas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u969 \'f9 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -87b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer. 
