\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dyaletica (!) est ars arcium scientia scientiarum ad omnium methadorum (!) principia uiam habens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hec omnia patent in figura sequenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Danach Schema \u252 \'fcber die gegens\u228 \'e4tzlichen Modalausdr\u252 \'fccke in Form eines Logischen Quadrats. \endash  10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Peter of Spain (Petrus Hispanus Portugalensis), Tractatus called afterwards Summule Logicales. First critical edition from the manuscripts with an introduction by Lambert Marie \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 De Rijk.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Assen 1972 (Wijsgerige teksten en studies 22), S. 1-16. \endash  Lit.: Bibliotheca manuscripta Petri Hispani os manuscritos das obras atribu\u237 \'eddas a Pedro Hispano, ed. Jos\u233 \'e9 Francisco \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meirinhos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Lissabon 2011 (Textos Universit\u225 \'e1rios de Ciencias Sociais e Humanas, S. 261 (Hs. genannt); Medieval Logical Manuscripts. Researchproject of Lambert Marie \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de Rijk\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  and Egbert P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (URL: http://mlm.huygensinstituut.nl/bibliographical_item/index, Hs. genannt).}

