\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa inicium de\u8249 \'8b claue intencionum queritur, utrum intencio sit aliquid}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et arguitur primo quod sit nihil. Argumentatur, quia si esset aliquid uel haberet ex se esse uel ex alio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si non, talis habitudo non est aliquid, tunc eciam talis intencio non est aliquid. Et tunc de ista questione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Basel, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 F. VI. 67}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; vgl. Aristotelica Helvetica. Catalogus codicum latinorum in bibliothecis Confederationis Helveticae asservatorum quibus versiones expositionesque operum Aristotelis continentur, bearb. von Charles H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lohr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Freiburg i. Ue. 1994 (Scrinium Friburgense. Sonderband 6), S. 119 (Schluss abweichend). \endash  Aberystwyth, National Library of Wales, 2050.B, 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; vgl. Charles H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lohr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Aristotelica Britannica, in: Philosophie und Theologie 53 (1978), S. 79-101, hier S. 83 (f\u252 \'fchrt Textschluss von Udalricus Viennensis, De clave intentionum an, s.u. 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

