\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hervaeus Natalis (?)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius ad tractatum De clave intentionum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 9-48) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b[{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]uatinus introitus loyce cuius\u8249 \'8b Circa istum libellum De claue intencionum possunt omnia generalia recitari}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que recitantur circa alios libros loyce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed causa efficiens dicitur fuisse quidam magister Parisiensis nomine Erpheus, qui presentem libellum compilavit pro introductione ad noticiam Porphyrii et Predicamentorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 49-24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo est dicendum\u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85 Hic incipit tractatus istius libelli, in qua prosequitur suum intentum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , et diuiditur in quattuor capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et tantum de ista questione. Et sic est finis huius questionis cum dictamine intencionum, cui adheret pro quo sicut deus gloriosus en\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [s] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 entium incommutabile bonum cum matre eius gloriosa virgine intemerata in secula seculorum sit benedictus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Teiled. der Bll. 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 54 (nach Hs. Uppsala, s.u.): Studium Upsalense. Specimens of the oldest lecture notes taken in the Mediaeval University of Uppsala, ed. Anders \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Piltz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Uppsala 1977 (Acta universitatis Upsalensis 36), S. 303-309 Z. 222. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Uppsala, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 C 629}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. 4007}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (vgl. Repertorium commentariorum medii aevi in Aristotelem Latinorum quae in bibliothecis Wiennae asservantur, ed.\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20  Mieczys\u322 \'b3aw \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Markowski\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Breslau 1985, S. 180f.).}

