\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P]roposicio est oratio affirmativa uel negativa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (nachtr\u228 \'e4glich \u252 \'fcbergeschrieben) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alicuius de aliquo vel alicuius ab aliquo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 21-24) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et quia Aristoteles in Prioribus ostendit coniugationes esse inutiles}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , in quibus non sunt conclusio ex premissis per inventionem terminorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ideo utilis est invencio talium terminorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 De Rijk,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 S. 43-53 Z. 14. \endash  (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Textzusatz 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ubicumque enim fiat invtilis coniugatio contra regulas sillogismorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prius datas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui est extraneum utriusque et ita dicetur de aliis modo suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nunc restat dicere de potestatibus sillogismorum, quas Aristoteles in secundo Priorum assignat sex, que comuniter hic solent nominari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et de potestatibus sillogismorum dicta sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .. \endash  (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8-19) Textzusatz 2: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De] istis potestatibus dicendum est de peccatis siue de factis contingentibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  circa illas potestates et sunt tria peccata scilicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Peticio principii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non propter hoc accidere falsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fallacia contrarie oppinionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia in eo preceditur ex contrarie aut contradictorie oppositis ad condicionem indiuidualem de se ipso negantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: GW M32402 = BSB-Ink I-586, Bl. c5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -d2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Zum Textzusatz 1 vgl. Carl von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Prantl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geschichte der Logik im Abendlande. Bd. 3. Leipzig 1867, S. 49f., Anm. 189; Bd. 4. Leipzig 1870, S. 215, Anm. 220.}

