\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Fecana, Cageti, daffenes \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b (Grabmann, Werke, S. 37, 243). Vnde in hiis sex primis dictionibus per vocalem tercie sillabe}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  designatur qualis et quanta sit conclusio inferenda videlicet per \u8250 \'9ba\u8249 \'8b conclusio vniversalis affirmatiua, per \u8250 \'9be\u8249 \'8b vniversalis negatiua, per \u8250 \'9bI\u8249 \'8b particularis affirmatiua, per \u8250 \'9bo\u8249 \'8b particularis negatiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut illa uel consimilis oratio: homo est azinus. Et tantum de inuencione medium probatiuum. Sequitur de potestatibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
