\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus I: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Proposicio kathegorica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 7-15), \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ypotetica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 16-17); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Equiwolencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) (\u167 \'a7 18, 24); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Proposicio modalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 19-23, 25). \endash  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus II: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vniuersale, Predicabile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 1); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inquid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Species\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 8-11), \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Numero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 3, 17); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Essenciale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 12-14), \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Accentuale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 15-16). \endash  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tercius tractatus Petri Hispani diuiditur primo in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ante predicamentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Couenienciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 differentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ordinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Tract. 2, \u167 \'a7 17-19); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Predicamentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ens in se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vel ens in alio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Tract. 2, \u167 \'a7 20-tract. 3, \u167 \'a7 26); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Post Predicamentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vel fieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 27-32). \endash  (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus IV: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sylogismus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 formalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 3), \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Componencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 regulatiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reductiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 probatiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Merkvers zu Aristoteles, Organon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Barbara, Celarent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia Nr. 2068). \endash  (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus V: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Locus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 locus maxima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 locus differentia maxima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u167 \'a7 4-36). \endash  132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
