\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx2790\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus VI. Prolog: \u8250 \'9b[{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 E]ssencia est una\u8249 \'8b apud omnes. Doctrine vero alie et alie sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Hec propositio scribitur a venerabili Alberto magno in commento suo prime periermenias. Que proposicio probatur ad vtramque partem quo ad primam partem sic probatur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste est tractatus magistri Petri Hispani, in quo quidem tractatu ponitur sciencia siue noticia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ipsa supposicionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ideo tractatus iste diuiditur in tres partes principales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questio prohemialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vtrum de supposicione sit sciencia. Quod non, arguitur primo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Sciencia est habitus per demonstracionem acquisitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. An. Post. II, 3, 90b 9-10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Supposicio non est conclusio igitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus VIII. \endash  (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus IX. \endash  (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus X. \endash  (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus XI. \endash  (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus I: \u8250 \'9b[{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D]yalectica est ars arcium\u8249 \'8b (\u167 \'a7 1). Ista est summula magistri Petri Hispani nationis Castelle}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Et notanter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dico summula, quia hic non traditur sciencia loyce, sed hic dantur in summula conclusiones quedam sine causis et racionibus siue probacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 constat autem breuiter attencionem reddere auditorem. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tractatus II.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

