\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Studentibus uenerabilem Albertum occurrere solent tria puncta precipue}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quantenus multi illaqueantur. Ideo eorundem exprimam iuxta meum ingenium salubrem interfectum, quem doctor iste habet in libris, in quibus loquitur secundum mentem propriam et non secundum mentem peripatheticorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ecce stoicum purum ponem huius separatum esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

