\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit directorium per dominum Johannem de Aurbach egregium doctorem decretorum compositum pro instructione simplicium presbyterorum in Cura animarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 105\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad laudem dei animarum salutem curatorumque}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 106\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De practica, modis et instructionibus quibus vti et se habere possit seu debeat confessor in audicione confessionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Concertacioni antique\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 2.15.8). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis deo laus virginique gloriose deo gratias. Explicit directorium per dominum Johannem de Awrbach Egregium doctorem Compositum pro instructione simplicium presbyterorum In Cura animarum finitum in vigilia sancti Jacobi apostoli xxiiii mensis Julii Anno domini Millesimo quadringentesimo quinquagesimo quinto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (24. Juli 1455). \endash  236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
