\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 134\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (349\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus, in quibus quis excluditur a communione sacra.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primus est, qui alieno sacerdoti ecclesia execucionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , id est curam animarum actu habenti confitentur absque proprii sacerdotis licencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item omnes in peccatis mortalibus existentes, id est qui non sunt confessi neque contriti de peccatis, de conse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cratione], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [stinctio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ii Sicut Iudas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (De cons. D.2 c. 68). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 135\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (351\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Casus, in quibus quis excluditur a sacra communione.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo excluduntur omnes, qui non confitentur peccata sua iuxta statutum ecclesie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod incipit: Omnis vtriusque sexus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5. 38.12), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hoc est semel in anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (39) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item raptores obstinati et inobedientes excluduntur a communione sacra quousque peniteant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  353\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 136\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prohibiciones a communione sacra secundum sanctorum patrum sancciones, canones siue statuta infra per ordinem destribuntur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 omnes infideles, qui non habent communionem cum sancta ecclesia catholica}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , prout sunt iudei, sarraceni et heretici, a communione sacra prohiberi debent \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (43) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item quilibet proprius sacerdos potest filium confessionis sue considerata grauitate siue magnitudine ipsius peccati ad tempus a communione sacra suspendere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicte prohibiciones sunt collecte et concepte ex sacris canonibus per me Johannem Heller, in utroque iure doctorem, canonicum ecclesie Frisingensis et ad requisicionem Reuerendissi in Christo patris et domini, domini Johannis dignissimi presulis ecclesie Eystetensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  357\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -361\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Textliche \u220 \'dcbereinstimmmungen mit: BSB-Ink S-556, Bl. 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (= Bl. d5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -d8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

