\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -384\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Heller}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones synodales IV (Sermones in Cena domini)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 145\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo in cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Prolog: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Robet seipsum homo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (I Cor 11,28). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Beatus Bernhardus in ome}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [lia]}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 super sermone de cena}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominica docens nos attentos et deuotos esse in audicione verbi dei precipue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) Hauptteil: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Probet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Beatus Paulus volens nos cautos reddere tangit in verbis propositis duo nobis obseruanda circa ewkaristie sacramentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui manducat hunc panem probatus reuerenter et digne prout prediximus, viuet in eternum. Quod ipse nobis prestare dignetur, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 146\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (378\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius sermo in cena domini.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prolog:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec locutus sum vobis (Io 16,33). Et in sermone domini post vltimam suam sacratissimam cenam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (378\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 35) Hauptteil: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Saluator noster, rex pacificus, multipliciter inter alia dona hominibus pacem precipit verboque et exemplo commendat dicens: Habete pacem inter vos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. I Th 5,13) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui est pax nostra faciens vtraque vnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Eph 2,14), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  384\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -385\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx12825\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Synodalpredigten \u252 \'fcber die Hl. Kommunion; Predigt Nr. 146, die auch in dem aus Emmeram stammenden Clm 14090, 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u252 \'fcberliefert ist, hielt Heller zwei Jahre vor seinem Tod 1473 vor dem Freisinger Klerus (\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 fecit ad clerum Frisingensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8230 \'85). Vgl. auch Synodalpredigten Nr. 120-122 sowie die Einleitung, Kap. I.1.3.3, S. 14.}

