\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Abbates}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8249 \'8b (Clem. 1.2.1). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Glo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [sa] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 summat et diuidit. Clem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [entina] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 diuiditur in duas, quia primo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [ponitur] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 duplex prohibicio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , 2\u176 \'b0 duplex pena. Vna iuris, alia hominis, 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ibi \u8218 \'82Si quis autem\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Tit. 2.1, (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) mit Korrekturanweisung \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va-cat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , rot und braun, f\u252 \'fcr Text nach \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 cura principaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Z. 7) und vor \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 siue in consequenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Z. 51); zum Textbestand vgl. auch Druck, Bl. [o5]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 48f., der den zu tilgenden Zusatz in vorliegender Hs. nicht enth\u228 \'e4lt .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Tit. 11.2, (271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vltimo glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [sator] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 finem operi suo imponens, adaptando se ad proxime dicta, inuocat diuinum auxilium dicens \u8218 \'82natura naturans\lquote , hoc est ipse deus, cum ad illum redibimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes de Lignano}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Lectura in Clem. 5.11.2}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Habetis expeditam Clem[entinam] in apparatu suo et hic communiter scribunt docto[res}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ]. [Pro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Clariori tamen intelligencia tex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [tu] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et eorum, que predicta sunt, reassumit Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [annes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de Ligna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [no] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 questionem principalem textus seu illi similem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 illud tollere sine causa esset contra ius et naturalem equitatem. Casus est ff. Depositi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [vel contra], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 l. Bona fides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (D. 16.3.31). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sic est finis huius Cle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [mentinae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et eciam totius libri Clementinarum. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Clem. 1.2.1-5.11.2. \endash  Capitula h\u228 \'e4ufig mit Subscriptiones versehen. \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW M14095 = BSB-Ink I-454. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 296-298 (Hs. genannt S. 298 Anm. 18); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 236-242, hier S. 241 (Hs. genannt); Scotland under \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Jus commune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Census of manuscripts of legal literature in Scotland, mainly between 1500 and 1660. Bd. 3, ed. Gero \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dolezalek\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Edinburgh 2010 (Publications of the Stair Society 57), S. 12; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lange/Kriechbaum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 807-812; Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r359 No. 1e (Hs. genannt).}

