\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 1: (Rubrik) Anfang defekt; ||\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 q. ii desponsatam licet matrimonium de presenti non dissolueretur per ordinis sacri suscepcionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 16) Marginalglosse Hellers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item hec addicio que incipit Dic breuissime etc. non est domini Angeli de Castro, sed mei Johannis Heller, et durat vsque ad \u167 \'a7 Qualiter autem circa finem huius Rubrice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 51). \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De Francia\u8249 \'8b (X 4.1.1) Matrimonium consensu contrahitur licet consuetudo patrie non seruetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dream] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uel aliter post matrimonium cum vna contractum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lex quidem erat in Francia, quod matrimonium cum certis solempnitatibus debeat celebrari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 21.4, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quorum dicta per superiora seorsum remanent declarata. Angelus de Castro vtriusque iuris. Deo gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Von der Hand des Johannes Heller: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Heller arcium et vtriusque iuris doctor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 X 4.1.1-21.4. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: T\u252 \'fcbingen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Mc 13}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash   Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  GQ 2, S. 331; Giuliana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D'Amelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , in: DBI 22 (1979), S. 223-225 (auch zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung, Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iohannes Heller, S. 85f. und Tav. II.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 Einschub: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Angelus de Castro: Kommentar zu den Verwandtschaftsgraden \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad arborem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quid sit affinitas? Vnde dicatur: An sit impedimentum perpetuum? Quot sint affinitatis genera}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quomodo cognoscantur?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 subdo tantam primo figuram ipsius arboris affinitatis. Iam declaram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || wohl Textabbruch; 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer, wohl f\u252 \'fcr schematische Darstellung des Arbor affinitatis. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Arbor ista consanguinitatis adinuenta fuit, ut consanguinitas alicuius posset ad oculum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  demonstrari, scilicet quoto gradu consanguinitatis de iure ciuili uel canonico duo inter se attineant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 usque ad quem gradum velit illum haberi pro consanguineo secundum Flor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ianum de Sancto Petro], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic in prima questione in fine. Angelus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schadt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Darstellungen, S. 198 Anm. 21 (Hs. genannt), S. 216-218, bes. 217 Anm. 153.}

