\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus legitimacionum domini Anthonii Rosellis de Arecio iuris utriusque monarche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (Prolog) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 N\u8249 \'8baturalium ius multis legum editoribus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. doctoribus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non cognitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De causa efficienti Rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Incipienti igitur michi exponere iura legitimationum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ita intelligatur vniuersa naturalium materia. Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Compositus iste libellus per An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [tonium]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  olim dominum Roselli de Arecio anno M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 vii\u176 \'b0 in secundo anno doctoratus eius et in xxvii anno etatis sue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (1407). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Johannes Heller vtriusque iuris doctor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
