\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Lignano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de censura ecclesiastica}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Tractatus de censura ecclesiastica Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [hannis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de Lignano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ncipit tractatus de censura ecclesiastica compilatus per dominum Johannem de Lignano de Mediolano excellentissimum Juris doctorem M\u176 \'b0 ccclxi\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 I\u8249 \'8bN tractatu de censura ecclesiastica et primo describam censuram ecclesiasticam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Irca primum dico quod censura ecclesiastica est spiritualis pena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 non fingitur retro excommunicatus, eo ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [tulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Licet li\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [bro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 VI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (VI 5.11.14), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Solet ibi textus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (VI 5.11.2). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hunc tractatum de sentencia excommunicacionis expleui breuiando quanto plus potui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quasi lamberinthum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tendere nosceretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (auch in: Dillingen, StudienB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 XV 47}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; Eichst\u228 \'e4tt, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Cod. st 478}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; T\u252 \'fcbingen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Mc 13}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: TUI 14, 307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 -325\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  Lit. (diese Hs. selten ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , GQ 2, S. 261; John P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 McCall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , The writing of John of Legnano, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Traditio 23 (1967), S. 415-437, hier S. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 420f. Nr. 6, 433\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Egidio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gianazza\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , La vita e le opere di Giovanni da Legnano (Sec. XIV). Parabiago 1975, S. 109-111; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . / Giorgio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D'Ilario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Vita e opere di Giovanni da Legnano. Legnano 1983 (Arte e storia 4), 83f. (zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung), S. 149-160 (zum Inhalt).}

