\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Lignano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestio de interdicto ecclesiastico. Mit Tabula remissoria}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sequitur videre de ecclesiastico interdicto. Uerum quia nuperrime compilatus fuit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et publicatus tractatus de ecclesiastico interdicto in studio Bononiensi per profunde sciencie virum dominum Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Calderinum decretorum doctorem eximium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum non sit dissonum discrasiam iuristarum complexionem excedentem excessiua medela funditus abolere. Explicit questio disputata per do\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [minum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Johannem de Lignano de Mediolano vtriusque iuris eximium doctorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tabula remissoria: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Irca ecclesiasticum interdictum, vt premisi tradendo tabulam remissoriam, primo de significacione huius verbi, an videlicet contineatur sub censura ecclesiastica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quod interdictus quantumcumque appellet, si medio tempore se in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -|| Textabbruch.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
