\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ec sunt, que de iudiciis frequentantur et fiunt. Nam primo aditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. aus additur) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iudex competens, citatur reus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod si actor plene non probat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vincit absolutus reus, vt C. de eden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [do], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 l. Qui accusare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 2.1.4) (mit Zusatz) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et probatur in l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ege] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nali] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C. de rei vin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dicatione] (C. 3.32.28) \u8230 \'85 \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de ordine iudiciorum compositus per Bartolum de Saxoferrato. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
