\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Perpendimus\u8249 \'8b. Difficilis in textu, quo ad casus posicionem difficilima (!) et intricatissima in materia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 repetitum per me Franciscum de Zabarellis iuris utriusque doctorem 1394 mense Nouembris in felici studio Paduano. Deo gracias. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit Repeticio Francisci de Zabarellis super c. Perpendimus per me Ambrosium Bertuldi de Rochelicz anno domini Mccccxxvii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1427). \endash  324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In repeticione c. Perpendimus hec inter cetera discutiuntur, plura tamen alia notanda et singularia interferuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, inferuntur?): Verzeichnis der quaestiones, Textabbruch bei q. 38: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 an tunc ligatur statuens uel eius superior si contra veniat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ||.
