\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 1 (Rubrik) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postulato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 suffragio, ut offendatur per ordinem fuisse in volumine obseruatum, continueada est rubrica ad precedencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 E\u8249 \'8bt laici (X 3.1.1). Hoc intendit, ut laici coram}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u252 \'fcbergeschrieben: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prope\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 altare vel in choro, dum diuina celebrantur, morari non debent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 50.10, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in cuius finem altissimus nos et omnes alios tam presentes quam posteros sciencie insistentes dirigat in suam ineffabilem clemenciam. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gratias. Finis huius anno etc lxx\u176 \'b0 die vero ix Augusti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9. August 1470). \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 338\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -340\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bis auf {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. Ausstattung) leer.
