\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt postille super ewangelia dominicalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  Nr. 1: (Prothema) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bduentum domini recolentes, scientes eum venisse in carne}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro salute nostrarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 H\u8249 \'8bodie sancta mater ecclesia incipit officium diuinum, in quo Christo sponso suo laudes decantat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut nobis in vltimo aduentu dicat feliciter: Venite benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 2-14; (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 15, wahrscheinlich unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, da das Thema sowie Bl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 19\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  der mittelalterlichen Foliierung fehlen; (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 16-63; zwischen Bl. 89 und 90 ein Bl. entfernt, wohl Textverlust, da Nr. 64 fehlt; (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 65-70; (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 71: (Prothema) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica xxiiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ominus euidens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 signum, quo milites sui ad eternum regnum electi cognoscentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica precedenti Christus docuit suos fore prouidos suos contra malignantium insultus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que tanta et talia operatur habentes ergo filiam, id est animam peccatis mortuam. Rogemus dominum, ut manum gratie sue imponat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; daran Leseanweisung. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit postilla ewangeliorum dominicalium per circulum anni et quorundam aliorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
