genformel); (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 14: [Philippus et Iacobus ap.] Textanfang defekt, 1 Bl. fehlt, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et propinat eis eternam dampnacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Nr. 15: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De inuencione sancte crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 16: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Johanne baptista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 17: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Petro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 18: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Paulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 19: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta Margaretha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 20: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta Maria Magdalena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 21: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Jacobo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ille, inquit, fecit eum decollari in die parasceue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || wohl Textabbruch, 1. Bl. von Lage 14 fehlt (s. Lagenformel); (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 23: [Laurentius m.], expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui eo w\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lt in filium dei adoptari, quia ipse dominus dicit: Ego diligentes me diligo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Prv 8,17); Nr. 24: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Assumpcione beate virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 25: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Bartholomeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 26: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Augustino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 27: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De natiuitate sancte Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 28: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Exaltacione sancte crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 29: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Matheo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 30: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Angelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 32: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Symonis et Jude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 33: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De omnibus sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nicht bei Schneyer: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 V\u8249 \'8bidi turbam magnam (Apc 7,9-10). Ita legitur in Apokalipsi [et] in psalmo: Laudate dominum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in sanctis eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 150,1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ideo congruum est v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [erbum]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In omni festiuitate sanctorum ad laudem dei aliquod predicetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ergo consorcium nos perducat dominus, ut simul cum eis laudamus deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nicht bei Schneyer: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De animabus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Miseremini mei (Iob 19,21). Heri apud nos legacionem omnium sanctorum, qui in celis sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et faciunt tria: Primo implorant auxilium, secundo allegant auxiliandi debitum, iii\u176 \'b0 exponunt necessitatis articulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ab hac percussione custodiat nos Iesus Christus, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Auch in: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 4\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 878}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 34: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 36: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta Katherina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nicht bei Schneyer: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Martino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Benediccionem omnium gencium (Sir 44,25). Thema istud optime conventi beato Martino}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo enim fuit miles inter laycos, deinde abbas inter monachos, deinde episcopus inter clericos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde \u8218 \'82O sanctissima anima etc\lquote  vsque \u8218 \'82Amisit has\lquote , enim benedicciones det nobis pater et filius et spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Auch in: M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 4\u176 \'b0 Cod. ms. 878, 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auch u.d.T. Viridarius de Sanctis. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 5, S. 673-677 (Thomas Cisterciensis, auch Thomas de Valcellis, als Verfasser nicht gesichert). \endash  Die hier \u252 \'fcberlieferten Predigten weisen gelegentlich abweichende Textschl\u252 \'fcsse auf; bei Nr. 8-10, 15, 19, 27 und 34 fehlt jeweils das Prothema.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Siboto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 194: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Thoma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scitote, quoniam mirificauit (Ps 4,4). In honore[m] sancti Thome potest hoc thema dici: Mirificauit enim}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , id est mirabilem fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [deus]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  beatum Thomam tripliciter: In vita, in doctrina, in miraculis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 propter hec omnia dici potest in persona beati Thome illud Sapiencie vii\u176 \'b0: In conspectu po\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tentium] [ad]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mir\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [abilis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Sap 8,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rogemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 5, S. 415.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Anonymus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 103: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In illo t[empore] \u8230 \'85 (Mt 16,24). Saluator noster ammonet nos, id est docet, ut relinquamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vicia et peccata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut mereamur peruenire ad gaudia eterna ipso adiuuante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 106: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 107: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 108: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nemo accendit lucernam (Mt 5,15). Si aliquis homo secundum litteram accendit lucernam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut mereamur secum sine fine gaudere ipso adiuuante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 9, S. 155f. \endash  Daran zwei Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Von der Schreiberhand: Conversio Catharinae v.m.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota legitur de sancta Katherina, que fuerit filia Costi regis vnica, qui gentilis erat sicut et ipsa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et predicauit Christum crucifixum vnum esse deum et sic conuersa fuit ad Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Br\u252 \'fcnn, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Cerr II, \u269 \'e8. 95}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 , 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 CC 3}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Mattsee, KollegiatstiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 75 (41)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Michaelbeuern, StiftsB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Man. cart 14}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[5].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 77}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[6].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 95}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Von anderer zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota de lege. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quia sine lege non debet esse aliqua creatura, vnde dominus cunctis rebus legem statuit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi sunt multa sana consilia et legum obseruacio debita\p