\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestiones de conceptione immaculata BMV et de incarnatione}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tres sunt mortes: mors peccati, mors carnis, mors eterni supplicii. Tres sunt paradysi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : vna celestis, altera terrestris et alia sancta ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui poterit mundum contempnere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guilelmus de Wara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q\u8249 \'8bueritur vtrum beata virgo fuerit concepta in originali peccato et videtur quod sic}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Damascenus libro 3\u176 \'b0: Spiritus sanctus venit super eam purgans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod sit sanctitas in relacione ad aliud, non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 habito respectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad peccatum veniale, sed habito respectu ad sanctitatem presentem uel futuram. Et terminatur questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guilelmus de Wara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 V\u8249 \'8btrum filius dei incarnatus fuisset, si homo non peccasset}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Videtur, quod non. Alexander\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Neckam] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 super Cantica hic 1\u176 \'b0, c.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [2]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 6: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Nisi precessisset culpa, non esset natura diuina humane vnita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sed quia homo non posset perfecte beatificari, nisi incarnatus fuisset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Nr. 2) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Gulielmi Guarrae, Ioannis Duns Scotus, Petri Aureoli quaestiones disputatae de immaculata conceptione beatae Mariae virginis. Qaracchi 1904 (Bibliotheca Franciscana scholastica Medii Aevi 3), S. 1-11, hier S. 1-9 (mit K\u252 \'fcrzungen, Umstellungen und Interpolationen); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 vgl. auch \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Anneliese \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Literaturhistorische Notizen \u252 \'fcber P. Aureoli, Durandus und den \u8222 \'84Cancellarius\ldblquote  nach der Handschrift Ripoll 77bis in Barcelona, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Ausgehendes Mittelalter 1. Rom 1964 (Storia e letteratura 97), S. 139-173, hier S. 165f. \endash  (Nr. 3) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: Jean-M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bissen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Question in\u233 \'e9dite de Guillaume de Ware O.F.M. sur le motif de l\rquote incarnation, in: \u201 \'c9tudes Franciscaines 46 (1934), S. 218-222, hier S. 219-222 Z. 27 (mit K\u252 \'fcrzungen und Umstellungen).}

