\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Tudeschis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super secunda parte secundi libri Decretalium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 25 (Rubrik) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Viso de iure actorum, quo muniuntur ut lanceis seu gladiis, merito subicitur de iure reorum, quo muniuntur ut clippeus vel aliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D\u8249 \'8benique (X 2.25.1). Casus. Si testis de crimine contra eum exceptio (!, vielm. excepto) conuincitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vel alias conuictus apparet, repellitur a testimonio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 30.9, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quisque debet se ipsum exponere maxime in fauorem animarum, pro quibus saluandis deus aperiat intellectum studencium in hac compilacione ad honorem ipsius. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tercia pars lecture egregii uiri domini Nycolay de Cecilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Sicilia) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 abbatis decretorumque doctoris famosissimi super secundo libro decretalium. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 X 2.25.1-30.9. \endash  Druck u.a.: GW M47787-47926; BSB-Ink T-510-522, T-529-530. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 S\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 chulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 312f. Anm. 5 (Hs. genannt); Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lefebvre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 DDC 6 (1957), Sp. 1195-1215;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handbuch 1, S. 381; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pennington\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Panormitanus\rquote s Lectura, S. 371 Anm. 37, 373 Nr. 4-5 (Hs. jeweils genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Nicolaus de Tudeschis (Panormitanus), in: Niccol\u242 \'f2 Tedeschi (Abbas Panormitanus) e i suoi Commentaria in decretales, ed. Kenneth \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pennington\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Orazio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Condorelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Rom 2000 (Collana. I libri di Erice 25), S. 9-36, hier S. 20, 33f., 34 Nr. IV (Hs. genannt); Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r450, Nr. 01 (Hs. genannt).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \par}

