\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Tudeschis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super quarto libro Decretalium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 1 (Rubrik) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 upra uisum est in precedenti libro de gestis et actis spectantibus ad clericos, videndum est merito de spectantibus ad laycos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D\u8249 \'8be Francia (X 4.1.1). Matrimonium consensu contrahitur nec inualidatur, si consuetudo patrie non seruatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 21.5, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 graue esset recedere a communi operi doct\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [orum], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam non reperio per aliquem violari. Et hec sufficiunt ad laudem trinitatis indiuidue. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt Recollecte famosissimi decretorum speculi et dignissimi Monasterii de Moniacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Maniacio) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 abbatis domini Nycolai de Cecilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. de Sicilia) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 super Quarto libro decretalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Darunter durch Rasur getilgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro domino Paulo Numar Canonico Frisingensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. Herkunft)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 sowie weiterer Eintrag von Hellers Hand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Heller vtriusque iuris doctor Canonicus ecclesie Frisingensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 X 4.1.1-21.5. \endash  Druck u.a.: GW M47787-47926; BSB-Ink T-510-522, T-529-530. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 S\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 chulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 312f. Anm. 5 (Hs. genannt); Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lefebvre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 DDC 6 (1957), Sp. 1195-1215;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handbuch 1, S. 381; Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r450 (Hs. genannt).
