\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Anfang defekt, da Bl. 1 von Lage 1 fehlt. ||\u182 \'b6{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item multa circa modum constituendi abbatem et an consecretur uel examinetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quid potest Archi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [diaconus], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lxix di. c. Quorundam alias Quoniam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.69 c.1) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod abbas est nomen etiam seculare, De renunciatione\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , c. Ex transmissa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (X 1.9.3) (Quelle nicht ermittelt). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 bbas. Quod abbas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [non] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ab episcopo ponitur, sed a monachorum congregacione eligitur, xviii, q. ii, c. Abbas et c. Se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, vielm. Si; C.18 q.2 c.2, 15) \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Lemmata \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abbatissa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \u8230 \'85 \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item ponitur in exemplum paciencie, lii q. i Aduersus in me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [dium] (C.7 q.1 c. 48 \u167 \'a7 3) (Druck: Bl. a1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 42-a1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 5); es folgen die Lemmata \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abhinc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abdicacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abducere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abominacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ab inicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abiuracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ablatiuus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ablatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abnoctare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abnegatiuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Abolicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Quelle nicht ermittelt); (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Aborsus. Quod aborsus procuratus equiparatur alias equiualet homicidio, ii q. v Consuluisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (C.2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 q.5 c. 20) \u8230 \'85; \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abraam. Quod Abraam ponitur in exemplum, quod sepulture predecessorum nisi ex causa non sunt relinquende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xiiii q. iiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ebron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C.13 q.2 c.2) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item quod lac non vina angelis hospicio receptis exhibuit, di. xx\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [x]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 v, Sexto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [die] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.35 c.8) (Druck: Bl. a1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1-33). \endash  (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe B. \endash  (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe C; (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 19) Erw\u228 \'e4hnung der Stadt Padua im Lemma \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Continuus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et alia Padue et inciput: Duo statuta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; weitere Hinweise auf Padua: 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 47, 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 29. \endash  (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe D. \endash  (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe E. \endash  (291\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe F. \endash  (334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe G. \endash  (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe H. \endash  (354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe I. \endash  (434\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buchstabe K: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 K\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 allendas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Kallendas Januarii iuxta ritus gentilium christiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [prohibentur] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 obseruare, xxvi, q. vltima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Non licet, et c. Non obseruabitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C.27 q.7 c.13, 16). \u182 \'b6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Presbiteri cum per kallendas conueniunt quasi semiplenum conuiuium habent et ludis honestioribus intendunt, di. xliiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quando presbiteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.43 c.9) (Druck: Bl. i[5]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 14-24). \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 K\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 yrieleyson. Vide infra missa bene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clm 6559}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Druck, Bl. l[4]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -l[5]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  434\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
