\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus de Zabarellis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super primo libro Decretalium (Kurzfassung)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber primus decretalium Gregoriane compilacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I\u8249 \'8bN expedicione huius prohemii expediam alia generalia et cum hiis glosam primam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , secundo descendo ad litteram, ante omnia expedio glosam contextualiter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et iste est multiplex, scilicet statuimus preceptiuus dispositiuus, ut patebit infra, quod dic, ut in prohemio vi per Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nachum] (Druck: Bl. II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u167 \'a7 Quoniam-Fol. III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , mit leichten Abweichungen); (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 2: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius\u8249 \'8b Primo diuido librum, primo enim ponit prohemium usque ad Rubricam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  usque ibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De summa trinitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  \u8230 \'85 (Druck: Bl. IIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rex pacificus\u8249 \'8b Nota de uerbo cottidie, id est assidue, non enim semper homines peccant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sed assidue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod pena est arbitraria, tamquam non expressa in iure, i. De offi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cio] [et potestate iudicis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dele\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gati], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De causis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.29.4), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tamen eciam glosa est uera notabile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: vgl. Bl. IIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u167 \'a7 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundo quero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 1 (Rubrik am Rand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De summa trinitate et fide catholica Rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ista Rubrica non continuatur quia prima, sed premittitur pro ut dicit glosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Firmiter\u8249 \'8b (X 1.1.1). Primo tractat de summa trinitate et de operibus ipsius et de fide}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  catholica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (353\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 43; 354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  unbeschrieben, ohne Textverlust; expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qua dileccione fretas hac breui via nos constitucionibus istis perfecte vtentes ipse redemptor in finem collocet in patria. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finita est lec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tura] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 primi libri decretalium eximii doctoris necnon excellentissimi vtriusque iuris domini Francisci de Cabarellis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cuius virtus et fama per vniuersum mundum manifestissima et bene merito, quod omnipotens dominus noster Ihesus Christus in sua gubernacione conseruat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 365\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -369\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 X 1.1.1-43.14. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Berlin, SBB-PK, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ms. Magdeb. 37}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -587\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: Lectura \u8230 \'85 domini Cardinalis Zabarelle super primo decretalium. Lyon: Jacques Mareschal, 14. April 1518. Der Druck enth\u228 \'e4lt gegen\u252 \'fcber der Hs. viele Zus\u228 \'e4tze und erhebliche Abweichungen, da er nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Girgensohn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 252 (s. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6569}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) die Langfassung \u252 \'fcberliefert. \endash  Lit., insbesondere zur Kurz- und Langfassung, s. Clm 6569; Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r213, No. 01a (ohne diese Hs.).}

