\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog zu tit. 1: ||\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 onerosa in partu dolorosa in lactando laborosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 erga contractum secundarum nupciarum in ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De secundis nup\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tiis] (X 4.21). Subscriptio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tonius] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Budrio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!). \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D\u8249 \'8be Francia (X 4.1.1). Matrimonium consensu contrahitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hoc dicit Io\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dreae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 similiter An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tonius] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Bu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [trio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vel aliter secundum Franciscum de Zabarellis. Post matrimonium cum vna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [femina] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 contractum, si alia superinducitur, penitenciam iniunctam relicta secunda, ad primam redire cogeretur. Primo ponit causam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, viel. casum), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundo diffinit ibi \u8218 \'82diffiniuit\lquote . Nota primo, quod racione matrimonii laici efficiuntur de foro ecclesie, eciam si sint reges, ut infra e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [odem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. Non est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 4.1.11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex quo nota, quod diuersitas patrie et originis inter contrahentes non inficit matrimonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 21.5, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in hiis omnibus leges recipiunt correcciones per canones et sic est finis. Laus et gloria sit ipsi Christo, ipse uero deus, cuius opere liber hic finem habet, suam clemenciam nobis prestet, ut virtutes assequamur atque secundum eas omnia opera nostra dirigamus, ita ut finita mortali vitam eternam consequi mereamur, quod vobis et michi concedere dignetur dominus noster Ihesus Christus in secula benedictus. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Finitus anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xxxviii in vicesima quarta die mensis Aprilis, que erat dies sancti Georii martyris in alma vniuersitate Wienensi. Intilbres. M. Jo[hannes] Heller}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -103c\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
