\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clemens V. papa}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Constitutiones clementinae cum apparatu Johannis Andreae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: (Prolog) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ohannes episcopus seruus seruorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam nulla iuris sanccio, quantumcumque perpenso digesta consilio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Clem. 5.1.1-11.2 (ohne c. 1), expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non erit processus propter hoc irritus, nec eciam irritandus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Decretalium, Sp. 1129-1200). \endash  (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar als Klammerglosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iohannes. Graciosum. Hoc nomen per interpretaciones, deriuaciones uel ethimologias extollere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum ad illam redibimus per intercessionem virginis gloriose, nos collocet cum electis. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Mit Zitaten, jeweils am Rand von Hellers Hand in hellbrauner Tinte, aus den Glossen von Johannes de Imola (u.a. 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Paulus de Liazariis (u.a. 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Johannes de Lignano (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Stephanus [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Hugonetti?]\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Guilelmus [de Monte Laudano?] (u.a. 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Baldus de Ubaldis (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) und \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Zenzelinus de Cassanis (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Daran Clem. 5.11.1 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exiui de paradiso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), zu der eine Glosse von Johannes Andreae nicht \u252 \'fcberliefert ist (Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Decretalium, Sp. 1193-1200). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Heller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Clem. 1.1.1-5.11.2. \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW 7078 = BSB-Ink C-428. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 217 Nr. 6 (Hs. genannt ebd. Anm. 61); Jacqueline \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tarrant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The manuscripts of the Constantine Clementinae, in: ZRG.KA 101 (1984), S. 68-183, hier S. 126 (Hs. genannt); Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r339 Nr. 03 (Hs. genannt); weitere Lit. s. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6778}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

