\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (Seitentitel) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De regularibus et transeuntibus ad religionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 31: (Rubrik) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica de Regularibus et transeuntibus ad Religionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D\u8249 \'8bIctum est in titulis precedentibus de clericis secularibus et rebus ipsorum restabat videre}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de regularibus et his, que ad eos pertinent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 N\u8249 \'8bullus (X 3.31.1). Non sumatur congrue, quia breue est, in concilio, de quo in suprascriptione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  statutum fuit, quod nullus tondeatur, id est admittatur ad professionem nisi sit legitime etatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 46: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica de obseruatione Ieiuniorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Mit umfangreicher Glossierung durch Heller mit Verweisung auf Godefridus de Trano, Nicolaus de Tudeschis (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dominus Panor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mitanus], Guido de Baisio (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 archi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [diaconus]). \endash  Nach X 3.46.3: (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Antonius de Rosellis], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tractatus de Jeiuniis quadragesimalibus, de quo in Rubrica supra mencio fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O\u8249 \'8bMnes homines, qui rectum iter uite tenere nituntur, non terram continue debent inspicere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ideo eleuamus animum ad ieiunia, ut dominus sit in retribucionem uobiscum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Druck: BSB-Ink R-269 = GW M38956, Bl. [a1]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 22-[a6]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 50.10, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 debet in omnibus intelligi secundum illam legem interpretatam in Aut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hentica] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De filiis ante dotalia instrumenta natis \u167 \'a7 fi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nalis] (Nov. 19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Et sic est finis harum recollectarum super tertio libro decretalium famosissimi atque subtilissimi vtriusque iuris doctoris d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Angeli de Castro, tunc sacrorum canonum alme vniuersitatis Patauine lectoris extraordinarii Anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xliiii\u176 \'b0 die vero Jouis decimasexta mensis Julii sacro generali Basiliensi concilio durante completis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per me Johannem Heller de Monaco arcium doctorem, canonicum ecclesie sancti Andree Frisingensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \\\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Intilbres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \\\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -187d\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
