\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Antonius de Rosellis iuris utriusque monarcha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnipotentis dei suffragio postulato. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Viso dicto puncto videtur dicendum, quod dicta consuetudo non possit disponere contra}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  disposicionem iuris inducendo matrimonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non si fuissent contracta preterita per verba de presenti per ea, que supra dixi. Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In Christi nomine eiusque matris Marie vtriusque Jacobi patronorum suorum tociusque curie triumphantis Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Viso superiore puncto presupponitur, quod iste sacerdos, qui condidit testamentum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , habebat parochialem ecclesiam simul et canonicatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et in c. Presenti, De off\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dinarii] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 1.16.9) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et in c. Quoniam, De iure patron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [atus] (X 3. 38.3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et in c. Cum et plantare \u167 \'a7 In ecclesiis, De priuilegiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5. 33.3 \u167 \'a7 2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In supradicto consultacionis articulo, quoniam circa omnia quesita plene tactum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et adiectione non indigeat plenitudo, tamen ad fortificacionem eorum, que dicta sunt vltimo loco, vtrum princeps statutum aut consuetudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 loci possit disponere circa validacionem testamenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia prima caritas etc l. Preses, c. De serui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tutibus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et aqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 3 34.6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec potest princeps secularis tamquam implicitus rebus secularibus presidere rebus diuinis, tex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est \u215 \'d7 di., Quoniam in fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.10 c.8). \endash  206a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Laut \u220 \'dcberschrift k\u246 \'f6nnte Antonius de Rosellis der Verfasser der drei Consilia sein; zu dem ihm bereits von Zeitgenossen verliehenen Ehrentitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 iuris utriusque monarcha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  vgl. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Hermann \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kantorowicz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Noel \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Denholm-Young\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De ornatu mulierum. A consilium of Antonius de Rosellis with an introduction on fifteenth century sumptuary legislation, in: Hermann \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kantorowicz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rechtshistorische Schriften, hrsg. von Helmut \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Gerhard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Immel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Karlsruhe 1970 (Freiburger rechts- und staatswissenschaftliche Abhandlungen 30), S. 341-376, hier S. 348. \endash  (Nr. 2) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung aus dem Freisinger Bestand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6585}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (dort Jacobus de Zocchis zugeschrieben).}

