\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de penitentia et remissione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Heller) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobi de Zogzicks de Ferraria ordinarii iuris canonici vniuersitatis Paduane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O\u8249 \'8bmnis utriusque (X 5.38.12). Famosum est altum deuotum ac spirituale et ideo deuote est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  spiritualiter legendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que facta sunt in preteritum et fient in futurum, cum ipse Yhesus Christus sit agnus dei immaculatus, qui tollit omnia peccata mundi. Amen. Amen. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (von Hellers Hand): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis tractatus de penitenciis et remissionibus editus per famosissimum vtriusque iuris doctorem d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobum de Zogzicz, ordinarium iuris canonici alme vniuersitatis Patauine Anno 1444 die vero xii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mensis Septembris sacro Basiliensi concilio durante \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \\\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [agister] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannes Heller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \\\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hoc age age\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?, expungiert). \endash  267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -267g\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
