\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Irca lecturam arboris. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo ponit glo[sa] i, qualiter se antiqui habuerunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , presertim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Deo in lectura arboris vsque ibi \u8218 \'82attendens\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod habeat locum in disposicione legis uel statuti per ea, que supra dixi. Et sic est finis arboris consanguinitatis. Laus deo. Antonius de Rosellis iuris utriusque monarcha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
