\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift von Hellers Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus represaliarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 R\u8249 \'8bEpresaliarum materia nec frequens nec cottidiana erat tempore, quo in statu debito Romanum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uigebat imperium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alias sua auctoritate non potest exercere. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Von Hellers Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus represaliarum domini Bartoli de Saxoferrato de Perusio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Im Fu\u223 \'dfsteg Worterkl\u228 \'e4rung von Heller: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Represalie sunt exempli gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ponamus: Ciuitas Paduana habet quendam subditum. Hic civem, qui habet debitorem morantem in alia ciuitate, tunc si ciuis Paduanus conuenit debitorem suum in sua ciuitate, illa ciuitas negligit facere iusticiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
