\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de duobus fratribus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift von Hellers Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de fratribus simul habitantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D\u8249 \'8bIuiditur in duas partes principaliter, nam quandoque inter fratres contenditur de hiis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que in uita patris contingunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in l. Si pater, De donacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 39.5.34). Mit Zusatz: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quarta questio principalis, quid de fructibus quesitis ex bonis paternis per filium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et defficit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quarta questio principalis domini Bartho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [li] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pie memorie, quia ipse morte preuentus non potuit complere, sed do\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [minus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ja\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cobus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Ar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rena] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro complemento domini Bartho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [li] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 posuit addicicionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 28-86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus Balduinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : [Summula de fratribus insimul habitantibus]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sepe hactenus dubitatum est et questiones orte sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 infra De donacionibus et l. Sensuales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Censualis, C. 8.53.7) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hec sufficient. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Von Hellers Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec Jacobus de Arena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung aus dem Freisinger Bestand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6643}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: GW 3665 = BSB-Ink B-200, Bl. d9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -e3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (ohne Zusatz); VD16 B 576, Bd. 10, S. 315-321 (Wortlaut abweichend). \endash  Druck der Summula: Andrea \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Romano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La \u8222 \'84Summula de fratribus insimul habitantibus\ldblquote  di Iacopo Baldovini. Studio sul ms. Uppsala, Univ. Bibl., C. 560, in: Rivista di storia del diritto italiano 48 (1975), S. 123-170, hier S. 166-170, 164 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Lit.: Francesco \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Calasso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: DBI 6 (1964), S. 640-669, hier S. 654f.;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Casamassima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iter Germanicum, Nr. 112,IV, S. 135, 240, 259 (Hs. genannt); CALMA 2 Nr. 115, S. 153; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lange/Kriechbaum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 793.}

