\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus super constitutione Ad reprimendum}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\u220 \'dcberschrift von Hellers Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Constitucio siue Extravagans Ad reprimendum, quam Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 commentauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo in crimine lese maiestatis procedatur. Rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 enricus septimus diuina fauente gracia Romanorum Imperator semper augustus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bd reprimendum multorum facinora}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a quo tempore, dic, ut ibi plene dixi. Bartholus de Saxoferrato, ciuis Perusinus, legum doctor. Laus deo intemerateque virgini Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
