\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (\u220 \'dcberschrift von Hellers Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Repeticio Cle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mentinarum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sepe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De verbo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nificatione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 famosissimi utriusque iuris doctoris, domini Frederici de Capitibusliste, iura canonica Padue legentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Federicus de Capitibusliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S\u8249 \'8bepe (Clem. 5.11.2). Ista Cle[mentina] famosa et utilis non eget commendacione et solempnitate}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uerborum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicens quod natura naturans, hoc est ipse deus, cum ad illam redibimus per intercessionem virginis gloriose collocare cenabitur cum suis sanctis electis. Amen. Et sic est finita illa Cle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mentina] I. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Adnotatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota tamen, quod glosarum infrascriptarum in Cle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mentinae] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alique sunt notabiles et alique singulares. Et primo in prohemio glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I est notabilis, quia ponit excellenciam nominis Johannis inter romanos pontifices\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in uerbo prouisio ponit significatum uerbi prouidere, quod est latissimum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Von Hellers Hand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Distinctio quando, quociens et quibus uerbis proferatur iniuria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Item uerba iniuriosa sunt, que proferuntur in alios contra bonos mores ciuitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et Extra De adul\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [teriis et stupro], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. penultimo et finale et per totum. Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota hic que possunt opponi contra illum, qui est electus in episcopum uel alium prelatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut infra c. Cum in cunctis preallegato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.6.7). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item contra electum in abbatem potest opponi. Primo quod non sit professus nec expertus in regula monachali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut De accusati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [onibus], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. Ad peticionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.1.22). \endash  Rest der Seite und 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -119a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Nr. 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Bologna, Bibl. del Coll. di Spagna, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 MS 74}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -319\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Leiden, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 d\rquote Ablaing 16}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; (Nr. 3-5) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: T\u252 \'fcbingen, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Mc 58}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: Zu Clem. 5.11.2 vgl. Knut Wolfgang \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Romanisch-kanonisches Prozessrecht. Erkenntnisverfahren erster Instanz in civilibus. Berlin u.a. 2012 (Enzyklop\u228 \'e4die der Rechts- und Staatswissenschaft. Abteilung Rechtswissenschaft), S. 211-220; B\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 elloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 188f. (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Iohannes Heller, S. 63f. \u167 \'a7 3.}

