\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift von Hellers Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de diuinis officiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bNtequam dicatur de diuinis officiis ac horis canonicis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , dicendum est primo secundum Ysidorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut dicit hic Ber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nardus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic in c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [apitulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sepius allegato. Et sic est finis. Explicit tractatus de diuinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
