\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift von Hellers Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [toli] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de insigniis et armis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 H\u8249 \'8bOrum gratia de insigniis et armis, que quis portat in vexillis et clipeis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 videamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et modum depingendi racionabilem invenies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Im Seitensteg von Heller erg\u228 \'e4nzt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Etiam tamen scias, quod licet quis arma sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aut sculpere alias pingere in rubro et nigro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Fortsetzung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hunc tractatum de insignis et armis editum a domino Bartholo publicauit do\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [minus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nicolaus Alexandri, legum doctor, eius gener, post mortem dicti domini Bartholi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
