\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 271\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus Caepolla}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio in C. 7.59.1}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur lex vnica C. De confessis breuissime repetita per d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bartholomeum Cipollam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u252 \'fcber der Zeile von Heller eingef\u252 \'fcgt) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Verona scolarem in utroque iure peritissimum. Et valet multum per intelligenciam huius tituli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C]onfessos (C. 7.59.1). Dic prima super Rubrica. In glosa rubrice dic melius ultra omnis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  doct\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rina], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut hic per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Bartholomaeum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salicetum, cui adde, quod notat Florianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [de Sancto Petro] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in Rubrica in principio ff. De int\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [er]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gatoriis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 actio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nibus] (D. 11.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur magister. Diuide in tres partes: primo ponitur vera verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 seu dictum in genere, 2\u176 \'b0 infert ad quesitum in speciale, tercio infert ad aliud quesitum secundam ibi \u8218 \'82Quare\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia eius nomine gestum est, ut in toto ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ff. et C. De neg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [otiis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ges\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tis] (D. 3.5; C. 2.18) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ita notatur in c. Si caucio, Extra De fide instru\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mentorum] (X 2.22.14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic est finis huius l. i, C. De confessis, quam bene vide, quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [est] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vtilis et bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17\cf1 Cod. 5056}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 -189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 158; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Iohannes Heller, S. 80 (jeweils Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CALMA 1 Nr. 10 S. 706\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Zum Verfasser s. auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6585}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
