\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Am Seitenrand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica de appellacionibus Angeli de Castro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica de appellacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 U\u8249 \'8bIsum est supra de sentenciis et eius effectu, sed quia per sentencias litigantes plerumque}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  grauantur et appellatio est remedium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dilecti filii\u8249 \'8b (X 2.28.1). Collacio beneficii post et contra appellacionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In prima ponitur querela, in secunda papa dat iudices, secunda ibi \u8218 \'82Super quibus\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cap. 2-14; (330\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -331\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Suggestum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (X 2.28.15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si reus contra quod fuit impetratum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Communis diuisio secunda ibi \u8218 \'82Tue consultacioni\lquote . Casus: Sepe contingit, quod oppressus i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [d est] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 grauatus per sentenciam ad presidium appellacionis recurrit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et presumatur facta per maliciam nisi probetur contrarium. Sequitur c. Ad presenciam. Angelus de Castro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 332\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer; wahrscheinlich vorgesehen f\u252 \'fcr cap. 16-73.
