\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S\u8249 \'8bVper vacuum arbitror, maiores et fratres optimi, hanc canonicam sapienciam cristiane nostre}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  religionis fundamentum amplissimum vel collaudare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 1: (Rubrik) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 T quia necessarium continuare istam rubricam ad precedentem, quia liber ad librum non sit continuacio, ut notatur in rubrica De condi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tive] (D. 13.1; C. 4.8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec legis ad legem uel canonis ad canonem, ut notatur in l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ege] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Stipulacionum, rubrica De ver\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [borum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ob\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ligationibus] (D. 45.1) \u8230 \'85 \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ut layci\u8249 \'8b (X 3.1.1). Cum celebrantur diuina, diuisus esse debet clerus a populo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vel secundo secundum Flo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rentinum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 laici iuxta altare uel in choro, dum diuina celebrantur, stare uel sedere non debent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Hellers Erg\u228 \'e4nzung zu X 3.5.31: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item pro pleniori et clariori intellectu \u167 \'a7 Qui vero predicti c. Exstirpande, De praebendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 3.5.30) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ad saluandam contrarietatem c. Ex tue, De clericis non residentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 3.4.11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 necnon aliorum iurium. Notandum quod quilibet prelatus siue sit episcopus siue maior siue inferior episcopo, ad quem destitucio pertinet, dispensare potest cum clerico suo subsistente causa iusta siue racionabili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; als Autorit\u228 \'e4ten werden genannt: Henricus de Segusia (Hostiensis), Innocentius IV. papa (Sinibald Fieschi), Johannes Garcia Hispanus (s. Otto \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mazal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Geschichte der abendl\u228 \'e4ndischen Wissenschaft des Mittelalters 2. Graz 2006, S. 561) und Johannes Monachus (s. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Bio-Bibliographical \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Guide, Report No. r366\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ). \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Hellers Erg\u228 \'e4nzung zu X 3.26.10-12: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pro clariori intellectu c. Cum esses et c. Relatum, De testamentis notandum, quod secundum dominum Antho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nium] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Bu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [trio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in dicto c. Cum esses leges ciuiles loquentes de solempnitate testorum sunt correcte per ius canonicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Opinio Anthonii de Butrii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secunda opinio d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pauli de Castro et Glosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia opinio Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dree] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et spe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [culi iudicalis]. \endash  (373\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 30.35, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed cum consensu episcopi sic ut ibi et hoc tenet De pe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [culio clericorum] (X 3.25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [onius de Rosellis?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (374\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sic est finis, deo laus, tertii libri Decretalium vsque ad titulum De regularibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 3.31\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ) exclusive lecti et in modum recollectarum subtilissime concepti per excellentissimum atque subtilissimum vtriusque iuris doctorem dominum Angelum de Castro in felicissimo studio Paduano ipso legente extraordinarie anno etc. xliiii\u176 \'b0. Orent lectores pro compositore, ut carnis mole deposita, verum et optatum finem pro laboribus consequatur. Amen. Scriptum manu propria per me magistrum Johannem Heller de Monaco, canonicum ecclesie sancti Andree Frisingensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (von anderer Hand im Seitensteg erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 postea vero utriusque iuris doctorem canonicum ecclesie Frisingensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anno ut supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \\\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Intilbres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1024\fs24 \\\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sacro generali Basiliensi concilio durante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  374\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -380\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 X 3.1.1-30.35. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Eichst\u228 \'e4tt, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. st 614}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (stark gek\u252 \'fcrzt gegen\u252 \'fcber vorliegender Hs.). \endash  Titulus 14 lediglich als rubrizierte \u220 \'dcberschrift \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 De precariis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -221a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Raum f\u252 \'fcr fehlenden Text (X 3.14.1-3); Titulus 24 (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Raum f\u252 \'fcr \u220 \'dcberschrift ausgespart, ebenso Capitula 7 (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Nach Titulus 30.30 Raum f\u252 \'fcr fehlende Capitula 31-33 (371a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -371b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) ausgespart. \endash  Zu Angelus de Castro vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  GQ 2, S. 331; Giuliana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D'Amelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , in: DBI 22 (1979), S. 223-225 (auch zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung, Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 120, 123; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iohannes Heller, S. 77, 84 (Druck des Kolophons), 89 (Hs. genannt); Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r040\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

