\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Angelus de Castro}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super quarto libro Decretalium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber quartus de sponsalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 RUBRICA DE SPONSALIBVS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec rubrica potest continuari duobus modis ad precedentes. Primo modo sit in tribus precedentibus libris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  posuit tres libri principales huius voluminis, vnde merito sequitur quarta pars principalis, in qua tractat de sponsa et ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rito] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et de impedimentis eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 DE FRANCIA QVIDAM\u8249 \'8b (X 4.1.1) Matrimonium consensu contrahitur nec inualidatur, licet patrie consuetudo non seruetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In prima ponit factum, in secunda diffinit illa indiffinit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [a] (?) \u8230 \'85 \endash  (371\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 21.5, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et taliter in D. authentica Eisdem penis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Nov. 7,8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C. De secundis nuptiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 5,9), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et dicit Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in hoc communiter teneri et ista sufficiant quo ad finem quarti libri. Dominus autem Ihesus Christus redemptor noster, qui omnium bonorum principium est et finis, pro sua summa pietate perducat nos ad eternum et immarcessibilem finem. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Rest der Spalte sowie 376\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -377\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qr\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
