\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De throno. In nomine domini. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Euerendo in Christo patri suo domino Octobono dei gratia sancti Adriani dyacono cardinali Guilhelmus Duranti domini pape subdyaconus et capellanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D\u8249 \'8be trono dei procedunt fulgura, voces atque tonitrua \u8230 \'85 (Apc 4, 5.8). Hec leguntur in Apokalipsi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et xciii di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [stinctione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Legimus circa medium ibi \u8218 \'82Filius tonitrui\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 93 c. 24) \u8230 \'85 \endash  (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 1, particula 1, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De iudice delegato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iuxta promissionis ordinem uidendum occurrit de iudicibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .Vnde nota, quod iudicum alii sunt delegati, alii ordinarii, alii auditores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; mit den Additiones des Johannes Andreae: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glosse 1 zu Z. 8 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8218 \'82In Apokalipsi\lquote  iii .c. non tamen ad literam sed per saltum. Scias quod hanc auctoritatem et partem prosecutionis ipsius habere potuit auctor a Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hanne] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Faue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ntino] \u8230 \'85 (GW 9157 = BSB Ink D-365, Bl. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 32-38); (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) vorletzte Glosse zu Z. 6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8218 \'82Item quod est iudeus uel hereticus\lquote  de hoc satis scripsi e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [odem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si a subdelegato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 1.14.14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 super glosa penultima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ebd. Bl. 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 54-56); letzte Glosse zu Z. 24 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u8218 \'82iurisdicionem secundum Rof\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [fredum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  ti. iii. ultra principio. Sed hic incidit alia questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || wohl Textabbruch (ebd. Bl. 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12f.); (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [tit. 2], \u220 \'dcberschrift \u8218 \'82De legato\lquote  fehlt, Seitentitel von tit. 1 bis 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  beibehalten; (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 3-10. \endash  (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 2, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit secunda particula et primo de actore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 2-4. \endash  (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 3, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tertia particula. De hiis qui alieno nomine in iudicio interueniunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 2-13. \endash  (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 4: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit quarta particula. De personis que nec agunt nec defendunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 1-4; (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 5, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qualiter autem libelli super salariis concipiant, dicit infra ut in ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De magistratis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 2: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ancti spiritus gratia suffragante, de personis in iudicio interuenientibus in libro precedenti prelibamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 1, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prima particula et primo de preparatoriis iudiciorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 2-8; (312\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [tit. 9], \u220 \'dcberschrift \u8218 \'82De secundo decreto\lquote  fehlt, da in \u220 \'dcberschrift zu tit. 8 genannt, wird als Seitentitel ab 313\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ausgef\u252 \'fchrt; (320\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 10-20. \endash  (367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 2, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit secunda particula et primo de litis contestacione. Rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (371\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 2-6; tit. 7, (440\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et demum supponet illorum septem testium nomine citatum et pronunciacioni iudicis adhibitorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch (Druck: Bd. 2, Bl. CXVI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 53) mit Fortsetzung in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clm 6602}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; das Vorhandensein der Reklamante \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et omnia hec in publicam et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  deutet wohl darauf hin, dass die Aufteilung des Werks auf zwei B\u228 \'e4nde erst durch den Buchbinder erfolgte. \endash  441\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
