\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -431\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Durantis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum iudiciale (Lib. 2.2.7-4.5.39)}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 2, particula 2, tit. 7: ||\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et omnia hec in publicam et autenticam rediget scripturam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Verum tamen secundum M[artinum] de Fano uacatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. vocatis) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 premissis et quam eis, qui forte in alio testamento instituti dicuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 8-15. \endash  (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 3, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tertia particula de sentencia et hiis que ipsam secuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 2-7; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 8, (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item si condempnat in maiori, ergo in minori ff. De\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [receptis qui] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 arbi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [trium], l. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.4.8.27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de hoc infra t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [itulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 proximo \u167 \'a7 i v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ersu] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 3: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber tertius de criminibus et eorum cognicionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S\u8249 \'8bvperius in parte precedenti plenius explicauimus, qualiter in ciuilibus sit negociis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  procedendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 1, tit. 1-5; (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 6, (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nisi doceat collusionem interuenisse ff. De iureiurando, l. Eum qui \u167 \'a7 In popularibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 12.2.30.3), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de hoc Extra De purg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [atione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 can\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [onica], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. Ex tuarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.34.8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber tercius. Sequitur quartus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber quartus. De libellorum concepcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 F\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ormauit deus hominem ad ymaginem et similitudinem suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gn 1, 26) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut xxxiii q. v. Hec ymago\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C.33 q.5 c.13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et De pe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nitencia] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 di. ii Principium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (De poen. D.2 c.45), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum quo ius naturale prodiit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 1, tit. 1-10, 14-15, 17-24, 28-29, 31, 33, 32, 34-38, 40-43. \endash  (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Particula 2, tit. 1, 10-12; (239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [tit. 13], \u220 \'dcberschrift \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De restitutione spoliatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt, Seitentitel f\u252 \'fcr tit. 12 bis 244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  beibehalten; (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 14-19, 22, 24, 26-30. \endash  Particula 3, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber tercius. De vita et honestate clericorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; tit. 2-23; (366\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [tit. 24], \u220 \'dcberschrift \u8218 \'82De donationibus\lquote  nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt, Seitentitel f\u252 \'fcr tit. 23 bis 367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  beibehalten; (367\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 25-41, 49-50. \endash  Particula 4, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber tercius. Incipit quartus. De sponsalibus et matrimoniis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (397\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 2-21. \endash  Particula 5, tit. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De accusacionibus, inquisicionibus et denunciacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b; (415\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 2-3, 5-8, 11-12, 16-21, 24, 27-28, 32-33, 36-38; (430\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 39, (431\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed ministerii effectum fauorem profecto non querentis humanum, sed solum brauium sempiternum, ad quod nos perducat qui sine fine uiuit et regnat. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von Hand 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit speculum iudiciale Magistri Gwilhelmi Dura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [n]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Dar\u252 \'fcber weiteres {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von der Hand des Rubrikators: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Speculum Judiciale Guilhelmi Duranti Galli confessoris Anno domini Millesimo Quadringentesimo decimo Nono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (16. Oktober 1419). Darunter ein drittes Kolophon mit gleichlautendem Wortlaut in einer Textura auf einem tafelartigen, rot gef\u228 \'e4rbten und gerahmten Feld, das wahrscheinlich einen anderen hsl. Eintrag \u252 \'fcberdeckt. \endash  432\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die Gliederung von Liber 4 richtet sich nach dem Liber Extra, indem die particula 1-5 die tituli aus den libri 1-5 \u252 \'fcbernehmen. Zum Aufbau s. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  GQ 2, S. 149f. \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW 9148; BSB-Ink D-360: Liber 2 = Bd. 2, Bl. CXVI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 53-188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Liber 3 = BSB-Ink D-360, Bd. 3; Liber 4 = BSB-Ink D-360, Bd. 4. \endash  Weitere Angaben s. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6601}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
