\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ncipit tabula super tractatu canonice porcionis domini Petri de Ubaldis de Perusio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (\u220 \'dcberschrift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus canonice episcopalis et canonice parochialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q\u8249 \'8bVoniam super canonica Episcopali Jura diuersimode loquuntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et varie questiones sunt exorate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 10) Text: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 U\u8249 \'8bEnio ad primum capitulum videlicet quo Jure et ex qua causa sit hec Canonica Episcopalis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inducta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nam personis illi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [u]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s religionis et ordinis non licet extraneos ad sepulturam admittere, De reli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [giosis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 do\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mibus], [c.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnico scilicet in Personis li. vi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (VI 3.17.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias 1465\u176 \'b0.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt tractatus canonice episcopalis et canonice parochialis editi per Egregium vtriusque Juris doctorem dominum Petrum de Vbaldis de Perusio ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis dei, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Druck: GW M48778 = BSB-Ink U-66; TUI 15,2, Sp. 199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 -240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 277 Anm. 5 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r483, No. 1 (Hs. genannt).}

