\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Mandagoto}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Libellus super electione facienda}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de electionibus et postulacionibus celebrandis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Widmung: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 U}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8249 \'8b}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iro venerabili}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Magistro suo Reverendissimo Berangario Frodoli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 succentori ecclesie Vitriensis domini pape capellano et doctori facundissimo decretorum Guillermus de Mandagato Archidiaconus Nemanensis et eiusdem domini pape capellanus salutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Glosse zur Widmung: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 U\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iro Venerabili etc. Cum illius non fui auctoritatis, quod meis scriptis fides debeat adhiberi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  Prolog: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q\u8249 \'8bVia dum elecciones imminent faciende}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ne quid interdum haberi copia peritorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash  (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glosse zum Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Via dum elecciones etc. Celebrande. Eleccio est celebranda, dum vacat ecclesia et non ante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cap. 1: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 A\u8249 \'8bd principale propositum in illius nomine, qui cuiuslibet boni operis est inicium attendentes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Glosse zu Cap. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d principale etc. Hic signatur c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [apitulum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i. Et notandum, quod iste libellus diuiditur in tres partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod in extrema retribucione iustorum tamen eis interne salutis premii consequi mereamur, ipso prestante, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus omnipotenti deo eiusque matris gloriose virginis Marie. 1465\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Daran: \u220 \'dcbersicht Hellers \u252 \'fcber kanonische Wahlhindernisse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In oppo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [situm] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si sit incontinens et si habet filios, xxviii di. Priusquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.28 c.4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et c. De Syracusane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.28 c.13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et lxi di. Cathinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.61 c.17) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et lxxxii di. Proposuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.82 c.2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item si contraxit cum corrupta vt xxxii di. c. Nemo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D.32 c.12) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item si alienator uel usurarius uel inferius, De exces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sibus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prela\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [torum], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. Inter dilectos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.31.11) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et C. De indignatibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 12.1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 VI q. 1 Infames\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C.6 q.1 c.17).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: TUI 15,1, Sp. 407\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -435\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 278 Nr. 5 Anm. 9 und darauf fu\u223 \'dfend \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r483, No. 4 (Hs. jeweils genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Petrus de Ubaldis zugewiesen. Zur Identifikation des Werks in vorliegender Hs. s. Andreas \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmidt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u8222 \'84Bischof bist Du und F\u252 \'fcrst\ldblquote . Die Erhebung geistlicher Reichsf\u252 \'fcrsten im Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter \endash  Trier, Bamberg, Augsburg. Heidelberg 2015 (Heidelberger Abhandlungen zur mittleren und neueren Geschichte. NF 22), S. 184 Anm. 18. \endash  Zu Verfasser und Werk s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 183-185; Alfred von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wretschko\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Electio communis bei den kirchlichen Wahlen im Mittelalter, in: Deutsche Zeitschrift f\u252 \'fcr Kirchenrecht 11 (1901/02), S. 321-392, passim; Paul \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Viollet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les \u233 \'e9lections eccl\u233 \'e9siastiques au moyen-\u226 \'e2ge d\rquote apres le Libellus super electionibus de Guillaume de Managout, in: Revue catholique des \u201 \'c9glises 4 (1907), S. 65-91.}

