\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De excommunicatione}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\u220 \'dcberschrift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus de sentencia excommunicacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P\u8249 \'8brimo ostendo, quod nullus debet excommunicari, quia per excommunicacionem traditur homo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sathane in interitum carnis, ut habetur i. Cor. .v.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Cor 5,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed nullus debet tradi Sathane, de quo non est desperandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non obstantibus in premissis statutis aut quibuslibet aliis priuilegiis cuiuscumque tenoris existant. Hec omnia habentur in ea Cle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mentina] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Daran: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De forma absolucionis ab excommunicacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 P\u8249 \'8bRimo ab eo exigendum est Juramentum, vt sit paratus status mandatis ecclesie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que silicet, fiant ei pro illa causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eus, cui proprium est miserere semper et parcere, suscipe deprecacionem nostram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. CO 1143). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Auctoritate omnipotentis dei et beatorum Petri e Pauli et domini episcopi, si ipse commisit sibi hoc, michi concessa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non tamen est absolutus, cuius judex, qui tulit sentenciam absoluerit, et hoc personis declarandum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Das Werk stammt nicht von Bartolus de Saxoferrato. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 19506}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 311\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -332\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Casamassima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iter Germanicum, Nr. 131 S. 157). \endash  Lit. Nr. 1: Francesco \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Calasso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: DBI 6 (1964), S. 640-669, hier S. 655 (nennt Clm 19506); CALMA 2, S. 153 Nr. 118. \endash  Druck Nr. 2: H\u233 \'e9l\u232 \'e8ne \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thieulin-Pardo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Confesionario. Compendio del \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Libro de las confesiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  de Mart\u237 \'edn P\u233 \'e9rez. Edici\u243 \'f3n y presentaci\u243 \'f3n. Paris 2012 (Les Livres d\rquote e-Spania. Sources 2), \u167 \'a7 10.1.}

