\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus verborum directorum, obliquorum et communium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de verbis directis, communibus et obliquis et de pluribus aliis verbis et diccionibus diuersis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 C\u8249 \'8bIrca tractatum istum quero primo, quid sit verbum directum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Respondeo est illud, quod de sui natura hoc inportat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut ille cui relinquitur per talem verbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod hec verba important substitucionem directam vt l. fi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nalis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u167 \'a7 Lucius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 31.89.3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et l. penultima \u167 \'a7 Matrem ff. De le\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [gatis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 31.88.17).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 19506}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 333\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Leiden, UB, d\lquote Ablaing 28, 32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. Catalogue des manuscrits des collections d'Ablaing et Meijers par Petrus C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Boeren\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leiden 1970, S. 107 Nr. 9; Verzeichnis kanonistischer Handschriften in den Niederlanden, bearb. von Christine \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 van Wijnbergen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Hartmut \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zapp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . W\u252 \'fcrzburg 1988, S. 127); Leipzig, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. Haen. 15}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Casamassima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iter Germanicum, Nr. 71,11, S. 98). \endash  Lit.: Francesco \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Calasso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: DBI 6 (1964), S. 640-669, hier S. 661; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Casamassima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iter Germanicum, Nr. 113,2, S. 137; CALMA 2 Nr. 164, S. 156.}

