\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (\u220 \'dcberschrift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Repeticio c. Quoniam contra falsam, De probationibus multum vtilis et solempnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 R\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epetitio c. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam contra falsam. Hec decretalis est famosa et in ea traditur doctrina utilis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et cottidiana, quam decretalem disposui pro exercicii gratia repetere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sin autem aliquid minus bene dictum repertum fuerit me humiliter vniuscuiusque correctioni subitio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Repetitio d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lanfranci de Brixia super c. Quoniam contra falsam, De probac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ionibus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vtriusque iuris doctoris eximii et multum commendabilis explicit. DEO GRACIAS. Clarissimi viri d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ] Lancfranci de Brixia utriusque iuris doctoris eximii repeticio super c. Quoniam contra falsam, De probac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ionibus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 multum commendabilis feliciter explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 390\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 19506}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW M17000 = BSB-Ink L-54. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  GQ 2, S. 392; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handbuch 1, S. 396; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 264-269, hier S. 267 (ohne diese Hs.); Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r396, Nr. 1 (Hs. genannt).}

