\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de inuentario secundum dominum Angelum de Perusio, quem ipse ponit in l. i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u167 \'a7 Hec stipulacio ff. Si cui plusquam per legem Falcidiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 35.3.1.9) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in quadam glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ibi posita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 H\u8249 \'8bec stipulacio. Primo nota regulam negatiuam, quod iure antiquo heres non tenebatur ad legata ultra vires}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hereditatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quantum duret tempus ad inuentarii confectionem, dic ut dicto \u167 \'a7 Sin autem dubius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 6.30.22.2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gracias. Explicit repeticio domini Angeli de Perusio super tractatum inuentarii et se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [quitur] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Forma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
