\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Baldus de Ubaldis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super usibus feudorum. Commentum super pace Constantiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog und Widmung an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Giovanni Galeazzo Visconti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I\u8249 \'8bntellectum tibi dabo \u8230 \'85 (Ps 31,8). Ait dominus omnipotens per os prophete in libro Salomonis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Est ergo intellectus munus diuinum seu dei beneficium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt constituciones et primo de hiis, qui feudum dare possunt, qualiter acquiratur et retineatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec rubrica diuiditur in duas partes. Nam primo ponit titulum libri, secundo diuidit tractatum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  suum quo ad titulum proximum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eternum illum et effabilem filium semper excipio, qui nouit omnia, que patris sunt, De con\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [secratione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [stinctione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ulti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ma] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Saluator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (De cons. D.5 c.40). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Conclusiones glossarum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De proprietatibus de (!, vielm. et) naturis feudorum diffuse et substancialiter dictum est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , sed quia gaudent breuitate moderni et presertim principes magnifici, tradam operis istius medullam per conclusiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 raciones et argumenta inquirere non debemus De Feudi cog\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nitione], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 c. Obertus in glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Que in conclusionibus desunt, in lec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tura] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 supplentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Zusatz: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I\u8249 \'8bgitur letamini in domino et exultate iusti \u8230 \'85 (Ps 31,11). Letamini scilicet vos vasalli in domino}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 canitur in Dauiticis melodiis:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus fortis et potens, dominus potens in prelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 23,8).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus virtutum ipse est rex glorie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  (Ps 23,10)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Fulda, Hessische LB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D 34}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commentum super pace Constantiae: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n nomine sancte et indiuidue trinitatis. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Imperator Fredericus pacem suam laudabilem summe attribuit trinitati}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que uero pro utilitate rei publice scribuntur eterna sunt. O quam fidelis fama, cui militat honor. Sit laus deo. Explicit commentum domini Baldi de Perusia utriusque iuris doctoris excellentissimi super pace Constancie. Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Spalte sowie 229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vorliegende Hs. ist eine Vertreterin der Versio vulgata (redazione vulgata), w\u228 \'e4hrend die Inkunabelausgaben eine erweiterte Fassung (redazione \u8222 \'84ampliata\ldblquote ) \u252 \'fcberliefern (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L'esemplare, S. 77-79). \endash  Druck: verglichen mit GW M48739 = BSB-Ink U-44: (Nr. 1) Bl. a2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -n2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (Nr. 2) Bl. o2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -o8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , (Nr. 3) Bl. n2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -o1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; zu den Inkunabelausgaben s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incunabula Nr. 95-102 S. 277f. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Savigny\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geschichte 6, S. 240f.; Ernst A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Laspeyres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u220 \'dcber die Entstehung und \u228 \'e4lteste Bearbeitung der Libri feudorum. Berlin 1830, S. 107-112; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handbuch 1, S. 273, 327; Gero \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dolezalek\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , I commentari di Odofredo e Baldo alla Pace di Costanza, in: La pace di Costanza 1183. Un difficile equilibrio di poteri fra societ\u224 \'e0 italiana ed impero. Bologna 1984 (Studi e testi di storia medioevale 8), S. 59-75, bes. S. 68-70 (ohne diese Hs.); Cristina \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Danusso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ricerche sulla \u8222 \'84Lectura feudorum\ldblquote  di Baldo degli Ubaldi. Mailand 1991 (Pubblicazioni dell'Istituto di Storia del Diritto Italiano 16), S. 20 Nr. 16 (Hs. genannt); Vincenzo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L'esemplare di dedica e la tradizione del testo della Lectura super usibus feudorum di Baldo degli Ubaldi, in: Ius commune 27 (2000), S. 69-117, hier S. 77 Anm. 22, S. 111 Nr. 21 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Colli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Le opere di Baldo, S. 74-77; Mario \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Montorzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L\rquote \u8222 \'84Intellettualismo pratico\ldblquote  della \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Lectura super usibus feudorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  di Baldo degli Ubaldi. Tra prassi forense e nuove sistemazioni dottorali (prove e problemi di lettura), in: Baldo degli Ubaldi, S. 205-261; Cristina \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Danusso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Baldo e i Libri feudorum, in: Baldo degli Ubaldi, S. 289-311; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lange/Kriechbaum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 789f.}

