\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 estio disputanda proponitur sub hac uerba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. forma): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Statuto cauetur quod fenerator post quinquennium non audiatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hec dicta sunt salua prius cuiuslibet melius intuentis correptione. Deo gracias. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De ista questione publice de iure respondit magne sciencie atque omnis uirtutis uir singularis dominus Albertus Nini de Guidalidoctis de Perusio sub domino Baldo de Perusio iuris utriusque doctore catredam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iuris ciuilis Padue ordinarie legente sub annis domini Millesimo trecentesimo sectuagesimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. septuagesimo) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 octauo in vigilia Beatissime uirginis domine nostre de mense Marcii ad honorem et laudem ineffabilis uirtutis dei et saluatoris nostri Yhesu Christi et dicte virginis alme et ad honorificenciam magnifici domini, domini Francischi domini Paduani inclite domus Carrigenorum ducis octavi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sapientissimi. Deo gracias. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW M17012 = BSB-Ink R-137, Bl. 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung.: Leipzig, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. Haen. 15}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Neapel, BN, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. 95 (IV. H. 21.)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 393\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; Vatikanstadt, BAV, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. lat. vat. 2693}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: Biografia degli scrittori perugini e notizie delle opere loro. Bd. 1, ed. Giovanni Battista \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vermiglioli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Perugia 1829, S. 112-143, hier S. 142 Nr. XXXI. \endash  Zu Alberto di Nino di Lello de\rquote  Guidalotti s. Lodovico \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zdekauer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Tre lettere di M. Alberto Guidalotti, lettore allo studio di Perugia a M. Bartolomeo di Biagio, lettore allo studio di Siena, in: Bullettino senese di storia patria 5 (1898), S. 288-298; Domenico \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Maffei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Baldo e Alberto Guidalotti fra Perugia e Padova. Con altre notizie, in: Baldo degli Ubaldi, S. 17-24.}

