\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de duobus fratribus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de duobus fratribus super diuisione bonorum ipsorum per d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bartulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 H\u8249 \'8bIc tractatus de duobus fratribus simul habitantibus principaliter diuiditur in duas partes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quandoque enim inter eos contenditur de his, que in uita patris contingunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 54-153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et Ia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cobus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Arena l. Si pater ff. De donationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 39.5.34). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic est finis tractatus Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [toli] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et incipit quedam additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quarto (!, vielm. quarta) q[uestio] principalis, quid de fructibus quesitis ex bonis paternis per filium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic deficit quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [uestio] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 principalis d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [toli] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pie memorie, quia ipse morte preuentus non potuit complere, sed do\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [minus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ja\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cobus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Are\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [na] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro complemento d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oli] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 posuit addicionem infra proximam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11-153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus Balduinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Summula de fratribus insimul habitantibus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sepe hactenus dubitatum est et questiones orte sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 infra De donacionibus et l. Sensuales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Censualis, C. 8.53.7 oder 54) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hec sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ja\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cobus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Arena hec ad Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolum]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit additio secundum Bal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad tractatum de duobus fratribus editum per Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolum]. \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q\u8249 \'8bVero, quid si filius impendit circa personam patris, eo viuo, an recuperet a coherede}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vltimo vide omnino istam materiam in l. Si patruus, C. Communia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 utriusque iudicii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 3.38.4)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Baldus de Perusio. Deo gratias matrique eius gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Spalte leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung aus dem Freisinger Bestand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6573}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 1) Druck: GW 3665 = BSB-Ink B-200, Bl. d9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -e3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (ohne Zusatz); VD16 B 576, Bd. 10, S. 311-315. \endash  (Nr. 2) Druck der Summula: Andrea \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Romano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La \u8222 \'84Summula de fratribus insimul habitantibus\ldblquote  di Iacopo Baldovini. Studio sul ms. Uppsala, Univ. Bibl., C. 560, in: Rivista di storia del diritto italiano 48 (1975), S. 123-170, hier S. 166-170, 164 (Hs. genannt). \endash  (Nr. 3) Druck: VD16 B 576, Bd. 10, S. 317-321. \endash  Lit.: Camillo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fumagalli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Il diritto di fraterna nella giurisprudenza da Accursio alla codificazione. Turin 1912 (Nuova collezione di opere giuridiche 173), S. 102 Anm. 1 (Hs. genannt); Francesco \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Calasso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: DBI 6 (1964), S. 640-669, hier S. 654f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Casamassima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iter Germanicum, Nr. 118,IV, S. 142f. (Hs. genannt); CALMA 2, Nr. 115 S. 153; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lange/Kriechbaum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 793.}

