\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Bartolus de Saxoferrato}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De ordine iudiciorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus quidam breuis d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omini] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [toli] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de ordine iudiciorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 H\u8249 \'8bEc sunt, que de iudiciis frequentantur et fiunt. Nam primo aditur iudex competens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , citatur reus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod si actor plene non probat, vincit aliter, absoluitur reus, vt C. De eden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [do], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 l. Qui accusare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 2.1.4) (mit Zusatz) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et probatur in l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ege] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nali] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 C. De rei uen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dicatione] (C. 3.32.28) \u8230 \'85 \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de ordine iudiciorum compositus per d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [omnium] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolum]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gratias matrique eius gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
