\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Lignano de bello incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rex Israhel}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8249 \'8b }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 mutauit habitum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85 (III Rg 22,30). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Israhel est solium domini}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et, ut scribitur Jheremie iii\u176 \'b0 capitulo, vocabunt Israhel solium domini et hoc est patrimonium sancte romane ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et simili modo habetur solutio premisse q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [uestionis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 loquendo de iure lombardo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [ut] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 supra. Deo gracias agamus matrique eius gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tractatus de bello compilatus per me, Johannem de Legnano de Mediolano, minimum utriusque iuris doctorem in studio Bononiensi anno domini Millesimo ccc lx\u176 \'b0, pendente forti exercitu contra ciuitatem, qui causam dedit tractatui ut scolaribus tunc foret causa exercicii, doctorum autem subiiceretur correctioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur tabula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ractatus iste de bello prima sui diuisione diuiditur in tres partes principales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [an] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et quando in duello lis dicatur contestari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finitur feliciter tabula precedentis tractatus. Deo gratias matrique eius gloriose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer (bis auf Kollationsvermerk, s. Ausstattung).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW M14264, M14267, M14271 = BSB-Ink I-487; Tractatus de bello, de represaliis et de duello by Giovanni da Legnano, ed. Thomas Erskine \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Holland\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Washington 1917 (The Classics of International Law 8), S. 71-205. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 261 Nr. 7; John P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 McCall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The writing of John of Legnano, in: Traditio 23 (1967), S. 415-437, hier Nr. 16 S. 423; Egidio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gianazza\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La vita e le opere di Giovanni da Legnano (Sec. XIV). Parabiago 1975, Nr. 19 S. 95 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Giorgio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D'Ilario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Vita e opere di Giovanni da Legnano. Legnano 1983 (Arte e storia 4), S. 74 (Hs. genannt).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \par}

