\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Angelus de Castro}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super quinto libro Decretalium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (Seitentitel) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De accusa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tionibus]. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 1: Textanfang defekt; ||\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per Osti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ensem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in summa, \u167 \'a7 Quis accusare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Henricus de Segusio, Summa aurea). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In glosa fi[ne] opponitur pro ill[i]us expedicione, quod ymmo fatuatur reus licet non fuerit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  legittimus accusator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si quis\u8249 \'8b (X 5.1.2). A denunciacione\u8249 \'8b Repellitur is, qui non premonuit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex hoc tex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tu] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 colliguntur tria dicta. Primum usque ibi Postquam, secundum ibi vsque ad Primates cause\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Bemerkung zu Castros Vorlesungst\u228 \'e4tigkeit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic dominus Angelus fecit digressionem et hoc maxime contemplacione scolarium, qui ipsum rogauerunt, ut dignaretur legere et continuare ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tentia] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [communicationis] (X 5.39) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum aliis sequentibus post istum usque in finem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.41) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et eleganter usque in finem libri expedit faciens uacaciones profesto resurrectionis dominice in vigilia palmarum, que fuit die 9 aprilis 1446 et finitis vacacionibus scilicet ipso die 26 prelibati mensis rediuit ad titulum De magistris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.5), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ubi prius dimisit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 11.41, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non prohibetur clericus prestare pro iure spirituali supra ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulo] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 proximo Cum clerici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 5.40.19) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et hoc intendit hic glosa ii quam vide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tur]. \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo. Angelus de Castro 1446 9 aprilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Darunter von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hellers}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste liber est mei Johannis Heller vtriusque iuris doctoris canonici ecclesie Frisingensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Im Fu\u223 \'dfschnitt Eintrag mit Datierung, wohl von Heller: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 xiii aprilis anno etc lxxii\u176 \'b0}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 X 5.1.1-41.11. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  GQ 2, S. 331; Giuliana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D'Amelio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , in: DBI 22 (1979), S. 223-225 (auch zur hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung, Hs. genannt)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 119-123 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iohannes Heller, S. 85f. und Tav. II (Hs. genannt); Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r040 (ohne diese Hs.).}

