\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -416\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Tudeschis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super primo libro Decretalium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. 2 (Rubrik) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec rubrica \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 potest ad precedentia et ad sequentia sic continuari. Tractaturus auctor de iure premisit Rubricam De sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [ma] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [nitatis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 sui operis fundamento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Canonum\u8249 \'8b (X 1.2.1). Constitutiones canonum ab omnibus sunt servande uel sic Juris canonici statuta omnes ligant}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (414\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Tit. 43.14, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hoc quoque pretermittendum non est cum tribus sequentibus et ut mortem euitemus perpetuam post temporalem, concedat nobis altissimus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  von der Hand Hellers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Panormitanus super primo libro decretalium explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Darunter eigenh\u228 \'e4ndiger {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Besitzvermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Iste liber est mei Johannis Heller arcium et vtriusque iuris doctoris Canonici ecclesie Frisingensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  416\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -416\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 X 1.2.-1.6; 1.29-1.43. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Nicolaus de Tudeschis verfasste nach den bekannten hsl. Textzeugen keinen Kommentar f\u252 \'fcr X 1.7-1.28; zu diesem Befund vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Pennington\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Panormitanus\rquote s Lectura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 369 und Anm. 27 (Hs. genannt). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash  Druck (ohne X 1.7-1.28): GW \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 M47854 = BSB-Ink T-510; M47806 = T-511; M47867 = T-512; M47836 = T-513; M47800 = T-514; M47874 = T-515; M47828 = T-516; M47841 = T-520; M47967; M47951 = T-523. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  Lit.: S\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 chulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 312f. Anm. 5 (ohne diese Hs.); Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lefebvre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 DDC 6 (1957), Sp. 1195-1215;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handbuch 1, S. 381; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r450, Nr. 01 (Hs. genannt).}

