\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Repeticio l. De quibus ff. De legibus domini Lauri de Palasoliis iurisutriusque doctoris Paduani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D\u8249 \'8bE quibus. Lex ista multum alta et famosa est, presertim propter commentarios}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hic factos per doc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tores]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et non minus difficilis est quam materia statutorum secundum Rapph\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ae]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [um Fulgosium] \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia nemo presumitur falsum deponere, De probati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [onibus et praesumptionibus], [l.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quociens \u167 \'a7 Qui dolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 22.3.18.1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 secundum Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in dicta l. Labeo, que racio est subtilis secundum Bal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et finita die lune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
