\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus conciliorum generalium domini Anthonii Rosellis de Arecio vtriusque iuris doctoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A\u8249 \'8bltam materiam et cottidianam conciliorum generalium tractaturus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo queritur, quid sit concilium et vnde dicatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ita intelligo istam profundissimam materiam cum protestacione, qua me refero ad determinacionem sancte matris ecclesie, si in predictis in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 aliquibus aliter determinaret. Deo laus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis tractatus conciliorum generalium editus per famosissimum vtriusque iuris monarcham d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anthonium Rosellis de Arecio et ordinarium iuris canonici alme vniuersitatis Patauine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  313a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Sigle nach Weitz: MII. \endash  Druck: Tractatus ex variis iuris interpretibus collectorum 2. Lyon 1549, Bl. 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 147 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Traktat, S. XIV, 38 und passim (Hs. genannt).}

