\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica de edilicio edicto et redibitoria. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Continua istam Rubricam sicut dictum est supra De contractibus et de emptoribus et vendicionibus rerum (D. 18.1). Sed iste acciones}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , scilicet redibitoria et quanto minoris et in factum redibitoria, sunt veluti quasi pedisseque et famule earum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 L\u8249 \'8babeo scripsit (D. 21.1.1). Diuiditur in tres partes: Primo ponuntur verba Labeonis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , pro quibus rebus hoc edictum competat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (167a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u167 \'a7 22, unteres Drittel von 167a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  sowie oberes Drittel von 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  unbeschrieben, mit Hinweis Hellers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic non est defectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) l. 65 (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u167 \'a7 1.2, (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cetera quantum ad istam materiam nouiciorum et veteranorum vide, que dixi in dicta l. Precipiunt ediles supra e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [o] (D. 22.1.37). \endash  (Z. 4) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quia cunctis in rebus prospere et feliciter peractis, solent ingentes gracie summo creatori nostro referri, ideo ego Bartholomeus Cippola de Verona, iuris vtriusque doctor in secundo anno mei doctoratus hic Padue publice vobis legens iura ciuilia, postquam hunc titulum De edilicio edic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [to] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ff valde vtilem et cottidianum et per neminem plene commentatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui ex humanitate sua clementissima mihi hoc anno millesimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quadringentesimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 xlviti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 stipendium seu salarium de suis propriis fortunis ac suo proprio motu mihi dare dignatus est. Laus Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -196d\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 D. 21.1. \endash  Druck (samt Kolophon): Venedig 1550 (EDIT 16 CNCE 12577); Bartholomei Cepollae Commentaria in tit. ff. de aedilitio edicto. Lyon: Jacopo Giunta, 1550. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, Hs. genannt S. 67, 153, 157; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Iohannes Heller, S. 81f.; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 CALMA 1, Nr. 3 S. 706; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lange/Kriechbaum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  2, S. 847; weitere Lit. s.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6585}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

