\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -291\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Angelus de Castro}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitio in X 3.26.16}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Angelus de Castro vtriusque iuris doctor, ordinarius iuris canonici vniuersitatis Paduane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Raynutius, De t}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [estamentis]. }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In bonis patris, matris et avie habet quis terciam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  [debitam] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 iuris nature}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , qua priuari non potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In ea tamen Trebellianica computantur fructus post litis con\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [testationem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 percepti. H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [edit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diuiditur in tres principales partes. In prima narrat factum coram papa narratum per remedium appositum usque ibi \u8218 \'82Cum autem\lquote  circa medium litere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 34) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In tex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tu] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ibi \u8218 \'82de Clera\lquote  illa de Clera erat mater Raynucii et ab ea Raynu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tius] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 denominabatur ideo forte, quia erat nobilis domina sepius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 45) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 breuissime ex scriptis aliorum aliqua rescribemus, quantum ergo ad uulgarem substitutionem de quinque principaliter solet dubitari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; vgl. Hellers Randbemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota hic materiam vvlgaris substitucionis tractari per septem folia usque ibi \u8218 \'822\u176 \'b0 principaliter glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nostra hic tetigit De pupillari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote . \endash  (272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 19) Tractatus de substitutione pupillari; vgl. Hellers Randbemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota hic tractari de pupillari substitutione per octo folia vsque ibi \u8218 \'82Tercio et principaliter tangit glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nostra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote . \endash  (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 4) Tractatus de substitutione exemplari; vgl. Hellers Randbemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit tractari de substitutione exemplaria per duo folia vsque ibi \u8218 \'824\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et principaliter glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa nostra]\lquote . \endash  (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 11) Tractatus de substitutione compendiosa; vgl. Hellers Randbemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit tractari de substitutione compendiosa per sex folia vsque ibi \u8218 \'82Quinto et ultimo\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 12) Tractatus de substitutione breviloqua (mit Randbemerkung Hellers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic vltimo incipit tractari de substitucione breuiloqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quinto et ultimo tangit glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sa] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 principaliter de substitutione breuiloqua, que est quando testator instituit plures et eos invicem substituit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ortum casus est in l. Cum hereditas ex causa fideicommissi ff.\plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [senatus consultum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 trebellianum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 36.1.37). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et sic est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die Verfasserschaft des Angelus de Castro ist nicht gesichert. \endash  Lit. (Hs. jeweils genannt): \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 123; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Iohannes Heller, S. 88; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dies.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Diffusione, S. 384f. Anm. 69 und 73; Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r040, Nr. 10.}

