\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Textanfang defekt: ||{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 autem Romuli - et multitudinis habencium aliquo modo se ad inuicem eam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que ab illo est cognicionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. cognationem) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed sufficiunt eciam hec ad discretionem eorum, que dicta sunt conmunitatisque traditionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Porph\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [yrii]\u8249 \'8b. \endash  Kommentar: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) erster Eintrag (vgl. Druck S. 6 Z. 13): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic comparat hos duos modos generis ad inuicem penes eorum duplicem differentiam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum capitulum, in quo determinat de specie et diuiditur in duas partes principales, in quarum prima premittit secundas accepciones speciei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) letzter Eintrag (vgl. Druck S. 31 Z. 20): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Excusat se a determinacione aliarum communitatum et proprietatum vniuersalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
