\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ut diccionum origo ad derivacionum iuuenibus magis manivestetur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , alique ponende sunt regule deriuationum terminatorum declaratiue. Quarum prima est hec: Omne nomen terminatum in -ris, -rus, -gus, -nis, -bis, -lis, -x et -osus determinat de se nomen abstrac\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 tum in -itas\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ex quo hoc obstaculum solum contemptum (?) est per informationem iuuenum, quibus hec dicta sufficient}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Daran: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Optandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, f\u252 \'fcr notandum?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod sunt octo regule de nominibus naturalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li315\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 47 Regeln zur Wortbildungslehre. \endash  Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bursill-Hall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Census, S. 164 Nr.48.13, 176 Nr.192.2, 312 Nr. 44.}

