\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Lignano}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de pluralitate beneficiorum ecclesiasticorum}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus domini Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Lig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nano] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de pluralitate beneficiorum ac dispensacione super ipsis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et an ecclesiam vt domina possit quesita de bonis ecclesie vendicare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et an in dubio presumantur quesita de bonis ecclesie. Et fuit editus ad instantiam pape Vrbani quinti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Reuocatur in dubium cottidianum numquid de iure communi possit quis habere duo beneficia ecclesiastica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alias in legatis uel inter viuos donatis statur, c. Requisisti De testa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mentis] (X 3.26.15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW M14275, M14275 = BSB-Ink I-489; M14282; TUI 15,1, Bl. 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 John P.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1  McCall\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , The writing of John of Legnano, in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Traditio 23 (1967), S. 415-437, hier S. 421, 433f. (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Egidio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Gianazza\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , La vita e le opere di Giovanni da Legnano (Sec. XIV). Parabiago 1975, S. 113 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 . / Giorgio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 D'Ilario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Vita e opere di Giovanni da Legnano. Legnano 1983 (Arte e storia 4), S. 161f.; Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r361 No. 6.}

