\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus de Cipola de Verona vtriusque iuris doctor et nunc ordinarius iuris ciuilis vniuersitatis Paduane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica De vsucapione pro emptore vel transaccione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In glosa rubrice ibi De iure agendi dic s[upra] sibi (!, vielm. ibi) De actionibus et ob[ligationibus] (C. 4.10) [in glossa] ibi \u8218 \'82Nunc defendendi\lquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Mancipia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (C. 7.26.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Furtum commissum impedit usucapionem. H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [edit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus potest rem suam non usucaptam aliquocumque vendicare. H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [edit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Concor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dat] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 l. Inciuilem, supra De furtis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 6.2.2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et l. i, supra Vbi in rem actio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [exerceri debet] (C. 3.19.1) \u8230 \'85; (225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 26.1.2-9; (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 27.1, 3; (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 28.1; (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 29.1-4; (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 30.1-3; (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 31.1; (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 32.1-4, (235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ll. 5-7, jeweils mit Subskription: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tholomeus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cipolla de Verona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, 8-12; (239\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 33.1, Auth. post l. 1 (Nov. 119.7-8), 2-12; (243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 34.1 mit Subskription: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tholomeus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cipolla de Verona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b, 2-5; (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 35.1-8; (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 36.1-2; (247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 37.1-3; (249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 38.1-3; (250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 39.1-6, 7 \u167 \'a7 2, (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) wohl Textabbruch: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pene modo, quod aliquo tempore fue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [rit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 presens, aliquo absens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ||; Rest der Seite leer; (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Fortsetzung mit l. 7 \u167 \'a7 4.5.6.7, 8 \u167 \'a7 3, 9; (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 40.1-3; (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 41.1-3; tit. 42.1, (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Laus deo. Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tholomeus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vtriusque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [iuris] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scolaris repeti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [v]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 it istam l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [egem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Padue et fuit prima lex, quam legit in studio Paduano conductus 1444\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u176 \'b0; (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tit. 43.1-8, Auth. post l. 8, (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ne distrahatur per libellos seu peticiones, ar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [guit] l\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Ne in plures ff. De exer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [citoria actione] (D. 14.1.2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et ar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [guit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in l. In commodato \u167 \'a7 fin. ff. Commodati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [vel contra] (D. 13.6.17). \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jacobus de Cipolla vtriusque iuris doctor materiam prescriptionum vti supra Padue legit extraordinarie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  280a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -280e\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
