\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tractatus Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [annis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Calderini de ecclesiastico interdicto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]vamuis dubia plurima circa materiam ecclesiastici interdicti pocius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (korr. aus primo) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 papalem determinacionem quam magistralem solucionem exposcant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum inter uos concesse ipsi ecclesie a Christo, cui est honor et gloria per infinita secula. Amen. Johannis Calderini tractatus de ecclesiastico interdicto explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -307h\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  sowie 308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
