\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Episcopus quidem sue ecclesie prepositum spoliauit decimis, quas idem prepositus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et sui antecessores recipere et leuari consueuerunt sue prepositure nomine. Prepositus agit restitutorio iudicio tam contra episcopum quam contra certos decanum et canonicos alterius ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur vtrum spoliatus restitucionem petens titulum habeat probari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 allegare enim titulum et probari eo dumtaxat se extendit, nisi tanti temporis allegetur prescripcio, quod memoria in contrarium non existit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -309a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

