\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 II q vi super Glosa summe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Glo[sa] ista summe notabilis est singularis, ad quam cottidie remittimur continens totam formam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et materiam appellacionis. Et diuiditur in xii partes. Primo quid sit appellacio. Secundo quid appellet. Tercio ad quem appelletur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tam extendit pactum autem et condicio ad futuram, cum erunt ut rex natura, glosa est ii in c. Ex multiplici in v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [erbo] \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 clamauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  (X 3.30.3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Per hec remanet expeditus iste vtilis tractatus ad laudem viuentis dei et eius gloriose matris virginis Marie. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite leer.}

