\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Boethius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De disciplina scolarium, cum commento}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Assit principyo Sancta Maria meo. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aristoteles scribit in secundo de anima: Actus actorum sunt in paciente et disposito}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  (Z. 26) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Modo vnumquodque scire arbitramur, cum causas eius cognoscimus et quoniam illius sunt cause: Causa efficiens est Boecius, senator Romanus, qui eciam fecit librum de consolacione philosophye. Causa materialis siue subiectum est aptitudo recipiendi cognicionem discipline et sciencie et veritatis a doctore. Causa formalis est duplex: forma tractatus et forma tractandi. Forma tractatus consistit in ordinacione parcium illius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Causa finalis est duplex: finis intra et finis extra. Finis intra est cognitio omnium eorum, que docentur in hoc libro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tytulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [talis] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit libellus de scolastica disciplina editus a Boecio et supponitur diuersis partibus philosophye, scilicet quod loquitur de diuersis acquisicionibus sentenciarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Z. 37) Kommentar: (Prolog 1-4) \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vestra nouit intencio\lquote . Iste liber, cuius subiectum est aptitudo recipiendi sciencias}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , et diuiditur in duas partes. Primo ponit prohemium et secundo prosequitur ibi \u8218 \'82Cum indiscreti\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 41) I.1-18; (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 37) II.1-14; (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 23) III.1-12; (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 7) IV.1-22; (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 24) IV.23-35; (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 24) V.1-10; (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 33) VI.1-10; (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 44) VI.11-34; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 49) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Licet prima\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnde secum ultimi infamie mutabitur in vicium et maliciam et sic patent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit exposicio super Boecium De disciplina scolarium. Amen. Quis hoc scribebat, Johannes nomen habebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition (Grundtext): Pseudo-Bo\u232 \'e8ce: De disciplina scolarium. \u201 \'c9d. crit., introd. et notes par Olga \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weijers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leiden 1976 (Studien und Texte zur Geistesgeschichte des Mittelalters 12), zum Kommentar S. 18 Nr. 3 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Teils mit textlichen Parallelen zu den Kommentaren: 1. Uppsala, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 C 925}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weijers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 18 Nr. 2), 2. Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. 5410}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Weijers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 22 Nr. 11).}

