\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 S. Maria de Nave sive Synoptica Relatio Sacrae Beatissimae Mariae Virginis prorsus miraculose ipsorum Angelicorum Spirituum ministerio per Istrum fluuium translatae Ecclesiae in Sossau. Est in Boiaria \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 !\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inferiore ad decurrentis Istri ripas non plus vno die Ratisbona Bavariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...\endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  digna, quam inhabitent tam sanct\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 i lares. Jesus et Maria. Finis.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Windbergae 2. Aprilis Anno 1677. In absentia Domini abbatis subscripsit et signavit conventus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Daneben eingeklebtes Oblatensiegel des Konvents in Windberg.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fr. Joseph \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [Wolfwiser?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et totus Conuentus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
