\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titel: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Arsatius Prunner Monacensis IC XC}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Iesus Christus?]. Darunter Verse: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Nr. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 12817, 16459. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ratio hominis doctor. Ego Arsatius Prunner Monacensis omnia in hoc libro contenta vienne collegi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 //. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 1514  quarto kalendas novembris, Arsatius P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [runner] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Monachiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ..., Verse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad lectorem. Si quis rite velit iuris consultus haberi, continuet studium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec omnia in hoc libro contenta tribus annis Vienne Austriae ab ordinariis inclyte facultatis juridicis inter audiendum collegi non egressus vicesimum annum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 11f\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -11h\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 293\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -294\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. 
