\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Termini Rote. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo presentatur commissio d[omino] auditori, iudici vel commissario et deinde serventur termini infrascripti per ordinem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Initium registri ... In nomine domini Amen. Anno a nativitate eiusdem domini millesimo quadringentisimooctuagesimonono indictione septima die tale pontificatus sanctissimi in cristo etc. anno quinto \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pape cursorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  //, (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) // \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui desuper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et substituendos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  //, (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) // \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 (eosdem suos procuratores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Instrumentum habes in formularium instrumentorum sub verba deputatio. Finito libro sit laus et gloria Christo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  des Drucks f\u252 \'fcr die Abschrift leicht abgewandelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Formularium ex minorum et actissima diligencia raptissime raptum Frisinge per me Sigismundum Warmayr waccalaureum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Wiennensem sub anno dni millesimo quadringetesimononagesimosecundo ultima die mensis octobris sedente Allexandro papa sexto pontifice maxime pontificatus sui anno primo.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabula huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Festa palatii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

