\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prosdocimus de Beldemandis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Compositio et operatio astrolabii}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quia plurimi ob nimiam quandoque accurtacionem et magnam scriptorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sentenciam canones utilitates astrolabii declarantes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Si per astrolabium volueris scire, in quo gradu zodiaci sit sol}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et si contingat regulam cadere in partem puncti, tunc operare vt prius est ostensum. Et sic est finis huius operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expliciunt canones astrolabii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  Rest der Seite und 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Z\u228 \'e4hlung der Canones am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 i c-liii c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Rostock, UB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Mss. Math.-phys. 1}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Arabic astronomical and astrological sciences in Latin translation. A critical bibliography by Francis J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Carmody\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Berkeley u.a. 1956, S. 19 Nr. 14. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Thorndike/Kibre\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 , Sp. 331.5 und 1228.5. \endash  Gra\u380 \'bfyna \plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 Rosi\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 \u324 \'f1\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 ska\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Instrumenty astronomiczne na Uniwersytecie Krakowskim w XV wieku. Breslau u.a. 1974 (Studia Copernicana 11), S. 105f. Nr. 12. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Scientific writings and astronomical tables in Cracow. A census of manuscript sources (XIVth-XVIth centuries. Bd. 1. Breslau u.a. 1984 (Studia Copernicana 22), S. 347f. Nr. 1779. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Zum Verfasser vgl. LexMA 1 (1980), Sp. 1836f.; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Key figures in medieval Europe. An encyclopedia, hrsg. von Richard K. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Emmerson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . New York u.a. 2006 (Routledge encyclopedias of the Middle Ages 13), S. 545f.}

