\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Declaratio arboris consanguinitatis et affinitatis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lectura arboris consanguinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa lecturam arboris diuersis olim diuersum modum tenentibus, quia diuersitatem corporum sequitur diuersitas animorum, \u8230 \'85 Jo[hannes] de Deo Hyspanus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post illas lecturas ipsius arboris nouum modum assumens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed certum est, quod isti distant quinto, quid ergo impediat hos collaterales contrahere, non video. Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 An\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dreae]. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota Enigmata consanguinitatis et affinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . R\u228 \'e4tsel 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nate nepos frater dixit filia sua mater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 2 Verse; daran: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exemplum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ticius ex matre sua carnali concepit Bertam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 mit Schema. \endash  Vers 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sponsum sponsa suum concessit filia matri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 3 Verse. \endash  (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) R\u228 \'e4tsel 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Enigma aliud sequitur iam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Schema mit Erkl\u228 \'e4rung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iterum {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 iste due mulieres dicunt a Iohanne et Jacobo. Ecce isti sunt filii nostri}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quia sumus matres eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic in proprie pro filio fratris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  R\u228 \'e4tsel 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur enigmatis illius theotunicum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Die kint sind vnser kint}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 4 Verse. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lectura arboris affinitatis sequitur. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad arborem affinitatis et eius materiam transeamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo videndum est, quid sit affinitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et precipue studentes continue perseuerent per graciam eius, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. Et sic es finis huius operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Unvollendetes Schema des Arbor consanginitatis, enth\u228 \'e4lt 19 Kreise ohne weitere Beschriftung. \endash  161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer, m\u246 \'f6glicherweise vorgesehen f\u252 \'fcr das Schema des Arbor affinitatis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 1, 3: Druck der Lectura \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Decretum Gratiani, Sp. 1427-1430, 1433-1436. Zu Verfasser und Werk s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  GQ 2, S. 214-216; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stintzing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geschichte der popul\u228 \'e4ren Literatur, S. 151-157; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Coing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Handbuch 1, S. 379; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lange/Kri\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 chbaum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  2, S. 658-665; Bio-Bibliographical Guide, Report No. r339 Nr. 10-11 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  Nr. 2: (R\u228 \'e4tsel 1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Initia Nr. 11586, 17128; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Proverbia Nr. 27453; vgl. auch GW 1704 = BSB-Ink 299, Bl. [b4]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Vers 1) Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Cambridge, Library of Emmanuel College, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 C. M. A. 7 (I. 2. 17)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; London, Library of Lambeth Palace, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ms. 451}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (R\u228 \'e4tsel 3) Vgl. auch GW 1704 = BSB-Ink 299, Bl. [b5]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  Zu den Verwandtschaftsr\u228 \'e4tseln vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stintzing\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Geschichte der popul\u228 \'e4ren Literatur, S. 166-168; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rezeption, S. 51-61.}

