\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [De excommunicatione]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Innocentius in c. Si vero, De sententia excommunicationis requirit ...,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Utrum debeat dari copia omnium notarum contentarum in prothocollo iudiciale producto ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De licito et honesto, (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De iure quesito non tollendo, (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de decimis, de rescriptis, (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de prebendis, (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de litis pendentia, de iure patronatus, collatio, (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de matrimonio, de consumptione gratiae expectativae, (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) narrativa, diligentiarum regula, (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de procuratoribus, pensio, possessio, clausula si ita est, (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) impetratio, incursus, (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) inhabilitas ex incursione, (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ambitio, avaritia, (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) incursus impetrans, (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de paritione rei judicare, (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) excommunicatio per edictum, (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) collator, vocatis vocandis, (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de testamentis, (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) episcopus possit alienare rem ecclesie ..., cardinalatus non est imcompatibile, (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) manualia beneficia, intrusus, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) non obstantes beneficiales, (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) incursus in beneficio viventis, de dispensatione, (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) beneficium litigiosum, (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) specialis reservatio, sententia de consensu partium, (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) reservatio generalis / specialis, regula de annali, possessio quid sit, (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pacifica possessio, (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de obiectu falsitatis, (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) tempus immemorabile, (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) an pensio habeatur loco beneficii, (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) possessio, (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) oblationes, fructus, redditus, terra, dominium Diocesis, (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pensio ex falsa causa, unio, (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nobilitas triplex, (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) resignatio facta post obitum. \endash  136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -137m\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer au\u223 \'dfer (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nota de regimine et administratione prebendarum ecclesie frisingensis.
