\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Forme quarundam supplicationum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ..., (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio simplex; (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) resignatio; (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cessio; (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio prepositurae (Johannes Layman cler. Augustensis dioc.); provisio parochialis ecclesiae (Johannes Lezelter cler. Eystetensis dioc., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 s.o.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio beneficii (Sigismundus Scheufler cler. Frisingensis, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 s.o.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) surrogatio ad ius; (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) perinde valere; (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) licentia permutandi; (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) indultum de studio erigendo in opido Ingelstat Eystetensis dioc. (Ludovicus comes palatini reni Bavarieque dux [1472]); (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio custodiae; rotulus expectativarum (Albertus praepositus Argentinensis et Johannes germani de comitibus palatini reni et bavarie ducibus et eorum dilectis [Albrecht von Pfalz-Mosburg und Johannes, gest. 1486]); (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio si neutri; (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio; (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nova provisio; (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) reservatio pensionis (Gregorius Griespeck Ratisponensis dioc.); (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) antelatio (Fridericus de Wirsperg ex utroque parente de militari genere); (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de contracto scienter (Andreas de Gundelfing et Anna, coniugii Augustensis dioc.); (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) privatio in forma iuris; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensatio de non promovendo (Wolfgangus Sorch cler. Eystettensis dioc.); (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nova provisio (Georgius de Kinsperg); (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) assecutio; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mutatio collationis (Johannes Prepeck cler. Ratisbonensis dioc.); (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) revalidatio (Petent wie vor); (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio (Conradus Lebenter cler. Herbipolensis dioc.); (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio (Wolfgangus Sorch cler. Eystettensis dioc.); (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio; (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) privatio in forma iuris (Johannes de capella cler. Ratisponensis dioc.); (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) unio (Paulus Koler praepositus S. Petri Augustensis); (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) confirmatio concordiae (Johannes Neunhauser decanus Ratisponensis, Georgius de Kinsperg); (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensatio (Petrus Merk et Margareta laici Ratiponensis dioc.); (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de promovendo (Bernardus Artzat cler. Augustensis dioc.); (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de promovendo extra romana curia (Johannes Cappell cler. Ratisbonensis dioc.); (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de coadiutoria parochialis ecclesiae; (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cessio reservationis; (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pensio (Conradus Adelmann canonicus Augustensis [ab 1502]); (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cassatio pensionis; (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) rehabilitatio, (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) provisio cum dispensatione; (169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) prorogatio de non promovendo (Jacobus Artzat cler. Bambergensis dioc.); (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) cessio cum pensione (Leonardus Canzler, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 s.o.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) moratoria; (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) resignatio et unio (Georgius de Ortenberg Frisingensis dioc.); (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) confirmatio unionis (monasterium Novacella prope muros Frisingae, ecclesia s. Blasii in Eberstorff Pataviensis dioc.); (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de non residendo; (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) conservatoria pro monasterio in forma militanti (monasterium in Kaysheim o.Cist. Augustensis dioc.); (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pensio (Johannes de Wirsperg canonicus Ratisbonensis); (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensatio (Georgius de Trautenberg Ratisbonensis dioc.); (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) perinde valere; (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensatio (Daniel Ruche cler. Maguntinensis dioc.); (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensatio (Wernherus de Auffes Herbipolensis dioc.); (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensatio de consanguinitate (Sebastianus Paumgartner et Genofa Casturrin Ratisbonensis civitatis); (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de promovendo extra tempora (Leonardus Cantzler, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 s.o.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Abschriften von Suppliken, die Datierungen wurden zumeist ausgelassen, sind jedoch zeitlich auf ca. 1472 bis kurz nach 1502 einzugrenzen; viele Formulare sind anonymisiert, falls Namen der (ganz \u252 \'fcberwiegend s\u252 \'fcddeutschen) Petenten vollst\u228 \'e4ndig genannt werden, sind diese oben in Klammern hinzugesetzt. }

