\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 N\u8249 \'8beminem omnium, qui preclarum aliquid, sciteque scriptum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de re p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ublica] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tradiderit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum Lacedemonem solam ex omni vestutate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!, vielm. vetustate) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 legamus ad sexingentos vix annos liberam euasisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 45) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quoniam omnis bene ac beate uiuendi constitutio necesse est a iusticia velut a fonte virtutum omnium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  sed multo eciam illustrior beatiorque reddatur. Ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis dei eiusque matri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [s] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 beatissime intemerate virginis Marie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen.
