\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Invectiva in Georgium Trabesuntium pro defensione Guarini. Andreas Agazo Paulo Regino sa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lutem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [icit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [lurimam]. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tuorum nequaquam mandatorum oblitus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , cum primum hanc regum urbem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sed enim incautus homo id non accusat quod est accusandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (15. M\u228 \'e4rz 1437).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Collectanea Trapezuntiana. Texts, documents, and bibliographies of George of Trebizond, ed. John \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Monfasani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Binghamton, N.Y. 1984 (Medieval and Renaissance texts and studies 25; Renaissance text series 8), Nr. CXXVII B, S. 364-365 Z. 26, S. 861 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Zu Andrea Agazo, einem Sch\u252 \'fcler des Guarinus Veronensis, vgl. Epistolario di Guarino Veronese. Bd. 3: Commento, ed. Remigio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sabbadini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Venedig 1919 (Miscellanea di storia Veneta. Ser. 3,14), S. 342.}

