\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amatorum paruum siue precepta amandi extracta e Pamphilo ad Gelatheam. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exercere (vielm.: Exercet) corda iuuenum Venus ingeniosa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 at tuus interea militet ignis michi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  |\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vale et me ama carumque habe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
