\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Buridanus nacione Picardus perspicacis vir ingenii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , dum in alma vniuersitate Parisiensi regeret in collegio Nauarre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui horas canonicas pro ea in euum decantare ascripti sunt. Finit hystoria Buridani per licenciatum Parisiensem de eius vita inscripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
