\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 M.T.C. TOPICA AD G. TREBATIUM incipiunt. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maiores nos res scribere ingressos, C. Trebati}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , et hiis libris, quos breui tempore satis multos edidimus, digniores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ornamenta quedam uoluimus non debita accedere. Finiunt feliciter MTC Topica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: M. Tulli Ciceronis Scripta quae manserunt omnia 1,2: Continens De oratore libros, Brutum, Oratorem, De optimo genere oratorum, Partitiones oratorias, Topica, recognovit Carl F. W. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gulielmus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Friedrich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1891 (Bibliotheca scriptorum Graecorum et Romanorum Teubneriana), S. 424-449.}

