\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 247\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tabula partium rhetoricae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Invencio: diffinicio, particio, collectio, iudicacio. Hec omnia iudicacionis materia sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Facultas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in factis et dictis, que sunt in iudicio uel questione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rethorica, id est artificiosa eloquencia, que est oratoria facultas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (I,6); \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 in factis et dictis, que sunt in actu et opere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Genera rerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 judiciale: maiestatis, suus iustus, repentendarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 demonstratiuum: laus uel uituperacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 deliberatiuum: bellum, pax\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (I,7). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quinque genera causarum: honestum, admirabile, humile, anceps,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  obscurum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I,20); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 judiciale, demonstratiuum, deliberatiuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I,8). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Partes materie uel rhetorice: inuencio, depositio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. dispositio), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 elocucio, memoria, pronunciacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I,9).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Schemata f\u252 \'fcr den Rhetorik-Unterricht auf der Basis von Cicero, De inventione, lib. I, 6-9, 20.}

