\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Somnium Ciceronis M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [arci] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ullii] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et exerptum ex libro sexto de re publica feliciter incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [Scipio]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum in Affricam venissem Anicio Manlio consule ad quartam legionem tribunus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ille discessit; ego sompno solitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. solutus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Marci Tulii Ciceronis de somno Scipionis explicit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: M. Tulli Ciceronis Scripta quae manserunt omnia 39: De re publica librorum sex quae manserunt. Septimum recognovit Konrat \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ziegler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Leipzig 1969 (Bibliotheca scriptorum Graecorum et Romanorum Teubneriana), S. 126-136.}

