\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Epistola pulchra. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sumopere hoc mihi cordi est, amicorum optime, ut in dies meis de rebus te faciam cerciorem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vale et hec, que scripsi ne palam fiant tecum obserua. Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Entner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Fr\u252 \'fchhumanismus (s. 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 79f. Nr. 39. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Worstbrock\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Neue Schriften und Gedichte (s. 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 122 Nr. 50 (Hs. genannt).}

