\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oracio illustrissime Yppolite Marie ducis Mediolanensis filie habita coram summo pontifice Pio secundo. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tantam esse huius sancte sedis autoritatem ac maiestatem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 faciam hiis sanctissimis pedibus tuis commendatos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Mantua, Juni 1459). \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Responsio pontificis maximi ex templo reddita. Habuisti, dilecta filia, coram nobis orationem elegantem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tibi vero deus benedicat et nos benedicimus tibi. Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
