\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quattuor evangelia cum prologis et glossis marginalibus et interlinearibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Im Kopfsteg: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prologus Mathei\u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9bM\u8249 \'8batheus ex Iudea sicut in ordine primus ponitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Pr\u233 \'e9faces Nr. XIII 6, S. 170f.; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 5710, 5896. \endash  Marginalglosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diuiditur secundum quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [olaum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Lira in quatuor partes. In prima describitur Ewangeliste status, in secundo scribendi modus ibi \u8218 \'82Duorum in generacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in quo populus est gubernatus per judices, secunda in tempore, quo gubernatus est per reges, tertia in tempore, quo gubernatus est per sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch. Druck: Bl. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Abschnitt Be. \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 6) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 atheus volens transire ad conuersionem gentilium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 euidentibus signis. Cum autem plures\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || Textabbruch, stammt nicht aus dem Prolog, sondern aus der Postilla des Nicolaus de Lyra zum Prolog (Druck: Bl. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Gu-Gy); Rest der Seite sowie 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Mt 1,1-28,20. \endash  Marginal- und Interlinearglossen: 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , darunter von Hand 1: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1-5 zu Mt 6,2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad cuius intellectum sciendum, quod aput Iudeos vtebantur tubis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut patet in littera, cum dicit: Ut honorificentur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Druck: Bl. 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Cf); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 26-40 zu Mt 26,36) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gethsemani est nomen uille, sita in pede uel in radice montis Olyueti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 introiuit ipse etc Johannis xviii\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Dh); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 21-41 zu Mt 26,39) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et progressus. Hic ostenditur Christi desiderium ad nostram redempcionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et venit ad discipulos suos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Fa-Fc). \endash  54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -54a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 3-12 zu Mt 26,67) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde Bernardus: Alii dabant palmas in serrenissimam faciem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sine aliqua pietate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps.-Beda Venerabilis, De meditatione passionis Christi per septem diei horas libellus; Druck: PL 94, 564A); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 13-33 zu Mt 26,67) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde Bernardus: O uere obprobrium hominum et abieccio plebis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tamquam preuaricator legis, ut nostram mortem sua morte necaret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Nicolaus de Gorran, Commentaria in quatuor evangelia; Druck: VD16 N 1536, Bl. CCCCLXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  F). \endash  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus Marci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Arcus ewangelista dei electus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Pr\u233 \'e9faces Nr. XIII 6, S. 171f.; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Mc 1,1-16,20. \endash  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus Luce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (Z. 1) Lc 1,1-4; (Z. 8) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 L\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cas Syrus nacione Antiocensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Pr\u233 \'e9faces Nr. XIII 6, S. 172; (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8) Lc 1,5-24,53; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit Interlinearglossen. \endash  (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ic est Iohannes Ewangelista unus ex discipulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bruyne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Pr\u233 \'e9faces Nr. XIII 6, S. 173; (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Io 1,1-21,25; mit Marginal- und Interlinearglossen, darunter von Hand 1: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  zu Io 18,20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic ponit Christi responsio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uel suspecta, sed sana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hz); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  zu Io 18,23) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed videtur, quod Christus fecit hic contra doctrinam suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec detur occasio mala male agendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Druck: Bl. 237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Ab-Ac); (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt ewangelia Johannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die von Glossenhand 1 begonnenen und von Hand 1 ab 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  fortgesetzten Glossen stammen nach stichprobenartiger Pr\u252 \'fcfung mehrheitlich aus der {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Postilla super totam Bibliam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Der in fl\u252 \'fcchtiger Schrift m\u246 \'f6glicherweise nachgetragene Kommentar von Glossenhand 2 konnte nicht identifiziert werden. \endash  Druck: Biblia Sacra cum Glossa ordinaria \u8230 \'85 in libros Matthaei, Marci, Lucae, Iohannis. Cum glossis, interlineari et ordinaria, Nicolai Lyrani Postilla et Moralitatibus, Burgensis Additionibus et Thoringi replicis. Bd. 5. Lyon 1545.}

