\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In presenti Registro inuenies, vbi quamuis epistola uel ewangelium anni queri habeat, in biblia quotto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 libro sit et capitulo et vbi eius principium sit vel finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De tempore. \endash  (305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De sanctis. \endash  (306\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Commune de sanctis. \endash  (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kolophon: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Explicit Registrum super lectiones siue epistolas et ewangelia de tempore et de sanctis. S[criptum per] Herum Stainer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -312\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
