\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Miniatur des Evangelisten Iohannes. (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Argumentum: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic est Io\u8250 \'9bhannes evan\u8249 \'8bgelista, unus ex discipu\u8249 \'8blis Dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 doctrina seruetur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt Capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 resurrectio eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung am Rand bricht nach \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b ab. (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Johannesevangelium. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In principio erat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 scribendi sunt libros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Parallelstellen in Mt, Lc, Mc (wohl von Schreiberhand) am Rand vermerkt.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
