\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hyginus M. Fabio plurimum (korrig. in plurimam) salutem. Etsi te studio grammaticae artis inductum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...\endash ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rerum demonstrabimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: lib. 1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De mundi appellatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mundus appellatur is qui constat ex sole et luna et terra}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 2. Zeile von unten) lib. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed quoniam que nobis de terrae positione dicenda fuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 8) lib. 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Igitur Incipiemus a polo boreo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 8. Zeile von unten) lib. 4: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam initio spherae circuli V quomodo efficerentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 annum uoluerunt esse cum sol ab estivo circulo. Explicit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Schriftproben und Titel (11. Jh.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hyginus in astrologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
