\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardinus Senensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De contractibus et usuris}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de contractibus et vsuris secundum fratrem Bernardinum de Senis ordinis minorum. Et primo ponitur ordo dicendorum in materia dictorum contractuum et vsurarum. Sabbato post terciam dominicam in Quadragesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 U\u8249 \'8bAde et amplius \u8230 \'85 (Io 8,11). Et in ewangelio hodierno. A caritate quidem labitur mundus et per viciorum deficit incrementa partim ex ignorancia ruens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schriftl\u252 \'fccke im Umfang von einem Bl., ohne Textverlust (s. Druck: S. 271f.). \endash  (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a quo tremendo iudicio misericorditer nos eripiat inmensa pietas saluatoris, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8250 \'9bExplicit tractatus de contractibus et vsuris secundum beatum fratrem Bernhardinum de Senis ordinis sancti Francisci. Padue scriptus a me Jo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [anne] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ha}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [senbeyn] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Wormaciense anno M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 l\u176 \'b0\u8249 \'8b}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1450).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Auszug aus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Quadragesimale de evangelio aeterno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , sermo 32-45. \endash  Druck: Bernardinus Senensis. Opera omnia, ed. Pacificus M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Perantoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 4: Quadragesimale de evangelio aeterno, Sermones XXVII-LIII. Indices tomorum I-V. Quaracchi 1956, S. 117-416; vgl. auch Bd. 3: Quadragesimale de evangelio aeterno, Sermones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf19 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -XXVI. Quaracchi 1956, S. XXXIV Nr. 81 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Lit.: Dionysius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pacetti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De sancti Bernardini Senensis operibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ratio criticae editionis. Quaracchi 1947 (Commissio operibus s. Bernardini Senensis edendis praeposita 1), S. 23 Nr. 32-S. 25 Nr. 45 (ohne diese Hs.); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Diffusione, S. 385 Anm. 78 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Necchi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Una silloge, S. 127.}

