\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardinus Senensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De vita christiana. Sermones I-III}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus de vita christiana secundum fratrem Bernhardinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8250 \'9bS\u8249 \'8bObrie et iuste}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (Tit 2,12-13). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Christiana vita, de qua}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  [ad] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 presens tractaturi sumus, lex est eterna temporaliter promulgata, diuine voluntatis ostensio \u8230 \'85}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 31) Sermo I; (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo II; (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo III; (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ista gratia nihil aliud est quam gloria sempiterna, quam ex pietate et propter pietatem largiri dignetur nobis piissimus dominus Yhesus Christus, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Bernardinus Senensis. Opera omnia, ed. Pacificus M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Perantoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 6: Tractatus \u8222 \'84De vita christiana\ldblquote , \u8222 \'84De B. virgine\ldblquote , \u8222 \'84De spiritu sancto\ldblquote  et \u8222 \'84De inspirationibus\ldblquote , \u8222 \'84De beatitudinibus evangelicis\ldblquote . Quaracchi 1959, S. S. 20-61 (Hs. genannt S. 18* Nr. 26, S. 31* Nr. 36). \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pacetti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De sancti Bernardini Senensis operibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ratio, S. 28-31 (Hs. genannt S. 28); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Diffusione, S. 385 Anm. 78 (Hs. genannt).}

