\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica de iurisdiccione omnium iudicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I\u8249 \'8bus dicentis (D. 2.1.1). Iudicis officium est generalissimum comprehendens omnia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , que iudex facere potest. Et due sunt partes. In prima ponitur dictum, in secunda probacio eius uel in secunda ponuntur quatuor dicta seu exempla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ll. 2-5, 7, 9-14, 16, 18-20; (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 2.2.1-15.16; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur Rubrica De postulando. 1444\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa60\itap0 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 3.1.1, 6-8, 10; (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 3.2.1-3, 6-8, 11, 13-14, 20-23, (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) l. 13 \u167 \'a7 7; (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Istum \u167 \'a7 Pena grauior querere supra in l. Quid ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 3.2.13.7), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quoniam propter difficultatem eius d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Prato ordinarius iuris ciuilis legere distulit vsque ad finem huius tituli. Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Prato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 3.4.1, 3, 6-7; (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 3.5.1-3, 5, 7-8, 10-14, 16, 18, 20-23, 25-27, 29, 30-31, 32 (expungiert), 33-35, 37-38, 40, 42, 44-46, 48; (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 3.6.1, 4-9. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. titulus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) [Repetitio ad D. 3.3] Bemerkung zur Reihenfolge der Titel im Kopfsteg rechts: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De procuratoribus ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tulus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 habitus est extraordinarie extense per d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannem] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 usque in finem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica De procuratoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Prato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Procurator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 3.3.1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primo ponit quis sit procurator, secundo ad quod constituatur, tertio ad quid est vtile usus procuratoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ll. 8, 14-16, 24, 27-33, 35, 37, 39-43, 45-46, 50-51, 54-58, 61, 64-70, 72-73, 75-76, (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) l. 33 \u167 \'a7 2, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 eciam alii repetentes istum \u167 \'a7, sed quia nil dicunt, quod sit commune, ideo obmitto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 D. 2.1.1-3.6.9. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 230 (ohne vorliegende Hs.). \endash  Lit.: s. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Clm 6573}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; B\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 elloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 67, 230 (jeweils Hs. genannt)..}

