\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Repetitiones variarum legum civilium de procuratoribus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus Caepolla}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Repetitio in C. 2.12.2. Im Kopfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolomaeus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cipolla de Verona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (\u220 \'dcberschrift) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Repetiturus l. ii C. De procuratoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima conclusio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Procurator potest interuenire ad plenam defensionem in causa criminali iudicio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 criminaliter intentato, quando sentencia et eius execucio non debet necessario ferri in presentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Antequam veniam ad argumenta, quia primo tractandus est de legittimacione ipsius rei ar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [guit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 l. Si queramus ff. De testamentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 28.1.4) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hodie pena est relegacionis, quia uerberatur et in monasterium detruditur. Aut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hentica] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hodie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 5.17. post l. 7 = Nov. 117, 11). \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Franciscus de Capitibusliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Repetitio in D. 2.1.5. [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 M]ore maiorum (D. 2.1.5). Qui habet iurisdictionem in sua persona residentem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , potest delegare alias secus et morte delegantis re integra extinguitur delegacio. H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [edit] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ege] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sequenti. Diuiditur secundum Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in tres partes: In prima parte ponuntur duo dicta, ex quibus sequitur decisio proposite questionis, vtrum delegatus possit subdelegare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quod est iniunctum et probatur in c. Cum dilectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. dilecta), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De rescriptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.3.22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Franciscus de Capitisbusliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Padua ordinarius iuris ciuilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Franciscus de Capitibusliste}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Repetitio in C. 3.1.5. [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 A] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 iudice, C. De iudiciis. Delegatus non subdelegat, nisi sit legatus a principe}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [edit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod delegatus regulariter non subdelegat, quod intelligatis sane, nisi ordinarius fecisset delegatum cum potestate subdelegandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 communicata in l. More maiorum, ff. De iur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [isdictione] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [mnium] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iudi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [cum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 posita, an istam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || wohl Textabbruch. \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer; 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer bis auf Bemerkung Hellers oben auf der Seite: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod si arbitris fuerit data potestas prorogandi temporis, infra quod laudare debent, partibus intimare debent prorogacionem alias non valebit, ita notabiliter notat Bal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [dus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in l. Eos, \u167 \'a7 Apostolos, C. De appellationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 7.62.6.6) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et vide de hoc, quod notat in l. Diem proferre ff. De arbitris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 4.8.27).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iohannes Heller, S. 76f., 88. \endash  (Nr. 1) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 157 Hs. genannt; CALMA 1, Nr. 6 S. 706; zum Verfasser s. auch Clm 6585, 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  (Nr. 2-3) Zum Verfasser s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 194-199.}

