\uc1
\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Sancto Lazaro}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  et {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paulus de Castro}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super quinto libro Digesti veteris}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Im Kopfsteg von Hellers Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iste titulus de iudiciis ff. est subtilissime et multum extense lectus per egregium vtriusque iuris doctorem d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Johannem de Sancto Lazaro legentem iura ciuilia in felici studio Paduano de anno etc. xliiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica de iudiciis et vbi quis agere uel conueniri possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit secunda pars principalis ff. continens vii libros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vsque ad titulum De rebus creditis secundum diuisionem habitam in l. ii \u167 \'a7 Sed cum omnia, C. De ve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [teri] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iure enuc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [leando] (C. 1.17.2.1) \u8230 \'85; \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si se subiciant\u8249 \'8b (D. 5.1.1). Hanc legem primam scribit dominus Paulus se in Auiniana (Avignon) repeciisse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, wohl recipuisse), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cum esset minor xxv anno, cum ibi consideret cum curia papa Bonifacius. H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [oc] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [edit]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Eius, qui habet jurisdictionem et tribunal vel jurisdictionem tantum, potest iurisdictio prorogari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ll. 1-13, 15-16, 18-24, 26, 28-34, 36, 35, 37, (243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que dici possent vi canonistas in c. Cum dilectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 2.22.9) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et c. Pastoralis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 2.22.8), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in l. Ordinarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (C. 3.32.13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et in l. Iuncti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!, vielm. Naturaliter) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Bar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [tolus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in \u167 \'a7 Nichil commune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 41.2.12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequitur lex \u8218 \'82Quod legatur\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Im Kopfsteg von Hellers Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In ista l. Quod legatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (D. 5.1.38) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 incipit Paulus de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Castro, monarcha iuris vsque ad finem libri, quoniam d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [hannes] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lazaro propter breuitatem temporis titulum hunc De iudiciis suis scriptis, prout incepit, finire non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 potuit. Idcirco ab ista l. Quod legatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 modicum scripsit, quare d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominum] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paulum vsque ad finem huius tituli et ex consequenti ad finem huius libri scribi fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Im Bundsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [aulus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de Castro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quod legatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (D. 5.1.38). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Septiem legatam non tenetur heres tradere nisi in loco, vbi est licet in alio loco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; es folgen ll. 39-50, 52-69, 71-77, 79-82; (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 5.2.1-2, 6, 8, 10-17, 19-27, 29, 30, 31 \u167 \'a7 1.2; (279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 5.3.1, 4-9, 13, 16, 18-20, 22-23, 25, 31-34, 36, 40-54, 57-58; (304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 5.4.1-3, 5-9; (308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 5.5: Rubrik; D. 5.6: Rubrik, (309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia sic daretur ad recuperandum non adipiscendum. Et dicit d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ominus] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paulus istud multum placet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Rest der Seite und 309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 D. 5.1.1-5.6. \endash  Johannes de Sancto Lazaro von Heller h\u228 \'e4ufig in der Subscriptio genannt (u.a. 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). Zu ihm vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Belloni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Professori giuristi, S. 244-246 (Hs. genannt S. 245). \endash  Druck des Kommentars von Paulus de Castro: GW M30063 = BSB-Ink P-66, Bl. t 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -et-K\u252 \'fcrzel [1]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (ohne Textabweichungen).}

