\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Im Kopfsteg oben rechts von Hellers Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De seruitutibus octauus liber ff. veteris. Paulus de Castro monarcha iuris ciuilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De seruitutibus. Rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De seruitutibus subaudi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [de] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 predialibus quas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [i] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vnum predium debet alteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , [sed] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non autem debentur a persona uel persone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seruitutes\u8249 \'8b (D. 8.1.1). Hic ponuntur due species seruitutum et glosa addit duas alias}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; ll. 2-6, 8-11, 13-20; (321\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 8.2.1-2, 4-6, 8-13, 15, 17-18, 20-28, 30-36, 38, 40-41; (328\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 8.3.1-4, 7, 11-15, 17-21, 23-25, 27, 29, 28, 30-32, 33 \u167 \'a7 1, (333\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui allegant istam glosam. Se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [quitur l.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnus ex sociis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. Druck: Bl. con-K\u252 \'fcrzel [4]\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Von Hellers Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Paulus de Castro. Hic nullus est defectus. Sequitur l. Vnus ex sociis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 333\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (334\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Fortsetzung durch Heller ohne Textverlust und -abweichungen vom Druck: ll. 34, 36-38; (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 8.4.1-2, 4-7, 9, 11-15, 17-18; (341\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 8.5.1-2, 4, 6-21; (346\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) D. 8.6.2, 4-8, 10-20, 25, (349\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et nota glo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [sam] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic positam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [hic] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non sunt alia. Sequitur liber ix\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \u8218 \'82Si quadrupes pauperiem fecisse dicatur\lquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  350\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
