\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota varia}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 1-13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota, quod, si festum omnium sanctorum Dominica uel feria ii euenerunt, priuatis diebus ante festum una tamen breuis lectio lege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sequenti nocte uel feria ii ad vigilias incipiatur Ezechiel propheta et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8479 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vidi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Cantus 007875). Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Waddell\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr. 1223; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ma\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u238 \'ee\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 tre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nr. 1245. \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (Z. 14-28) Memorialverse von j\u252 \'fcngerer Hand (15 Hexameter): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Disce per hoc scriptum quid sit uel quando legendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 Nr. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 4536; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RB 11399)}

