\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand F; (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand G; (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand H = Haupthand; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand I; (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 2-6) Hand J; (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand K, au\u223 \'dfer 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z.1-9 von Hand L; (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand M. \endash  Freisinger H\u228 \'e4nde: (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z.3 - 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand E, nach 966; (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 14 \endash  92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand O; (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand P. \endash  Nicht lokalisierte H\u228 \'e4nde (nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Daniel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  in Italien beheimatet): (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand Q, au\u223 \'dfer (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 1-13) von Hand N; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 4-17, 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Z. 4 - 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Hand R. Teilweise rubriziert.}

