\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Alexander de Hales}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa theologica. Liber primus}}
\par \pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit primus liber summe magistri Alexandri de Hallis de ordine fratrum minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvoniam, sicut dicit Boethius in libro de trinitate, optime dictum videtur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Eruditi est hominis vnumquodque, ut ipsum est, ita de eo fidem capere temptare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Q. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sciencia theologie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Inquirentes in primis de doctrina theologie, utrum sit sciencia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \endash  (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Seite leer; Bemerkung des Schreibers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic non est defectus, sed neglegentia scriptoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Q. 74: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De missione inuisibili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85\endash  (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 que pertinent ad inquisicionem sacratissime diuinitatis, id est diuine vnitatis et trinitatis, cui est honor et imperium per infinita secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et sic est finis huius primi libri sentenciarum summata venerabili magistro Allexandro de Hallis.}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Alexandri Alensis Anglici doctoris irrefragabilis \u8230 \'85 universae Theologiae Summa. Bd. 1. K\u246 \'f6ln 1622 (nach dieser Ausgabe die Z\u228 \'e4hlung der in der Hs. ungez\u228 \'e4hlten quaestiones von 1 bis 74 \u252 \'fcbernommen); Doctoris irrefragabilis Alexandri de Hales ordinis minorum summa theologica. Studio et cura PP. Collegii S. Bonaventurae \u8230 \'85 ed. Liber primus. Quaracchi 1924.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20  \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glorieux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , R\u233 \'e9pertoire 2, Nr. 301; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RC 59 (Hs. genannt); Georg \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Steer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \u178 \'b2VL 1 (1978), Sp. 218-220; Christopher M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cullen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Alexander of Hales, in: A companion to philosophy in the middle ages, hrsg. von Jorge J. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gracia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Timothy B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Noone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Oxford 2003 (Blackwell companions to philosophy 24), S. 104-108. \plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 \endash  Zur Authentizit\u228 \'e4t des Werks vgl. Victorin \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Doucet\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 , The history of the problem of the authenticity of the Summa, in: Franciscan Studies 7 (1947), S. 26-41, 274-311; \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Doctoris irrefragabilis Alexandri de Hales \u8230 \'85 Summa 4,1. Quaracchi 1948, S. CCCLVI-CCCLXX; \plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 Christoph \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 eler\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Summa theologica, Gro\u223 \'dfes Werklexikon der Philosophie 2, hrsg. von Franco \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Volpi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Stuttgart 1999, S. 34f. (Zusammenfassung).}

