\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini. Incipiunt tituli questionum primi libri summe magistri Allexandri de Hallis, in cuius prima parte agitur de diuina essencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Q. 1-74, ab q. 3 ohne Angabe der Z\u228 \'e4hlung. \endash  (273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expliciunt tituli questionum primi libri fratri (!) Allexandri de Hallis. Sic laus deo etc}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\u8249 \'8b \endash  Rest der Seite sowie 274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.}

