\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -IIae: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post communem consideracionem de\u8249 \'8b virtutibus et viciis et de alijs ad materiam moralem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pertinentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et sic nichil moralium erit pretermissum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 36-1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17) Q. 1, Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa igitur theoloycas virtutes primo erit considerandum de fide}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de spe, 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de caritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cuius sit fidei symbolum constituere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 17-7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Z. 1) Q. 1, art. 1-10: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad primum sic proceditur, videtur quod obiectum fidei non sit veritas prima}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 auctoritate summi pontifficis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est recepta, vt quasi regula fidei habeatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Q. 2-107. \endash  (272\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Q. 108, art. 1-4: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sicut pro peccato unius turbatur multitudo, ad vnitatem commendandam, vt dictum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Kolophon (expungiert): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sequitur cixa questio que cum sequentibus continetur in alio folumine (!) et cetera}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Von anderer, zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischer Hand: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et sic est finis, la[u]detur deus in sublimis. Pertoldus Z\u246 \'f6tl}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Darunter auf aufgeklebtem Zettel bibliothekshistorische Notiz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 R. P. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Anacletus Reiffenstuel P\u246 \'f6lsensis, Diffinitor, et Lector Jubilatus, vna cum R. P. Francisco Muttner Ingolstadiensi, redeunte de S: Ciuitate Jerosolymitana, Ord: Min: S: Francisci Reform: Prouinciae Bauariae, hanc antiquissimam Bibliothecam in ordinem Alphabeticum redegerunt. Anno millesimo sexcentesimo, octuagesimo septimo, dieque tertio Junii finierunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
