\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipiunt Capitula libri primi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic incipit prologus in compendium theologice veritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ueritatis theologice sublimitas, cum sit superni splendoris radius illuminans}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  intellectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber primus de natura diuinitatis. Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deum esse multis modis ostenditur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 2. \endash  (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 3. \endash  (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 4. \endash  (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 5. \endash  (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 6. \endash  (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 7: (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. \endash  (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus libri septimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finale iudicium quedam sunt antecedencia, quedam quasi concomitancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash  (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ibi influencia deliciarum et confluencia bonorum. Denique de gaudiis celestibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 || [repleat nos dei filius]. \endash  (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Daran: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota uersus: Mens cognoscendo dotatur amando, fruendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 11 Verse. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia Nr. 10896. \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex omnibus premissis collige quedam spectare gaudia solum ad animam, quedam ad corpus, quedam ad coniunctum, que tam felici fine quisque beatus secundum merita recipiet sine fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit hoc opus. Finitur proxima feria tercia ante diem purificacionis Marie anno etc. vicesimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b (30. Januar 1420).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Alberti Magni Opera omnia \u8230 \'85 cura ac labore Augusti \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Borgnet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bd. 34: Compendium theologicae veritatis in septem libros digestum. Paris 1895, S. 1-261. \endash  Lit.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RC 368; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores 1982 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits 6399 (Hs. genannt); Georg \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Steer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hugo Ripelin von Stra\u223 \'dfburg. Zur Rezeptions- und Wirkungsgeschichte des \u8250 \'9bCompendium theologicae veritatis\u8249 \'8b im deutschen Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalter. T\u252 \'fcbingen 1981 (Texte und Textgeschichte 2) Nr. 234, S. 98 (Hs. genannt); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., in: \u178 \'b2VL 4 (1983), Sp. 252-266.}

