\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Alphabetisches Stichwortverzeichnis. \endash  (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praefatio: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 M]artino beatissimo pape Quinto vniuersi gregis Carmelitarum seruorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apostolice sedis minimus Frater Thomas Waldensis quitquid est et pressis labiis satus, semper vestigiis inherere ventus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 1: [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 M]ea doctrina non est mea (Io 7,16). Alma maiestas et iniuncte deitatis ymago spiritus tui feruore concepto}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (41r\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 1: \u8250 \'9b[L]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iber primus de capite ecclesie Ihesu Christo in naturis suis disparibus. Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Prolog 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exurgat deus et dissipentur inimici eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ps 67,2). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exurgat, inquam, deus meus, qui non venit mittere pacem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed gladium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b[A]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rticulus primus contra blasfemias Wicleff ad diuinitatem pertinentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b Kapitelverzeichnis lib. 1; (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum capitulum quod Wilcleff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inficiens logicam scripture sacre asseruit quemlibet creaturam et quidlibet esse deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Actor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 I]n omni disputatione quam fecit uester Johannes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  memorie ter dampnate de formis ydealibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hic non est defectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 2; 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 3. \endash  (244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lib. 4; expl.: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et omnibus carnalibus vite illecebris celestem vitam et eternam preponant. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis lib. 4.
