\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit Peregrinus de sanctis et primo de sancta Andrea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Uestigia illius \u8230 \'85 (Iob 23,11). Dominus uocans Petrum et Andream dixit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 49\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancta Katherina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mulier in celo amicta \u8230 \'85 (Apc 12,1). In verbis istis ostendit s. Johannes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad suum monasterium deportavit. Rogamus etc. dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Peregrinus de sanctis per curriculum anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Repertorium 4, S. 557-563 Nr. 106-108, 110, 111, 113f., 119-122, 124-126, 128, 130, 132, 134-137, 141f., 144-156, 158, 160, 162, 164f., 167, 170, 174, 181, 185, 188. Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt S. 573. \endash  Gilles G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meersseman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Notice bio-bibliographique sur deux fr\u232 \'e8res pr\u234 \'eacheurs sil\u233 \'e9siens du XIV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  si\u232 \'e8cle nomm\u233 \'e9s Peregrinus, in: AFP 19 (1949) 266-274, zur Hs. S. 269.}

