3, S. 265 Nr. 594-596 (Jacobus de Voragine); \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ascendit in arborem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 19,4). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ascendam in palmam}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u8230 \'85 (Ct 7,8). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Palma enim angusta est inferius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, \u228 \'e4hnlich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 7, S. 632 Nr. 272; \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium 3, S. 859 Nr. 532 (Iordanus de Quedlinburgo); (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schreibervermerk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Scripti sunt hii sermones celeriter per Erhardum Ottenhofer Anno XXVIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1428).}

