\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb195\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f2\b\i\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes de Friburgo}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa confessorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota quod lector iste Johannes ante compilacionem huius summe confessorum fecerat tabulam super summam Raymundi et apparatum eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus fratis Johannis lectoris in priorem libellum questionum casualium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvoniam dubiorum noua cottidie difficultas emergit casuum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog 2: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit alius prologus eiusdem fratris Johannes leccoris in summa confessorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Saluti animarum et proximorum vtiliti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tabula titulorum; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 1: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit summa confessorum compilata a fratre Johanne lectore ordinis fratrum predicatorum. Titulus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam inter ecclesiastica crimina symoniaca heresis optinet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 primum locum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 2; (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 3; (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) lib. 4, expl.: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gratias ago domino Ihesu Christo, qui colleccionis me laborem ad animarum salutem tam de penitentiis quam de matrimoniis hic conclusit, cui est honor in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Statuta ex sexto decretalium addita: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt statuta summe confessorum ex sexto decretalium addita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ne libri, qui de summa confessorum iam scripti erant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , apposicione statutorum a domino Bonifacio summo pontifice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui legis uerba complectens contra legis nititur uoluntatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit compendiosa colleccio quorundam statutorum ex sexto decretalium addita ad summam confessorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tabula super summam confessorum: (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus tabule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In hac tabula vbicumque fit simpliciter libri uel questionis aut remissionis assignacio intelligendum est de ipsa summa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tabula fratris summam confessorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: GW M13587 = BSB-Ink I-565. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schulte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , GQ 2, S. 420-422 Nr. 3-6. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Scriptores Nr. 2343 (Prolog 1), 2344 (Summa, Hs. genannt), 2345 (Statuta). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Incipits Nr. 54 (Tabula), 4938 (Prolog 1), 4965 (Summa), 5256 (Prolog 2; Hs. genannt, Signatur falsch). \endash  Marlies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hamm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Entstehungsgeschichte der \u8218 \'82Rechtssumme\lquote  des Dominikaners Berthold, in: Die \u8218 \'82Rechtssumme\lquote  Bruder Bertholds. Eine deutsche abecedarische Bearbeitung der \u8222 \'84Summa confessorum\ldblquote  des Johannes von Freiburg. Untersuchungen I, hrsg. von Marlies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hamm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /Helgard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ulmschneider\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . T\u252 \'fcbingen 1980 (Texte und Textgeschichte 1), S. 35-114, hier S. 35-42. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Johannes von Freiburg, in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 4 (1983), Sp. 606-611, hier Sp. 606f. (Korrektur der bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kaeppeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  angegebenen Drucke). \endash  Die \u8222 \'84Rechtssumme\ldblquote  Bruder Bertholds. Eine deutsche abecedarische Bearbeitung der \u8222 \'84Summa Confessorum\ldblquote  des Johannes von Freiburg. Synoptische Edition der Fassungen B, A und C, hrsg. von Georg \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Steer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /Marlies \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hamm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Bde. 1-8,2. T\u252 \'fcbingen 1987-2006 (Texte und Textgeschichte 11-14, 16-18,2), Bd. 16, S. XXIX-XXXV.}

