\pard\keep\keepn\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb195\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theologische Schemata}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Trinitas creata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 memoria patri, ratio filio, voluntas spiritui sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Trinitas increata: eternitas patri, veritas filio, bonitas spiritui sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Peccatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 auersio ab eterno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 superbia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 conversio ad corruptibile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad proprium conuersio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 accidia, ira,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 luxuria,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad alienum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inordinate appetendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  = \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 auaritia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inordinate fugiendo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [= invidia]. \endash  187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Zwei theologische Schemata: 1. \u252 \'fcber die Wirkungen der Trinit\u228 \'e4t (u.a. contritio/confessio/satisfactio, fides/spes/caritas, defluxio/influxio) sowie 2. zur Gliederung der sieben Tods\u252 \'fcnden. \endash  Textliche Parallelen zu Bernardus Claraevallenis, Sermo 46: De varia trinitate, dei scilicet et hominis, aus: Sermones de diversis. Druck: PL 183, 667B-669B.}

