s {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://6560[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Exlibris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  der Dombibliothek ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://6560[0].6770/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Warnecke Nr. 559}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ).}

