\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dyalogus de intellectu discursivo et racionativo qui alio nomine dicitur liber de consolacione theologie Magistri Johannis Gersonis Cancellarii parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tabula breuis in libro de consolacione theologie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In prohemio nontantur (!) quatuor cause}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tabula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b. (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prohemium in librum de consolacione theologie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quecumque scripta sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Volucer sic incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Text: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Primum metrum primi libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sepe peregrinus volucer transmissus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 consolationem scripturarum spem habeamus, Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber de Consolacione theologie magistri Johannis Gersonis cancellarii parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b.
