\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Questiones Roberti Holquot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Utrum quilibet viator existens in gratia assenciendo articulis fidei mereatur vitam eternam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch 2: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n distinctione prima secundi libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch 3: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt questiones super 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  librum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \u8230 \'85, (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch 4: \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt questiones super 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Queritur utrum baptismus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tamen nihil eligit etc. Explicit lectura fratris Roberti Holquote ordinis fratrum predicatorum magistri in theologia super quatuor libros sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Mit Einschub (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sex sunt articuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ydolo quod adorat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , RC 738). \endash  (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tabula quaestionum. (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tabula alphabetica (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abraham \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Xpus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit tabula super totum hoc opus. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Text mit fortlaufender Quaestionenz\u228 \'e4hlung (q. 1-18); Buchaufteilung entspricht der Redaktion 2a, s. Heinrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schepers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Holkot contra dicta Crathorn, in: Philosophisches Jahrbuch 77 (1970), S. 320-354, hier S. 333f. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RC 737 (Hs. genannt). \endash  Richard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sharpe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A Handlist of the Latin writers of Great Britain and Ireland before 1540. Turnhout 1997, S. 555f. (Hs. genannt). \endash  Druck: GW 12890 = BSB-Ink H-310. \endash  Teiled. (nur lib. 2 q. 2): Seeing the Future, S. 112-195 (Text der Hs. verk\u252 \'fcrzt, expl. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 fuerunt confirmati, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ed. S. 177 Z. 1371); zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung des Textes hier S. 36-38.}

