\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus Sancti Ambrosii episcopi Mediolanensis in epistolam beati Pauli apostoli ad Galatas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad Ephesios, (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad Philippenses, (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad Thessalonicenses I-II, (243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad Colossenses, (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad Titum, (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad Timotheum I-II, (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad Philemonem, (286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec subscriptio apostoli est confirmantis epistolam missam. Explicit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [epistola] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad Philemonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  320\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
