\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedictus qui venit in nomine domini \u8230 \'85 (Mt 21,9). Ewangelium quod in prima dominica aduentus legitur secundum breuiarium Pathauiense}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  habetur eciam in dominica palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum venerit paraclitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Io 15,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Salvator noster uolens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nec forte noscere tenebantur etc. Explicit prima pars sermonum magistri N Tinkenspuchl doctoris sacre theologie sub anno domini m\u176 \'b0 32\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [1432]. Grundbestand: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, S. 130-145 Nr. 1-20, 22, 21, 23, 25-29, 31-49. \endash  Eingeschobene sermones: (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de s. Johanne ev., \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 243 Nr. VI; (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de purificatione BMV, de annunciacione BMV, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 215-218 Nr. I und II,1-2; (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) in nativitate domini, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 205-211 Nr. 1, 2, 3a, 3b, 4; (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tractatus de poenitentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Titel laut Randvermerk 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 180-182 (de tribus partibus poenitentiae) Nr. 1-15; (228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) in die pasche, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 212 Nr. II. \endash  264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
