\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominica prima in aduentu domini. Incipit Anthonius Parmensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum appropinquasset \u8230 \'85 (Mt 21,1). Tempus quod hodie incipit et durat usque ad natiuitatem domini}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt sermones quadragesimales de feriis et dominicis compilati per fratrem Anthonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 14{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum Ieiunatis \u8230 \'85 (Mt 6,16). Sciendum est quod tempus quadragesimale, quod hodie incipit, est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tempus jeiunii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85, (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 93{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum subleuasset \u8230 \'85 (Io 6,5). Quere supra dominica quarta in quadragesima et cetera}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expliciunt sermones de omnibus dominicis totius anni et de omnibus feriis quadragesime compylati per fratrem Anthonium Parmensem ordinis fratrum predicatorum per manus Wilhelmi Lochner anno domini etc. LXXXXVo in vigilia annunciacionis beate virginis hora vesperarum vel quasi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (24. M\u228 \'e4rz [13]95). Schreibervers (geschw\u228 \'e4rzt): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Detur pro penna scriptori pulchra puella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia Nr. 5527a). \enda