\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Teil 2: Formularius judicialis vicarii episcopi. \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Infrascripte forme pertinent ad vicarium episcopi. Ad regulandam penitentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Conradus canonicus et vicarius in spiritualibus ecclesie Frisingensis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Cum propter delinquencium animositatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 Aufbau: (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) amonitiones, (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) citationes, (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) excommunicationes, (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensationes, (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) praesentationes ad ecclesiam, (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) communicationes, (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) pro petenda absentiam, (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ad congregandam elemosinam, (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de promotione, (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de indulgentiis, (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de electione abbatis, (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de ordinatione, (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de synodo, (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) de beneficiis, (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) dispensationes, (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) excommunicationes, (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24