\pard\keep\keepn\fi-870\li870\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Heinrich von Berching}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura super officio misse}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Prolog: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Quoniam clamitat\u8249 \'8b sapiens, quod perscrutator maiestatis oprimetur a gloria (vgl. Prv 25,27). Idcirco nemo existimet hoc officium sufficienter expositum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 hauriemus in gaudio de fontibus saluatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Collatio: \u8250 \'9b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Domine non sum dignus\u8249 \'8b (Mt 8,8). Ad reliquias preciosas non debet homo accedere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  nisi cum reuerencia et timore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 si occurrunt talia et circa hoc tria tota lectura et tractatus uersabitur deo dante et annuente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (3\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Capitulatio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Diuiditur autem iste tractatus in tres partes questionum, quod primo agemus de quibusdam precedentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ut ex diuersis capitolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 colligi potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Pars 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Primo dicitur sacramentum circa huius nominis declaracionem notandum, quod Scotus in iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [libro], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 distinctione iiii, questione ii, sic diffinit sacramentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (vgl. Duns Scotus, Ordinatio, lib. 4, dist. 1, pars 2, \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 q.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1-2,\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ed. in: Duns Scotus, Op. om. (Vat.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  11, S. 61-88) \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 de quo Sinneon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 dixit: Lumen ad reuelacionem gentium et gloriam plebis tue Israhel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Lc 2,32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Et hec de prima parte sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Pars 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Expedita prima parte principali, ubi agitur de quinque antecedentibus, nunc est agendum de septima parte principali scilicet de ipsum sacramentum perficientibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 qui adhuc computare non cessant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Pars 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Sequitur tercia pars principalis, quo dicitur oblacio, dicto de duabus que pertinent ad formam, que sunt preparacio et instruccio, nunc agendum est de tercia, que uocatur oblacio et hec pars continet sex partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fideles eciam reuertuntur, dum de carceris ergastulo liberati in glorie libertatem eripiuntur. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit lectura bona et vtilis super officio misse lecta per Reuerendum magistrum Heinricum de Perching, sacre theologie professorem, pronuntiata per Johannem Swab de Butzpach anno domini 1407 et ante festum natiuitatis Christi ffinita. Ffinitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 tamen est presens liber anno domini 1408 post festum palmarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b. \endash  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Item presens Edicio dici potest sew appellari Nouella, ut recolo idem nomen, per editorem ipsius in aula quadam ipsi libello fuisse inpositum ac nominatum, ex ipso aliquod in deductionem vnius articuli allegando. Nominetur ergo in dei nomine Nouella magistri Heinrici de Perching\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 Die Messauslegung geht ohne Nennung der Vorlage in weiten Teilen auf die Expositio missae des Dominikaners Bernardus de Parentinis zur\u252 \'fcck, w\u228 \'e4hrend Teil 2 bei den Abschnitten zu Credo, Pr\u228 \'e4fation und Hochgebet (Canon missae) durch zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Qu\u228 \'e4stionen erheblich erweitert wurde (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf18 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 , Messe, S. 527; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf18 Hilg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 ). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf18 Franz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 , Messe, S. 502-506, 523-527. \endash  Hardo \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf18 Hilg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf18 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 VL 3 (1981), Sp. 695f. \endash  Zur akademischen Laufbahn Heinrichs von Berching vgl. Erich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf18 Kleineidam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18 , Universitas studii Erffordensis. \u220 \'dcberblick \u252 \'fcber die Geschichte der Universit\u228 \'e4t Erfurt im Mittelalter 1392-1521. Bd. 1: 1392-1460. Leipzig 1964 (Erfurter theologische Studien 14), S. 268 Nr. 9. \endash  \plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs20\cf18 T\plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs20\cf18 \u345 \'f8\u237 \'ed\u353 \'9a\plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs20\cf18 ka,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18  Repertorium, S. 165 (dort mit \u228 \'e4lterer Lit.). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u352 \'8a\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 mahel, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Prager Universit\u228 \'e4t, S. 276.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf18  \endash  Zu Johannes Swab s.o. Abschnitt zur Geschichte.}

