\pard\keep\keepn\fi-870\li870\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quaestio de operibus extra caritatem factis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Definitio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Carena est penitentia publica satisfactiua secundum canones}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  instituta ad iei\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 u\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 n\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ndum in pane et aqua per xl\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  dies et septem annos. Et dicitur carena secundum glosam ordinariam Extra de sponsa duorum, c. accepisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (X 4. 4.2): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 A careo cares, quia tales penitentes debent carere consortem hominum. Item secundum katholicon dicitur a caritas, quod est gratia, quia sic penitentes ponuntur in statum gracie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Quaestio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Queritur, vtrum opera extra caritatem facta sint alicuius boni meritoria}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Et arguitur quod non per illud Ewangelii: Si oculus tuus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Mt 6,23) \u8230 \'85 \endash  (322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 20) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Pro ista questione primo ponam aliqua notabilia recitata per magistrum Johannem Januensem in katholicon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 29-322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 27) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quantum ad primum noto, quod meritorium proprie dicitur accio, que efficit ut ei qui agit sit iustum aliquid dari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et ad aswetudinem bonarum et eciam ad plura ut patet in sequentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Thomas de Aquino, Super sent. 4, dist. 15, \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 q.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1, art. 3, q\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 uaestiuncula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  4 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1 co.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ). \endash  (322\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 32-323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 13) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Noto tercio, quod opera facta in caritate et si transeant actu manent tamen quantum ad meritum in dei acceptcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 que mortua nata fuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Johannes Januensis, Catholicon, s. v. Caritas; Druck: GW 3182\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\cf1  = \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 BSB-Ink B-8). \endash  (323\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Z. 14-324\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Quantum ergo ad secundum de effectibus illis peruenientibus ex operibus extra caritatem factis. Noto, quod opera bona extra caritatem facta non sunt totaliter perdita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ex illis omnibus simul collectis potest faciliter responderi ad quesitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Aufgef\u252 \'fchrt werden zw\u246 \'f6lf Wirkungen der nicht aus N\u228 \'e4chstenliebe get\u228 \'e4tigten Werke.}

