\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (362\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 In nomine sancte et individue trinitatis patris et filii et spiritus sancti. Amen. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Ego Paulus dictus Cholner clericus Ratisponensis inter omnes decretorum licenciatos minimus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash  (362\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Septies in die laudem \u8230 \'85 (Ps 118,164). Hec verba habentur originaliter psalmus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  C\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  xviii et est in xxi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  octenario\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 et laudes assiduas decantemus nunc in euum et in honore illius qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (370\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 : \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit tractatulus de horis canonicis dicendis valde vtilis ffinitus Prage 1408 in quadragesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .\u8249 \'8b
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
