24 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epigrammata illustrium virorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Contra loquacitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De muneribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De subditorum odio uel beneficio in principem et e contra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 11\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De hiis qui dampnati sunt in publico magistratu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 12\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De loci mutacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De variis penarum generibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 14\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De coitus continencia uel incontinencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 15\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De cena et compotacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De maledictis aduersus alios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 17\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De magnanimitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De secretis manifestandis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 19\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Prudenter dicta aut facta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 20\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De fide et perfidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 21\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De magnanimitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dedignandum non esse ab vno quoque ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [d]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 iscere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De legum obseruancia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 24\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De vicinia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 25\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De imperatore exercitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8249 \'8b \endash  \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 26\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plai